    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Bendak Starkiller</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Humans"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Taris"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Bendak Starkiller was a famous Death Match Duelist that lived on Taris. He had a three hundred credit bounty on his head, put up by the government, for all the people he had killed.
Bendak Starkiller could be found in the Upper City Cantina, but would only accept a challenge from the best duelists on Taris.

</ns5:abstract>
