    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Corellia"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Hylo Visz</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/263px-HyloVisz-TOR.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Defender-class_light_corvette"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Hylo Visz was a smuggler and an unlikely hero of the Great Galactic War. She tried to break the Mandalorian Blockade with a group of other smugglers. When the attempt looked all but defeated, the Republic joined the fight and broke the blockade. It is assumed that she died a year after that event.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Females"/>
