    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Star Chamber is a Space station located in the Null Zone, it served as the headquarters for a secret organization called the Star Cabal. During the Cold War, Imperial Intelligence agent Cipher Nine infiltrated the hidden space station and assassinated the leaders of the Star Cabal.


