    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Makeb is a playable planet in Star Wars: The Old Republic, added with the Rise of the Hutt Cartel expansion. It was invaded by the Hutt Cartel.
Shalim Avesta created a local militia loyal to the Galactic Republic.

</ns5:abstract>
