    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Ark is a massive starship built by the Hutt Cartel. The vessel was commissioned by Toborro the Hutt to escape Makeb's volatile atmosphere while carrying a colossal payload of the recently discovered power source, Isotope-5.

</ns5:abstract>
