  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Davik_Kang">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Davik Kang was a crime lord with The Exchange who was based on Taris. He was the original owner of the Ebon Hawk. Davik was killed by Revan during the Sith bombardment of Taris. His top three men (starting from best to third best) were: Canderous Ordo, Calo Nord, and Holdan.

</ns5:abstract>
