  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darth_Voren">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Darth_Viktus_Profile.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Revan"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Neo-Crusaders"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Darth Voren</rdfs:label>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Empire_(Jedi_Civil_War)"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Fallen_Jedi"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Empire_(Jedi_Civil_War)"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Onderon"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith"/>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Order"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Revanchists"/>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Darth Voren</ns1:name>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Voren Renstaal</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Voren, originally known as Voren Renstaal, was a male Human who served Darth Revan's Sith Empire as a Sith apprentice. Renstaal was originally a member of the Jedi Order and he joined the Revanchists following the First Battle of Onderon, which saw his Jedi Master fall in battle.
During the Mandalorian Wars, a conflict that erupted in 3,976 BBY when the Mandalorian Neo-Crusaders began an invasion of the Outer Rim Territories, Renstaal fought alongside Revan and Malak as they worked to stop the Mandalorian threat and return peace to the Outer Rim.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darth"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Humans"/>
    <ns1:faction rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Order"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_apprentice"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Voren, originally known as Voren Renstaal, was a male Human who served Darth Revan's Sith Empire as a Sith apprentice. Renstaal was originally a member of the Jedi Order and he joined the Revanchists following the First Battle of Onderon, which saw his Jedi Master fall in battle.
During the Mandalorian Wars, a conflict that erupted in 3,976 BBY when the Mandalorian Neo-Crusaders began an invasion of the Outer Rim Territories, Renstaal fought alongside Revan and Malak as they worked to stop the Mandalorian threat and return peace to the Outer Rim.
Following the conclusion of the Mandalorian Wars in 3,960 BBY, the Revanchists reformed to become Revan's Sith Empire. Renstaal became an apprentice and took up the Sith title "Darth", renaming himself as Darth Voren. The Empire began an invasion of the Galactic Republic, and Voren was assigned to serve aboard Revan's flagship. In 3,957 BBY, the ship was attacked by the Galactic Republic, and Voren encountered a Republic strike team in the ship's Security Command center.

</ns5:abstract>
