    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Companions are non-player characters that the players are able to recruit to accompany them on their adventures. Each companion character has special skills that unlock over time as they level-up alongside the player character.
Companions are able to fill the role for a group in a Flashpoint or group quest.
They cannot be used in an Operation, however .

</ns5:abstract>
