  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic:_Knights_of_the_Eternal_Throne">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Star Wars: The Old Republic: Knights of the Eternal Throne</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic:_Knights_of_the_Fallen_Empire"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/EA_International,_LTD."/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Expansions"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Star Wars: The Old Republic: Knights of the Eternal Throne is the sixth expansion to the massively multiplayer online roleplaying game (MMORPG), Star Wars: The Old Republic, set in the Old Republic era and the fourth paid expansion. It is currently being developed by BioWare, a division of Electronic Arts, and is scheduled for release in the fall months of 2016. The expansion serves as a continuation of the events of Star Wars: The Old Republic: Knights of the Fallen Empire, but players do not have to complete the previous expansion to have access to the new Eternal Throne storyline.
The new expansion is rumored to follow the same month-by-month chapter release format as Knights of the Fallen Empire, but it is unclear as to whether a large group of chapters will be released at the expansion's release as was the case previously. The expansion will feature nine chapters instead of the sixteen that were present in Knights of the Fallen Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/KOTET_Teaser.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageExternalLink rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Expansions"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Star Wars: The Old Republic: Knights of the Eternal Throne</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/BioWare"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/KOTET_Teaser.jpg"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Star Wars: The Old Republic: Knights of the Eternal Throne is the sixth expansion to the massively multiplayer online roleplaying game (MMORPG), Star Wars: The Old Republic, set in the Old Republic era and the fourth paid expansion. It is currently being developed by BioWare, a division of Electronic Arts, and is scheduled for release in the fall months of 2016. The expansion serves as a continuation of the events of Star Wars: The Old Republic: Knights of the Fallen Empire, but players do not have to complete the previous expansion to have access to the new Eternal Throne storyline.
</rdfs:comment>
