    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Located in an unspecified star system within the Outer Rim Territories, Vaiken Spacedock, whose namesake was Imperial Grand Moff Odile Vaiken, serves as the most identifiable space station of both the Imperial Navy and Sith Empire as a whole, as well as the primary staging port of the Imperial Expeditionary Fleet.

</ns5:abstract>
