    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Ybann is a Hutt Baron-Surgeon of Lenico Colony Blue, a space station orbiting Lenico IV. At some point in 3,643 BBY, Ybann and another fellow Hutt, Qiltakka, were held up in a Hutt Cartel Safe House, which was later breached by Darth Baras's apprentice, who later killed the two Hutts.


</rdfs:comment>
