    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Battle meditation is a rare force ability that allows the user to bolster the morale, stamina and battle prowess of the users followers, alternatively some dark side users have been known to twist it and make the opposing armies lose the will to fight.

</ns5:abstract>
