  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Arbiter">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">An arbiter was a legal detective and lawyer on the planet Manaan. The job of the arbiter was to research what happened in the case and defend their client according to the evidence they had found.
Revan was appointed arbiter when he travelled to Manaan with Jolee Bindo.

</ns5:abstract>
