    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Liberator-class starfighter, also known by the Sith Empire as the Talon-class starfighter, is a model of starfighter used by the Galactic Republic before and during the Great Galactic War, Cold War and Second Great Galactic War.

</rdfs:comment>
