    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">A Padawan is a member of the Jedi Order who has been identified as being a Force-sensitive and has passed a very basic set of Jedi trials. The title applies to these students who have both passed this initial stage and who have been assigned to a Jedi Knight or Jedi Master as a personal apprentice. All new Order initiates are considered Padawans, regardless of age, species or gender.

</ns5:abstract>
