    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Forris</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Forris was a male Human Trooper, who served the Galactic Republic and Republic Army during the Cold War with the Sith Empire. Stationed on the planet Ord Mantell, Lieutenant Forris trained an unidentified Trooper from Havoc Squad. 

</rdfs:comment>
