  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Force_sense">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/wookieepedia"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Force sense</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Force_sense.png?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">sensed</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Force_sense.png"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Force_sense.png"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Force sense</rdfs:label>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Force sense</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">through the Force</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Force sense is among the most basic of Force abilities. It could be used to feel another being's feelings, the future, ripples in the Force caused by momentous or traumatic events, impending danger and the presence of the dark side. A more concentrated, more directed form of this ability is likely how Jedi and Miralukas are able to see others without relying on their physical senses.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">with the Force</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Force sense is among the most basic of Force abilities. It could be used to feel another being's feelings, the future, ripples in the Force caused by momentous or traumatic events, impending danger and the presence of the dark side. A more concentrated, more directed form of this ability is likely how Jedi and Miralukas are able to see others without relying on their physical senses.


</ns5:abstract>
  </rdf:Description>
