    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Sleeper ship was an interstellar vessel capable of achieving faster than light travel, via a rudimentary dimensional drive, while it's inhabitants were kept in a state of suspended animation, as typical light speed made travel between distant stars last for decades or centuries.

