    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/expand"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en"> Internal Damage is one of four Damage Types most commonly found in Star Wars: The Old Republic. Internal Damage refers to any damaging effect that inflicts corrosion, bleeding or any damage done to the target's body or internal organs. Internal Damage, along with Elemental Damage, is one of two damage types that cannot be mitigated by Armor Rating.</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Damage_Types"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Game_Mechanics"/>
