    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Fatman, also known as Red Dwarf, was a heavily modified XS Stock light freighter owned by Zeerid Korr. During it's existence, it was used for the smuggling and transport of illegal goods, mostly for the Exchange. It was heavily modified for speed, outrunning many Imperial vessels during it's last cargo run.

</ns5:abstract>
