  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Blade-class_starfighter">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Old_Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Blade-class starfighter</ns4:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Blade-class starfighter</rdfs:label>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Starfighters"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Blade-class starfighter was a crescent shaped starfighter by the Sith Empire during the Great Hyperspace War. They were very fast and highly maneuverable, the Blade-class shared the common lack of shielding with it's counterpart, the Sith Starfighter. Blade-class starfighters were also piloted by Force sensitive pilots. </rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Starfighter</ns1:type>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Great_Hyperspace_War"/>
    <ns1:manufacturer rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sith shipyards</ns1:manufacturer>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Lore/Starships"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Blade-class starfighter was a crescent shaped starfighter by the Sith Empire during the Great Hyperspace War. They were very fast and highly maneuverable, the Blade-class shared the common lack of shielding with it's counterpart, the Sith Starfighter. Blade-class starfighters were also piloted by Force sensitive pilots. </ns5:abstract>
