    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Scrapper (Skill Tree)</ns4:altLabel>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Scrapper is a skill tree of the Smuggler Advanced Class Scoundrel. This tree focuses on stealth, melee damage and using a scatter gun. A scoundrel using this tree will be from mid to close range of the enemy.

</rdfs:comment>
