    <ns1:faction rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Ord_Mantell"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Lieutenant Vanto Bazren also known as Fuse was a Republic Special Forces Trooper stationed on Ord Mantell, and was a part of Havoc Squad. He was the squad's explosives expert until he defected to the Sith Empire together with the rest of the squad.
He is eventually encountered by the Trooper when Havoc Squad arrive at Tatooine . Fuse reveals that he has been imprisoned after he refused to harm innocent civilians. He assist's the Trooper throughout Tatooine. Eventually after reaching the Imperial Base, the Trooper is given a choice to either catch the Imperial Commander but at the cost of the self-destruct going off and killing Fuse or stopping the self-destruct but allowing the commander to escape.

</ns5:abstract>
  </rdf:Description>
