    <ns1:location rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Unknown</ns1:location>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Karrid, born Kana Tarrid, was a female Falleen Sith apprentice later Sith Lord and the former Jedi Padawan of Jedi Master Gnost-Dural, that was the apprentice of Sith Lord Darth Malgus and later a member of the Emperor's Dark Council during the Cold War.

</ns5:abstract>
