    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Ashara Zavros is a female Togruta companion for the Sith Inquisitor class. She descended from a long line of Force users and was raised as a Jedi. The Sith Inquisitor meets her on the planet Taris.
She is a romance option for a male Sith Inquisitor. 

</ns5:abstract>
