  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Terrifying">
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Terrifying</rdfs:label>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Abilities"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Terrifying_Icon.png?width=300"/>
    <ns1:icon rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Terrifying_Icon.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Terrifying</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Terrifying</ns1:name>
    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Only true heroes can fight this enemy.</ns1:description>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/cabilities"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Terrifying_Icon.png"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Terrifying</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">When a creature or NPC with the Terrifying ability attacks a target the target, will receive the Terrified effect. It prevents players from attacking and inflicting much damage upon the target before being defeated.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Abilities"/>
    <ns1:type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Buff</ns1:type>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Terrified"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">When a creature or NPC with the Terrifying ability attacks a target the target, will receive the Terrified effect. It prevents players from attacking and inflicting much damage upon the target before being defeated.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Terrifying_Icon.png"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Qual">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Qual.jpg"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Qual.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Council"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Great_Hunt_(Great_Sith_War)"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Duron_Qel-Droma"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Great_Sith_War"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Guun_Han_Saresh"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Qual was a male Selkath Jedi Master who served on the Dantooine Enclave's Jedi Council  in the years following the Great Sith War. Qual was active on the Enclave Council during the Great Hunt of 3,995 BBY when Jedi Knights traveled the galaxy slaying Sith-created beasts left over from the war. After the official end of the Great Hunt, Qual was present when the Jedi Enclave Council notified Jedi Knights Duron Qel-Droma, Shaela Nuur and Guun Han Saresh that they were being sent to cleanse the Sith homeworld of Korriban of terentateks. Although some on the Council disagreed with the mission, Qual saw it to be tactically sound and believed in the wisdom of the Jedi High Council, which had chosen the three Jedi. However, Qel-Droma, Nuur and Saresh never returned.


</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dantooine_Jedi_Enclave_Council"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Qual</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Order"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Shaela_Nuur"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Qual</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
