  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Quesh">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/SS_20110121_Quesh02_full.jpg"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Quesh is a world within Hutt Space that is flooded with toxic environmental poisons. It was initially discovered by the Galactic Republic during the Great Galactic War, but was promptly abandoned due to this poisonous atmosphere.

