  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Katarr">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Katarr was a colony world of the Miraluka which during the Jedi Purge (in 299 BTC) suffered complete annihilation at the hands of Darth Nihilus, rendering it uninhabitable. This planet had also been decided to be a meeting place for a convocation of Jedi including Jedi Master Vandar Tokare, but all the attending Jedi - and all but one Miraluka native - ended up victims of Nihilus' assault.

</rdfs:comment>
