  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Glarus_Valley">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Glarus Valley is a major area of Alderaan and listed in the in-game Locations sub-section of the Codex. It is one of 6 locations listed for Alderaan. The Codex entry is unlocked simply by traveling into the area, which is in the southwest of Kaamos Territory.


