    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">RD-07A Vendetta Jacket</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Dvr_vendetta.png"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The RD-07A Vendetta Jacket is probably the rarest part of the entire RD-07A Vendetta Armor Set as it on average goes from 300,000 credits on the GTN to 3.9 million credits and isn't always on there. It can be found in Security Chest and or lockboxes on Voss at random as it is a World Drop.

</rdfs:comment>
