    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Yallenkeljo is a male Human Jedi who served the Jedi Order aboard the space station Carrick Station, selling combat gear during the Cold War between the Galactic Republic and the resurgent Sith Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
