  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Gummig">
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Gummig</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Wars"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Gummig was a male Human Mandalorian Neo-Crusader who fought in the Great Sith War and later the Mandalorian Wars. He often talked to himself and was not a big fan of the Mandalorian Assault Armor, saying there was nothing 'neo' about it.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:faction rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Neo-Crusaders"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Neo_Crusaders"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Gummig was a male Human Mandalorian Neo-Crusader who fought in the Great Sith War and later the Mandalorian Wars. He often talked to himself and was not a big fan of the Mandalorian Assault Armor, saying there was nothing 'neo' about it.

</ns5:abstract>
