    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Pollus Avesta was a human male who organized the Avesta Militia, the armed forces of the rebellion against the Hutt Cartel takeover of Makeb. He is the brother of Shalim Avesta and uncle of Lemda Avesta.

</rdfs:comment>
