  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Cartel_Market">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cartel-Coins.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Game_Systems"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Cartel Market is the virtual in-game market where exclusive items, unlocks and more in-game content is available for purchase. The Cartel Market can be accessed from clicking on the Cartel Market icon (left) on your status screen in SWTOR, where you can browse through the ever-expanding list of items the BioWare has for sale through the Market.

</rdfs:comment>
