  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tarnis">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Eli Tarnis</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Eli_Tarnis.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Lords"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/wookieepedia"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Human"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Treaty_of_Coruscant"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Praven"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Lord"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Doctor Eli Tarnis</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Skotia.jpg"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Darth Tarnis</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Darth Tarnis</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Eli_Tarnis.png?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Eli_Tarnis.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Coruscant"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Cold_War"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic_Encyclopedia"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Tarnis, also known under the alias Doctor Eli Tarnis, was a Human male Sith Lord who infiltrated the Galactic Republic during the Cold War with the Sith Empire. The son of Darth Angral, Tarnis received Sith training from Lord Praven, leading him to be named a full-fledged Lord of the Sith in time to embark on an undercover mission within the Republic shortly after the signing of the Treaty of Coruscant. 
Under the name "Eli Tarnis," he was planted as a Republic scientist in charge of the Planet Prison project on Coruscant. Upon the superweapon's completion, Tarnis used crime guilds from Coruscant's undercity to steal the project while maintaining his cover as a scientist. Unfortunately, a Jedi Knight infiltrated the strongholds of both guilds and dug up information on the location of the Planet Prison, leading Tarnis to stage a face kidnapping to allow him to retreat from the Republic.
Once again assuming his real name and character, Tarnis' identity was compromised during a holocall with Black Sun underboss Salarr during the Knight's investigation. Intending to use the Planet Prison on Coruscant to defuse all planetary defenses and allow the Empire to successfully infiltrate and conquer the Republic's capital world, the Knight, accompanied by Kira Carsen, located and killed Tarnis while on a holocall with his father and several other influential Sith Lords. Tarnis' death was the catalyst that lead Darth Angral to launch terror campaigns against the Republic.


</ns5:abstract>
