    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Wud Mortull was a male Human Padawan of Jedi Master Pernicar who fought in the New Sith Wars under Master Pernicar, but went missing some time during the fighting. Wud would reappear eight years later as a member of the Brotherhood of Darkness.


