    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Genarra was a female Jedi Consular and Master who lived during the New Sith Wars. Genarra was an exceptional Jedi who was one of only a few individuals in the history of the Galactic Republic to have the distinction of being a Jedi Chancellor, as she held the positions of Jedi Grand Master and Supreme Chancellor of the Galactic Republic at the same time.


</ns5:abstract>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Order"/>
