    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/sith_npc"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Darth Atroxa was a Lethan Twi'lek female who was a Sith Lord of the Sith Empire. During the Eternal Empire's attacks on the Sith Empire and the Galactic Republic, Atroxa and her forces defended the Sith homeworld of Korriban, but during the battle she was slain by Prince Arcann of the Eternal Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
