    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">House Panteer is the former ruling house of Alderaan. The queen and Crown Prince Gaul Panteer lead House Panteer prior to their deaths, events which left the House without an heir. The resulting power vacuum caused the remaining noble houses to erupt into civil war.

</ns5:abstract>
