    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Old_Sith_Empire"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Naga Sadow was a male Human/Sith hybrid Dark Lord and Sith sorcerer of the original Sith Empire. Taking the mantle of Dark Lord of the Sith after the death of Marka Ragnos, Sadow initiated the Great Hyperspace War. Unfortunately, Sadow's campaign against the Galactic Republic proved disastrous for the Sith. With his Empire crumbling around him, he vanished into exile. However, the Sith Lord Vitiate gathered his surviving comrades and began creation of a new Sith Empire, building upon Sadow's failed order.

</rdfs:comment>
