    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Ravager was a Centurion-class battlecruiser that was originally used by the Republic Navy during the Mandalorian Wars. The Ravager was destroyed in orbit of Malachor V at the end of the war. It was later salvaged by Darth Nihilus and used as his personal conveyance.

</rdfs:comment>
