  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tremel">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Tremel was an Overseer of the Sith Empire, active during the Great Galactic War and Cold War. Tasked with selecting worthy acolytes to become Sith, Tremel brings his protégé, the Sith Warrior, to Korriban for training ahead of schedule. Unfortunately, Tremel would ultimately be murdered by his student, by demand of the warrior's new master.

</rdfs:comment>
