    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Genter Fosse was a male Mandalorian Bounty Hunter who served on Ilum with the Sith Empire (New Established Sith Empire), helping to train anyone willing to go to him.

</rdfs:comment>
