  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Champion">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/chainlightning.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Shaclaw#Monstrous_Shaclaw"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Reclamation_Clearfell_Colossus"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Ogun_the_Destroyer"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Champion is the highest enemy strength classification that gives the enemy a large amount of heath and advanced abilities. Often times, these enemies are found on different worlds, out in the open for anyone to attack, though a good portion of the time these bosses are found in mission areas. These creatues have abnormallly high amount of hit points (hp) and have Boss Immunity, which makes them immune to incapacitating or movement-impairing effects.

</ns5:abstract>
