  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Unidentified_Boastful_Mandalorian">
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Screenshot_2015-11-20_15_37_45_772417.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mercenary"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Corellia"/>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Boastful_Mandalorian.jpg"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
The Unidentified Boastful Mandalorian was a male Human Mandalorian Mercenary who lived during the Galactic War. On Corellia, he and group of Mandalorians were hire take down the Carth Onasi monument in Axial Park, killing the CorSec officers guarding it. He was later seen boasting the news to two other Mandalorians, saying a round of drinks was on him.

</ns5:abstract>
