  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dalash_Ard">
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Dalash Ard</ns1:name>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Dalash Ard was a female Mandalorian who took part in the assault on Zakuul droid factory on Darvannis. She was in charge of setting the ion bombs inside the Droid factory while the others did their part in the mission.

</rdfs:comment>
