    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Mavrix Varad was a male Human Mandalorian chieftain of Clan Varad who lived during the Great Galactic War and the Cold War. Mavrix Varad was very known for being bloodthirsty and ruthless, to the point that Mandalore the Vindicated consider him as a "a rancor foaming at the mouth". He is also the final boss character in the Mandalorian Raiders Flashpoint.

