    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Beastmaster of Tython is an achievement that players can earn by finding seven specific codex entries related to the creatures found on the world of Tython. Once players locate and access all seven of the entries, they will be granted the achievement in their Legacy.

</ns5:abstract>
