    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
The Imprisoned One is a Rakatan that lived during the Infinite Empire's galactic dominance. After perusing his own personal conquest, the primitive Rakatans imprisoned him in a mind box, which was later found by Revan and the Czerka Corportation.


</rdfs:comment>
