    <ns1:mission4description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">The Dug are a notoriously surly species who place a high value on pride and bravado, this makes them easy to provoke and manipulate. Help the Diplomatic Service take advantage of this.</ns1:mission4description>
    <ns1:mission11description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Primitive Nelvaan is the only world in the Koobi system not under your factions control. Nelvaan isn't worth an army; have your companion arrange Nelvaan's surrender.</ns1:mission11description>
    <ns1:mission1cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">95</ns1:mission1cost>
    <ns1:mission3difficultygreen rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">?</ns1:mission3difficultygreen>
