    <ns1:mission10description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">The wealth of Eleo Duboir recently passed to his twin sons, both daredevils in the extreme, and the executor of Eleo's estate needs help reigning in their dangerous behavior.</ns1:mission10description>
    <ns1:mission1time rdf:datatype="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/datatype/second">0.0</ns1:mission1time>
