    <ns1:mission2description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Several conspirators are plotting to supplant the governor of an enemy-controlled world;send your companion to collaborate with this coup.</ns1:mission2description>
