    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Diplomacy is one of the four Mission Skills. It involves the art of conducting and managing negotiations.
Diplomacy missions can be used to gain either Medical Supplies or Companion Gifts, they also come with additional dark-side or light-side points depending upon the mission.

</ns5:abstract>
