    <ns1:mission8description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">The galaxy's elite are heading to the Ambassador's Ball...bringing all their old grudges and rivalries. Your companions could keep everyone's mind on the party.</ns1:mission8description>
