    <ns1:mission6description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">A thief possessing military secrets has been captured by the Hutts. Have your companion convince the Hutts to execute him rather than risk his information leaking.</ns1:mission6description>
