    <ns1:mission5description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Your factions diplomatic service has spotted a candidate for recruitment into the service, and wishes for the planetary leaders to feel the same way. Have your companion deliver an incentive.</ns1:mission5description>
