    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Smuggler's Vanguard is a short story written by Rob Chestney that was published exclusively on StarWars.com on 25 March, 2010. It is set during the days of the Great Galactic War and focuses on the Mirialan smuggler, Hylo Visz.

</ns5:abstract>
