    <ns1:rewards rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">None</ns1:rewards>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Companion_Missions"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Companion_Missions"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Family Ties is a dialogue only Companion Mission for Vette that is available when you have enough affection points. During this dialogue Vette discusses missing her family. In particular she talks about her mother and sister Tiva. She states that she hasn't seen her sister since she was 10 or 12 years old.</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Family Ties is a dialogue only Companion Mission for Vette that is available when you have enough affection points. During this dialogue Vette discusses missing her family. In particular she talks about her mother and sister Tiva. She states that she hasn't seen her sister since she was 10 or 12 years old.</rdfs:comment>
