  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mind_trick">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Mindquell.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">mind tricks</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Force fear</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Mind_and_Body.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">crush his will</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Mind trick</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Force_powers"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">fear</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">terror and despair</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:The_Force"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Mind trick</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Mind trick is one of the many abilities that can be used by Force-users through channeling the force, the Mind trick is a ability that can forcefully persuade an individual to to whatever you might wish. Although this extremely handy tool might be very useful, it has a downside. This power will not work on strong-willed foes, it controls only those that of a weak will.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Light_side_of_the_Force"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">manipulate</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Light_side_of_the_Force"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Mind trick is one of the many abilities that can be used by Force-users through channeling the force, the Mind trick is a ability that can forcefully persuade an individual to to whatever you might wish. Although this extremely handy tool might be very useful, it has a downside. This power will not work on strong-willed foes, it controls only those that of a weak will.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Mind Trick</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Mind trick</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
