    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Alderaan"/>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Cay Qel-Droma</ns1:name>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Great_Sith_War"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Cay Qel-Droma was a Human male Jedi Knight. He was the son of Jedi Master Lien-Tsai Qel-Droma, the younger brother of former Jedi Knight/Dark Lord of the Sith Ulic Qel-Droma, and the cousin of Jedi Knight Duron Qel-Droma.
During the Freedon Nadd Uprising, Cay lost his left arm. He replaced with an arm he salvaged from a droid.
During the destruction of Ossus during the Great Sith War, Cay attempted to save his brother Ulic from the dark side. Unfortunately, Ulic killed him in a fit of rage. However, after killing him, Ulic was overcome with remorse. It was Cay's death that turned Ulic away from the dark side.

</ns5:abstract>
