    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Increases the damage dealt by bleeding effects by 15% on targets below 30% of max health.  In addition, if a target dies with Hemorrhaging Blast, it finishes the cooldown of Hemorrhaging Blast.</ns1:description>
  </rdf:Description>
