    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Karness Muur was one of the earliest known fallen Jedi and Sith Lords of the Sith Empire, one of the first true practitioners of Sith magic and was the owner of the Muur Talisman, a Sith artifact capable of possessing and dominating the wills of non Force-sensitive beings close to him.

</rdfs:comment>
