    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Casus Sandral was the son of Nurik Sandral and member of the influential Sandral family on Dantooine during the time of the Jedi Civil War. An archaeologist, Sandral was killed by kath hounds while exploring plains near his family home.

</ns5:abstract>
