    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Ord-Mantell-screenshot01.jpg?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Ord Mantell is a planet in the Bright Jewel Cluster in the Mid Rim, filled with mountainous plains and volcanic islands. The planet is being fought over by the corrupt government, aligned with the Galactic Republic, and elusive separatist forces using guerilla tactics. It is the starting planet of the Smugglers and Republic Troopers.
The civil war has nearly reached a high level of danger; if not sending help it is advised to steer clear of the conflict.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Ord Mantell is a planet in the Bright Jewel Cluster in the Mid Rim, filled with mountainous plains and volcanic islands. The planet is being fought over by the corrupt government, aligned with the Galactic Republic, and elusive separatist forces using guerilla tactics. It is the starting planet of the Smugglers and Republic Troopers.
The civil war has nearly reached a high level of danger; if not sending help it is advised to steer clear of the conflict.

</ns5:abstract>
