  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Aloysius_Kallig">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">best</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Aloysius Kallig</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns1:level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">50</ns1:level>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Lord Aloysius Kallig is a distant ancestor of the Sith Inquisitor and was in life a powerful figure, being the best general and greatest rival of the legendary Tulak Hord. He serves as an unofficial mentor to the Sith Inquisitor, wanting to restorehis once-proud legacy. 

</rdfs:comment>
