    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Mandalorian Fire Commandos were elite forces for Clan Varad during the Cold War. When Clan Varad stole the Republic warship Allusis many Fire Commandos and Mandalorian Tech Commandos were on board. When the Galactic Republic and Sith Empire fought for the Allusis, many of these Commandos were killed during the fighting.

</ns5:abstract>
