  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Outpost_Zaroshe">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Outpost Zaroshe is a Imperial-run outpost located in The Dune Sea area of Tatooine. It is situated near the edge of the Sea, close to several cave and natural rock formations before facing outward on the sands. It is close to the meditation hut of Jedi Masters Yonlach and Yu-Li.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Outpost_Zaroshe.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tatooine"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Outpost Zaroshe is a Imperial-run outpost located in The Dune Sea area of Tatooine. It is situated near the edge of the Sea, close to several cave and natural rock formations before facing outward on the sands. It is close to the meditation hut of Jedi Masters Yonlach and Yu-Li.


</ns5:abstract>
