    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Bounty Hunter class focuses on tracking down and, typically, capturing or killing people for credits (whichever pays more or occasionally the said hunter has morals). It is one of the classes aligned with the Sith Empire that is not Force-sensitive (but through the legacy system you can have Force sensitive abilities). 
Famous Bounty Hunters include Shae Vizla.

</ns5:abstract>
