    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">[HEROIC 2+] Factory Recall</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en"> Factory Recall is a level 8 heroic mission available to Bounty Hunters and Imperial Agents on Hutta.

</rdfs:comment>
