    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Doctor Eckard Lokin is a companion character of the Imperial Agent plot line. Lokin joins the agent after being rescued from a fallen Jedi terrorist who captured him and other scientists in an attempt to find a way to turn the Rakghouls on the empire.

</ns5:abstract>
