    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Bulga the Crude was a female Mandalorian Zabrak bounty hunter living during the Cold War. Residing on the Sith Empire's Vaiken Spacedock, where she worked close with Deagan Farrell. She also shared her knowledge with others.

</rdfs:comment>
