    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Glenk was a male Kubaz Sith apprentice who served the Sith Lord Daiman and was tasked with infiltrating the Novitiates, a Dark Side sect that served Daiman's older brother, the Sith Lord Odion.


</ns5:abstract>
