    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Kinetic Combat is a skill tree of the Jedi Shadow advanced class. It focuses on protecting allies and keeping the attention of the enemies. In RPG terms, this tree would be a tank.
The following table contains the known skills that can be gained from this tree:

</ns5:abstract>
