  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Knight_Armor">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Armors"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Guardians"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Jedi Knights in the Old Republic era are known to wear a suit of segmented plate armor underneath cloaks and robes of various earthy colors. This armor can also vary in strength, ranging from heavy plate armor to simple cloth and leather robes.

</ns5:abstract>
