    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Andor Vex was a male Human Jedi in the Old Republic era, and served in the Jedi Order, and a good friend of Jolee Bindo who according to him had extremely bad breath in which he characterized as "Breath like a Bantha".

