    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Attack of the Flesh Raiders is the first mission in the Jedi Knight's story arc. The Knight will gain this quest automatically after disembarking their ship and talking with Derrin Weller. Weller will send the Knight the Gnarls to repel the Flesh Raiders attack against the Jedi training grounds.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Attack of the Flesh Raiders is the first mission in the Jedi Knight's story arc. The Knight will gain this quest automatically after disembarking their ship and talking with Derrin Weller. Weller will send the Knight the Gnarls to repel the Flesh Raiders attack against the Jedi training grounds.

</rdfs:comment>
