    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Mical, also known as the Disciple, was a Human male Jedi Youngling during the Mandalorian Wars, a diplomat during the Jedi Civil War and the Jedi Purge and eventually a Jedi historian and Jedi Master after the purge, earning a place on the Jedi High Council.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Council"/>
