    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Ability:Creeping_Terror"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Anguish (Mental) is an affect placed on a target from an ability such as Ability:Creeping Terror. It will cause periodic Internal Damage to the target for a period of time.</ns5:abstract>
