    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Taris is the fifth planet in its star system, located in the Outer Rim areas of the Seat of the Empire region. Taris's level bracket is 16-20 for the Republic, and 32-36 for the Empire. For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: Taris on Wookieepedia

