    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Imperial_Intelligence"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Imperial Intelligence, also known as the Ministry of Intelligence, is the intelligence and secret police organization that serves the Sith Empire. Imperial Intelligence is responsible for the collection and obfuscation of strategic or sensitive information, planting spies in enemy ranks and the assassination of key opponents of the Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
