    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Iridorians were a warlike species who were driven by a lust for blood. They were seen as savage by other warrior species, such as Echani and Mandalorians.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/wookieepedia"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Iridorian</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Iridorians were a warlike species who were driven by a lust for blood. They were seen as savage by other warrior species, such as Echani and Mandalorians.

</rdfs:comment>
