  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Supreme_Commander">
    <ns1:incumbentsince rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Circa 10 ATC</ns1:incumbentsince>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Supreme Commander is the overall commander of the Galactic Republic Military. Since the Supreme Chancellor has the power to appoint military titles such as honorary "Republic General", it is surmised that the Supreme Commander is appointed by the Supreme Chancellor.

</rdfs:comment>
