    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Jomar Chul is a Zabrak male Jedi Knight who served the Jedi Order during the Cold War and the Second Great Galactic War between the Galactic Republic and the resurgent Sith Empire. He is very skilled in collecting information and infiltrating hostile territories.

</ns5:abstract>
