    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tomb_of_Tulak_Hord"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Jorak Uln was a male Human]|human]] male Sith Master, and the former Headmaster of the Sith Academy on Korriban. He led the academy until his student, Uthar Wynn ousted him from power. Jorak left the academy and took refugee in the Tomb of Tulak Hord.

</ns5:abstract>
