    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Sergeant Fideltin Rusk is a 40-year-old male Chagrian Trooper of the Galactic Republic. During his assignment on the icy planet of Hoth, he met a Jedi Knight. After their successful mission, Rusk was set in service of the Jedi Knight by his commanding officer.

</rdfs:comment>
