  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galia">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Queen Galia was an Onderonian Queen around the time of Freedon Nadd. She was married to Beast Rider Oron Kira.

</rdfs:comment>
