  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/High_Security_Lockdown">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">High Security Lockdown is an area of the Industrial Sector on Nar Shaddaa. For Empire characters it is most easily accessible from the south side of the Network Security District via two ramps.

