    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Hammerhead starship was a military starship used by the Galactic Republic during the Mandalorian Wars. It was similar in appearance to the Hammerhead-class cruiser, but was much smaller than it's larger counterpart.</rdfs:comment>
