    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Abilities are skills, attacks or powers that players can use in game. Each of the eight player classes, as well as the sixteen advanced classes have access to an array of unique abilities that provide offensive, defensive or support capabilities to players.
Abilities can be upgraded or learned at a certain price which increases with your character level.
While some abilities are shared amongst all classes, there are a lot of abilities that are specific to one class or advanced class.

</rdfs:comment>
