    <ns1:race rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Shara Jenn, codenamed "Watcher Two" was a Human female officer working in Imperial Intelligence, a branch of the Imperial  government of the Sith Empire. She later becomes the head of operations in intelligence, code-named Keeper, after her predecessor is made Minister of Intelligence. After Imperial Intelligence was disbanded, she was one of the former members who went rouge, and was eventually captured by the Republic.

</ns5:abstract>
