    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This lore can be found on Alderaan.
Republic: X:-1484 Y:1383. Located in Alderaan’s Pallista Spaceport, on top of a crate that is just behind Haley Organa.
Empire: X:206 Y:-1300. Noble Houses lore object is located in the Rhu Caenus Spaceport (X:206 Y:-1300 Z:284) on the table of the Starship Upgrades vendor.

</ns5:abstract>
