    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Kaleesh are a humanoid species, presumed to originate from the planet Kalee. While not one of the confirmed playable species, notable members such as General Grievous; Xalek, a companion of the Sith Inquisitor; and Master Cin Tykan, part of the Jedi Consular's storyline, can be seen through the Star Wars Universe, along with many others.

