  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darth_Glovoc">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Darth Glovoc was a male humanoid Sith Lord of the Sith Empire during the Jedi Civil War. He disappeared from Republic and Empire space and went into stasis shortly after the death of Darth Malak at the end of the Jedi Civil War.

</ns5:abstract>
