    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Delving ever deeper into the dark side of the Force can lead to madness, but it can also lead to immense power.  Attacking multiple enemies simultaneously and instilling terror into their hearts, all the while sapping their very life essence from afar, the Madness Sorcerer is a dark threat unlike any other.</ns1:description>
