    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">In the year 3,642 BBY, Jedi Knight Jomar Chul used a small starship to scout the Dromund system, during his mission he was chased out of the star system by the Imperial Navy and persuied until he was shot down over the planet Tatooine.

