  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Manka_Cat">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Manka cats are non-sentient hostile creatures, native to the worlds of Alderaan and Tython. They can most often be seen wandering alone or with their cubs. On Alderaan, their fur is gray, while on Tython, they can be seen with a brown fur. Their carnivorous instincts, however, remain the same.

</ns5:abstract>
