    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Corso Riggs is the first companion character for the Smuggler class. He is the second person that a Smuggler meets during their story. Upon first meeting him, Riggs is an employee of Skavak, who gives some helpful pointers to the Smuggler when first venturing out into Ord Mantell. Riggs is later betrayed by Skavak, who also steals the Smuggler's ship.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:secondaryStat rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Endurance</ns1:secondaryStat>
