    <ns1:terrain rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Rocky Barren</ns1:terrain>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">CZ-198 is an exotic moon in the Unknown Regions that is currently used as a testing facility for the Czerka Corporation. Current activities and projects in the facility is currently directed by Special Executive Rasmus Blys.

</ns5:abstract>
