    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">CZ-198 is an exotic moon in the Unknown Regions that is currently used as a testing facility for the Czerka Corporation. Current activities and projects in the facility is currently directed by Special Executive Rasmus Blys.

</rdfs:comment>
