    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Minst is a member of the Republic War Trust. He was in charge of the work occuring at the Reactor Core within Transport Station 5, part of Project Siantide. He employed a double in an attempt to trap the Sith Warrior sent by the Empire to kill him.


</rdfs:comment>
