    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/cost"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Battlemaster_Commendation"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Champion Commendations can be used to buy PVP gear, and are obtained from Champion Gear Bags and Battlemaster Gear Bags. You can also buy 1 Champion Commendations for 120 Warzone Commendations from the PVP Items vendor on the fleet.
You can buy Champion gear with either Champion Commendations, or Unassbled Champion tokens.
The quality of PVP gear is Centurion &lt; Champion &lt; Battlemaster.
See also: PVP Gear for an explantion of the PVP currency system
See also: Champion Gear Sets</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Champion-gear-bag.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Champion Commendation</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
