    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Ulic Qel-Droma was a Human male Jedi Knight, later Dark Lord of the Sith, during the Great Sith War. He was also the son of Jedi Master Lien-Tsai Qel-Droma, the older brother of Jedi Knight Cay Qel-Droma, and the cousin of Jedi Knight Duron Qel-Droma.

</ns5:abstract>
