    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Dkjdi2.PNG"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Dark_Jedi"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Civil_War"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Great_Galactic_War"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/The_Force"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Dkjdi2.png"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Order"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Bastila_Shan"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Dark Jedi are Force-users who have succumbed to the Dark side, and was mostly affiliated with the Sith Empire, which was led by Revan during the Jedi Civil War. More specifically the term referred to those who turned their back on the Jedi Order and gave into the Dark side but did not serve the Sith.
Dark Jedi were often unaffiliated with either the Sith or the Jedi and used the dark side for personal gain and wealth rather than power like their Sith counterparts, one such example is Juhani who neither served the Sith Empire nor became a full Sith.
Dark Jedi are occasionally compared to Grey Jedi.

</ns5:abstract>
