    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Root was the nickname of a Human male with black hair living on Somov Rit as of 1,000 BBY. He was the cousin and guardian of Zannah, Darovit, and Hardin. He was an ally of the Jedi, and a friend of Torr Snapit, and apparently a Force-sensitive.


