    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Medd Tandar was a male Cerean Jedi Knight who survived in the New Sith Wars and went on to serve the Council of First Knowledge in their quest to locate and recover all remaining Sith artifacts across the galaxy.


</ns5:abstract>
