    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">House Rist is one of the Alderaanian Noble Dynasties. It is a rival of Alderaan's new self-proclaimed King, General Bouris Ulgo, as well as Houses Thul and Organa who are backed by the Empire and Republic respectively.

