  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Vikto">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Space_station"/>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Alive</ns1:status>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Order"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Vikto</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Vikto is a male Zabrak who served the Jedi Order and the Galactic Republic as a Jedi Master during the Galactic War with the Sith Empire. A fair-skinned man with black eyes and no hair, Vikto wore brown robes over armor, and spent much of his time on the space stations Carrick Station and Keylander Station, as well as inside the Czerka Corporation facility CZ-198 equipping Jedi Knights with gear.

</rdfs:comment>
