    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Darth Baras was a human male Dark Lord of the Sith and eventual member of the Emperor's Dark Council, dispatched to Alderaan and tasked with finalizing the Treaty of Coruscant in the days leading up to the end of the Great Galactic War. Following the treaty's signing, he was implicated in a plot to dissolve the very peace he had negotiated; Baras cleared his name and preserved the treaty by helping to defeat the true conspirator, a confrontation that took place in the crystal on the planet Dantooine.
Baras was the master of the Sith Warrior, an apprentice who would ultimately become his undoing.

</ns5:abstract>
