    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Felix Iresso is a Human Companion character of the Jedi Consular. He fills the role of a ranged tank. A female Consular can have a romantic storyline with him. Lieutenant Felix Iresso was a Human Male Republic soldier who resided on Tython.

</rdfs:comment>
