    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Grand Imperial Quartet</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Grand Imperial Quartet plays on the upper level of the Vaiken Spacedock Cantina, which is a VIP only area, requiring a to access. This can be purchased on the lower level from a cantina vendor. The band is comprised of 2 Kloo Players and 2 Strummers, all of which are Human except one, a Duros Kloo Player.</rdfs:comment>
