    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Grand Imperial Quartet plays on the upper level of the Vaiken Spacedock Cantina, which is a VIP only area, requiring a to access. This can be purchased on the lower level from a cantina vendor. The band is comprised of 2 Kloo Players and 2 Strummers, all of which are Human except one, a Duros Kloo Player.</ns5:abstract>
