    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Lord Aurren Panteer and the rest of the Panteer royal family are in hiding. They are attempting to force House Ulgo out of their holdings and reinstate their family as rulers of Alderaan.


</ns5:abstract>
