    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Vannar Treece was a male Human Jedi Master and the master of Jedi Knight Kerra Holt. Vannar led a series of raids on the Sith Lord Daiman's protectorate before being killed in a battle with his forces.


</ns5:abstract>
