    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Lore/Planets"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Ossus is a world that would become a place of great importance to the Jedi, as the site where they stored the sum of their knowledge. During the Exar Kun War, Exar Kun and his armies attacked and destroyed the Jedi Library.

</ns5:abstract>
