  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rakghoul_Pandemic">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Rakghoul Pandemic was a worldwide Server Event that started on Sunday April 15th, 2012 and ended on Tuesday April 24th, 2012. This version of the event took place mostly on Tatooine and is expected to never return.
The Rakghoul Pandemic came back as the new recurring event Rakghoul Resurgence on the 21st of January 2014 and ended 28th of January 2014. This new version of the event is expected to return every so often in different locations.


</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Rakghoul-outbreak-001.jpg?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Rakghoul Pandemic was a worldwide Server Event that started on Sunday April 15th, 2012 and ended on Tuesday April 24th, 2012. This version of the event took place mostly on Tatooine and is expected to never return.
The Rakghoul Pandemic came back as the new recurring event Rakghoul Resurgence on the 21st of January 2014 and ended 28th of January 2014. This new version of the event is expected to return every so often in different locations.


</rdfs:comment>
