  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/David_Hayter">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/David-hayter.jpg"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/David-hayter.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Voice_Actors"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageExternalLink rdf:resource="http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0371684/"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">David Hayter is an American voice actor who provided the dialogue for the male Jedi Knight.
He is best known for providing the voice of Naked and Solid Snake, the main protagonists of the Metal Gear video game series. He has also done work on Watchmen and the X-Men films.

</ns5:abstract>
