    <ns1:boxTitle rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Korriban Arrival Port</ns1:boxTitle>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Warrior"/>
    <ns1:row5Title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">No. of Exits</ns1:row5Title>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Arm_Yourself"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Screen_003.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Korriban Arrival Port is the starting area for the Sith Warrior and the Sith Inquisitor classes. After the cutscene, you are greeted by your Overseer and receive your first quest. Overseer Tremel if you are a Sith Warrior and Overseer Harkun if you are a Sith Inquisitor.

</ns5:abstract>
