    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tarnis"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Desolator_(superweapon)"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darth_Angral"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Shock Drum is a superweapon designed by the brilliant Sith scientist Tarnis during the Cold War, the device forms part of the Desolator superweapon. Darth Angral deployed the weapon on Tatooine to test its capability's and destroy the world at the same time.

</rdfs:comment>
