    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The title of Darth is a prestigious honour granted to only the most powerful and deserving Sith of the Empire. An increasingly minute quantity of Sith outside the Dark Council possess this honorable title.
(For players it is an attainable story-based reward for Sith Inquisitors and Sith Warriors).

</ns5:abstract>
