    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Missions"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Master Yuon Par has tasked you with locating and retrieving the missing hologram of Rajivari, the first fallen Jedi. 
She suspects that someone from the Twi'lek village of Kalikori may be responsible and that Bashenn, captain of the village guard, may know more. Find Bashenn in Kalikori village.

</ns5:abstract>
