    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Raana Tey was a Togruta female Jedi Master who - while serving the Jedi Order - was also a member of former Jedi Master Krynda Draay's Jedi Covenant and member of its First Watch Circle.


</rdfs:comment>
