    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">When obtaining the Datacrons, players are given Codex entries detailing the history of the Star Wars Galaxy up to the point that the game takes place.
Due to the placement of the Datacrons on Planets that have access restricted to only Republic or Empire, obtaining the entire Galactic History with one character is not currently possible.

</ns5:abstract>
