    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Narlock is a Mon Calamari Commander of the Galactic Republic.
Commander Narlock is present during the attack on the Esseles. He instructs three Essele security guards and the Republic Heros present to defend the ship from the Imperial attack.

</ns5:abstract>
