    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Dragonfly Dropship or D29-Assualt Dropship was a transport used by the Sith Empire during the Great Galactic War for invasions and quick insertions (similiar in purpose to the 'Higgins boat' used namely during World War 2. The bounty hunter Vrath Xizor used one named the Razor, as his personal starship.

</ns5:abstract>
