    <ns1:faction rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sith Empire</ns1:faction>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Mercenary is one of the two Advanced Classes for the Bounty Hunter. It is the "DPS" (Damage-Dealing) AC for the Bounty Hunter, and focuses heavily on dual wielding and use of the wrist-mounted Rocket Launcher. They can also be healers if leveled into Bodyguard.
Primary Focus:Dual Wield GunsMissilesRanged DPSHealer

</ns5:abstract>
