    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Imperial Army is the land-based military branch of the Sith Empire, inventory included generic soldiers as well as Battle Droids and Commando units. The army included Sith troopers and droids, such as the Mark I and the Mark II. Imperial Troopers are deployed in varying numbers, from small strike-teams to entire legions in order to invade or defend territory.

</rdfs:comment>
