    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Vol Kolla was a male Rattataki Mandalorian Mercenary who worked for the Sith Empire during the Cold War. On Dromund Kaas, he and his men were hired by the Imperial Army to stop groups of Rebelling Slaves who acquired on large mining drills, planning use them destroy a colossus.Being driven back by the rebels, Vol was forced to hire different people to finish the job.

</rdfs:comment>
