  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Garon_Borm">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mandalorians"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Togorian_Mandalorian.png"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Garon Borm was a male Togruta Mandalorian Field Marshal who fought during the Mandalorian Wars. Garon was the commander of a Kandosii-type dreadnought call Parjai, before it was taken over by Zayne Carrick and the Republic prisoners disguised as Mandalorians, tricking them into thinking they had a force sickness.

</rdfs:comment>
