    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Desperate Times is the second mission in the Smuggler's story arc. The Smuggler will gain this mission from Corso Riggs after saving him from the Separatist ambush. Riggs directs the Smuggler to Viidu, the employer of Riggs and Skavak (formerly).

