    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Senya Tirall is a former Knight of Zakuul who had chosen to rebel against Emperor Arcann's rule. Later on it is revealed she is the former lover of Emperor Valkorion and the mother of his children.

</ns5:abstract>
