  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/G-2A_gunship">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The G-2A gunship was a starfighter that was used by the Sith Empire during the Great Galactic War. The craft was retired and replaced with the GSS-5C Dustmaker, G-2A is infamous throughout the Republic for raising entire cities to the ground during the war. </rdfs:comment>
