    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Rakata, also known as the Builders, are a humanoid species with distinctive amphibian features from the planet Lehon in the Unknown Regions. Once the rulers of the legendary, pre-Republic Infinite Empire, they are now a primitive and obscure race.

