    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Blotus was the only Hutt to serve as the Supreme Chancellor. He was thought as of one of the best Chancellors that the Republic had. He served for a good 275 years as Chancellor and was noted as a kind Hutt.


