    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Berethon was a male Human Jedi Lord serving the Jedi Order and the Galactic Republic during the New Sith Wars. He operated a feudal kingdom of Corellian Jedi within the war-torn regions of the Republic and stood as a bulwark against the forces of the Sith Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
