    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Located at the SW corner of the market at House Thul. This is a one room cantina. It still serves as a Rest Zone for characters. There is an outside patio, but no patrons inside or out other than other player characters that might be stopping by.

</rdfs:comment>
