    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Former Dark Lord of the Sith Revan is retrained by the Jedi Council on Dantooine to stop the Sith.Continued fighting during the Jedi Civil War and its conclusion.Revan defeats his old apprentice on the Star Forge.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Former Dark Lord of the Sith Revan is retrained by the Jedi Council on Dantooine to stop the Sith.Continued fighting during the Jedi Civil War and its conclusion.Revan defeats his old apprentice on the Star Forge.

