    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Fires a continuous stream of bolts that deals 6941 damage and depletes 24 energy cells over the duration.  Weak and standard enemies caught in the blaster fire are stunned for the duration.</ns1:description>
