    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Dobe is a female Miraluka who served the Jedi Order during the Cold War between the Galactic Republic and the Sith Empire. While the rest of the Order rebuilt on Tython, she was assigned to Carrick Station. A Jedi Consular, she taught other young Consulars the mysteries of the Force.

</rdfs:comment>
