  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Ergeron">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Ergeron was a male Human Mandalorian warrior who fought in the Mandalorian Wars alongside Canderous Ordo. However after the war, he become a mercenary. Unlike some other Mandalorians, he did not held a grudge against the Galactic Republic, understanding it was war. He also shown disliking towards the Echani and the Iridorian warrior cultures.

</rdfs:comment>
