  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Gav_Daragon">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Apprentices"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Gav Daragon was a male Force-sensitive human and famed hyperspace explorer who - along with his sister Jori - discovered the hyperlane route that would later be known as the Daragon Trail that connected the Empress Teta system in the Deep Core to Korriban in the Outer Rim.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:faction rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Old_Sith_Empire"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/character"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Stubs"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Stubs"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Gav Daragon was a male Force-sensitive human and famed hyperspace explorer who - along with his sister Jori - discovered the hyperlane route that would later be known as the Daragon Trail that connected the Empress Teta system in the Deep Core to Korriban in the Outer Rim.

</ns5:abstract>
