  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Keeper">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Keeper.png"/>
    <ns1:race rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Imperial_Agents"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/character"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageExternalLink rdf:resource="http://www.swtor.com/info/holonet/biographies/keeper"/>
    <ns1:faction rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sith Empire</ns1:faction>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dark_Council"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Keeper is the codename of the Imperial Intelligence overseer of the Operations Division. He has to approve of every action that is taken by Imperial Intelligence, such as assassinations or espionage. If he fails at his job in the eyes of his superiors, he will quickly be dealt with. The current Keeper has been at this post for almost a decade. Little information is known about the Keeper's life pre-intelligence, although Republic counterintelligence says that he was in the Imperial Navy.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Keeper</ns4:altLabel>
