  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Infinite_Empire">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Rakata"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rakata"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Factions"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Belsavis"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:KotOR"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Infinite_Empire.png"/>
    <ns1:locations rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Belsavis"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/organisation"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Infinite Empire, often known as the Rakata Infinite Empire, was the first and largest government to exist prior to the rise of the Galactic Republic. Controlled by the Rakata, a technologically advanced humanoid species, the Empire enslaved many alien species including the Selkath of Manaan and the Sand People of Tatooine. The Rakata were one of the first species to create hyperspace technology; the Rakata were both great inventors and savage warriors. The Infinite Empire's greatest invention was the Star Forge, a space station with unlimited resources.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Lehon"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Selkath"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Forge"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Infinite Empire, often known as the Rakata Infinite Empire, was the first and largest government to exist prior to the rise of the Galactic Republic. Controlled by the Rakata, a technologically advanced humanoid species, the Empire enslaved many alien species including the Selkath of Manaan and the Sand People of Tatooine. The Rakata were one of the first species to create hyperspace technology; the Rakata were both great inventors and savage warriors. The Infinite Empire's greatest invention was the Star Forge, a space station with unlimited resources.

</ns5:abstract>
