  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Vengeance_(Discipline)">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Vengeance is one of the three Disciplines avaible for the Juggernaut Advanced Class. It focuses on burst and damage-over-time effects.
While embracing the dark side of the force, vengeance can be a powerful ally. With sustained and relentless lightsaber thrusts delivered with the lithe Shien Form, the Vengeance Juggernaut increases damage without sacraficing defense--an ideal combination of tenacity and viciousness.
</ns5:abstract>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Juggernaut_Disiplines"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Vengeance is one of the three Disciplines avaible for the Juggernaut Advanced Class. It focuses on burst and damage-over-time effects.
While embracing the dark side of the force, vengeance can be a powerful ally. With sustained and relentless lightsaber thrusts delivered with the lithe Shien Form, the Vengeance Juggernaut increases damage without sacraficing defense--an ideal combination of tenacity and viciousness.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Juggernaut_Disiplines"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Vengeance (Discipline)</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Disiplines"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/VenZallow-TORDeceived.png"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Disiplines"/>
