    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
The Huntmaster was a male Wookiee Mandalorian of the third Great Hunt during the Cold War, a time of heated tension between the Galactic Republic and the Sith Empire. He won the third hunt, which happened during the Great Galactic War. He worked close with fellow Mandalorian, Lek.

</ns5:abstract>
