    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Auriga Fire was the personal starship of smuggler Jet Nebula, the vessel served her faithfully for more than ten years after the Treaty of Coruscant. From the top it appeared almost triangular, with the cockpit slightly off-center on the front of the ship.


