    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">During the Great Galactic War, notorious pirate Harridax Kirill captured a starship belonging to the Jedi Order, the vessel was carrying Force-sensitive children. Kirill himself led the boarding party that killed the Jedi defenders aboard the ship. He then took the children to Korriban as a "gift" to the Sith Empire. The Empire rewarded the Kirill by promoting him from privateer to the position of commander in the Imperial Navy.

</rdfs:comment>
