    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Houk"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Companions"/>
    <ns1:x rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Luxury</ns1:x>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/The_Holonet"/>
    <ns1:x rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Trophy</ns1:x>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Skadge was a male Houk that lived during the Cold War. His ruthless attitude and thirst for violence were enough to get him banished from his homeworld at a young age. He worked as an enforcer for the Hutts before being betrayed by them for profit. Furious, he traveled to Coruscant just before the Sacking, and rose the Black Sun guild back into prominence over several sectors of the Undercity.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Skadge was a male Houk that lived during the Cold War. His ruthless attitude and thirst for violence were enough to get him banished from his homeworld at a young age. He worked as an enforcer for the Hutts before being betrayed by them for profit. Furious, he traveled to Coruscant just before the Sacking, and rose the Black Sun guild back into prominence over several sectors of the Undercity.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:likes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Violence, causing suffering, destruction, bullying</ns1:likes>
