  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/DeMare">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Lieutenant DeMare operating out of the Imperial Surveillance Outpost in the Upper Industrial Sector has discovered that Czerka Corporation is attempting to sell to the Republic technology that will double the distance of starship detection. He's very concerned this will tip the balance of power between the Republic and Empire.


</rdfs:comment>
