    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Barrison Draay was a male Human Jedi Knight during the Great Sith War. He was also the husband of Jedi Master Krynda Draay, and the father of Jedi Master Lucien Draay.

</rdfs:comment>
