  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Leontyne_Saresh">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Leontyne Saresh is a female Twi'leki who served as the governor of Taris and the Supreme Chancellor of the Republic during the Cold War and the Second Great Galactic War. She was most recently and most known for her command to take back Makeb. She is also a member of the Saresh family, a cruel and arrogant Twi'lek family.

</ns5:abstract>
