    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Aric Jorgan is a male Cathar companion character for the Trooper. He joins the player at the end of the Trooper’s Class quests on Ord Mantell. His primary role is that of Ranged DPS, and he is a romance option for the female Trooper.

</rdfs:comment>
