  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Crysta_Markon">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/2374.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dromund_Kaas"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Crysta Markon is an NPC (Non Player Character) in Chapter 1 of the Bounty Hunter Storyline.
When you reach Dromund Kaas you meet her at the Mandalorian Enclave and she becomes your handler.
She gives you your targets for Kaas that allow you to enter the Grand Melee.
After you leave Kaas, you then speak with her after finishing each planet so she may tell you about your next target in the Great Hunt and little info about them.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
