  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Offensive_in_the_Minos_Cluster">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Sith Offensive in the Minos Cluster was a battle in the Minos Cluster between the Sith Empire and the Galactic Republic, and was one of the campaigns of the Great Galactic War.

</ns5:abstract>
