    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Grand Acquisition Race is a worldwide Server Event that started on Tuesday, August 14th. Currently it is not known how long this event will last.
The event currently takes place on Nar Shaddaa and Coruscant, and is designed for any characters that has acquired their starship.

</ns5:abstract>
