  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Game_Rules">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This article provides a full overview of Game Rules for SW:TOR. These are the mechanics and systems provided during gameplay that affect the interaction between the player's character and the game world.

</ns5:abstract>
