    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dark_Council"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Dark_Council"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Darth Mekhis</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Darth Mekhis</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:The_Lost_Suns/Characters"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Mekhis was a female Sith Lord and scientist who fought for the Sith Empire during the Great Galactic War. Despised by the Jedi for her heretical crimes against sentient life in her science which she used to progress Imperial weaponry and expand the territory of the Empire. These services contributed to Mekhis being awarded the prestigious title of Darth.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Female</ns1:gender>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Dark_Council"/>
