  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rhigoth">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
War-Master Rhigoth was a male Humanoid Mandalorian during the Cold War, who had a reputation for hunting Trandoshans, rancors, and even members of the Jedi Order. On Tatooine, he and his men began shaking down merchants in city of Anchorhead. When Ledo Melnic, a local magistrate, called them to get them out of town, they took over the Anchorhead Eastern Warehouse, crippling three security officers. 

</ns5:abstract>
