  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rellu">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
    <ns1:race rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tarro_Blood"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Nar_Shaddaa"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/character"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Nar_Shaddaa"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Relin_Druur.jpg"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Rellu</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:location rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Nar_Shaddaa"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Rellu</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Deceased</ns1:status>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mandalorians"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Rellu was a Human male Mandalorian during the Cold War. He was one of Tarro Blood's followers, working primarily alongside Sedyn Kyne. Rellu, Kyne, and a number of other Mandalorians met on Nar Shaddaa in order to kill Blood's rival, but when the Hunter challenged Sedyn Kyne to a duel, Rellu was named as Sedyn's second. He was killed during the duel.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Rellu</ns1:name>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Rellu</ns4:altLabel>
