    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The GSS-4Y Jurgoran is a gunship used by the Sith Empire. The Jurgoran is similar in appearance to its counterparts the GSS-3 Mangler and the GSS-5C Dustmaker. The Jurgoran is also the direct opposition to the Galactic Republic's SGS-S1 Condor.

</rdfs:comment>
