    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Blaster pistol is the main sidearm of a ranged class. They are not as powerful or precise as Blaster Rifles, but they are faster and can be dual wielded. These are used by both factions, but Sith and the Galactic Republic each have their own unique models.

