  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Binds_on_Equip">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Bertie_Audience_Choice_award_2013.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Binds_on_Use"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Companion_Character"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Binds on Equip (commonly abbreviated to BoE), in game as Binds on Equip, refers to an item to becomes bound to the player when:The player equips the item for use.The item is equipped to a Companion.
The majority of items that drop from open world mobs, are Bind on Equip.

</ns5:abstract>
