    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Jace Malcom served in the Special Forces division of the Republic Army. He is the commander of Havoc Squad, and fought in the Battle of Alderaan against Sith forces, later in life he became the Supreme Commander of the Republic Military.

</ns5:abstract>
