    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Georgia is a rare talent who, at her young age, is a successful and credited Comedian, TV host, actor and voice-over artist. Through her production company "I am Spartacus Entertainment", she is also a credited writer and producer
Ensign_Raina_Temple Imperial Agent's fourth companion.

