    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Master Orgus Din is a Human male Jedi that steps in to be the player's Master when starting a Jedi Knight character. The first time Orgus Din is seen is on the planet Tython. He is a man of action who is haunted by the things he has seen in his past, and has refused to take on a Padawan for years until now.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageExternalLink rdf:resource="http://starwars.wikia.com/wiki/Sith_Offensive_in_the_Minos_Cluster"/>
