    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Lorjan Sakku was a male Jedi thousands of years before the Cold War. He was also the brother of Lyhesh Sakku, and the first Jedi to received the title of Barsen'thor.

</rdfs:comment>
