  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tomb_of_Marka_Ragnos">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Valley_of_the_Dark_Lords"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Marka_Ragnos"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Game_sublevels"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dark_Lord_of_the_Sith"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Locations"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Korriban/Images"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">tomb of Marka Ragnos</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Tomb.png?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Korriban"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Ragnos's tomb</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Tomb of Marka Ragnos was the final resting place of the Dark Lord of the Sith Marka Ragnos. Ragnos ordered his tomb built in the Valley of the Dark Lords, which was lost to record for centuries before Sith archaeologists under Darth Malak excavated it.
Ragnos was buried with his gauntlets, which had the dark power of giving the wearer specialization with the lightsaber.

</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Tomb of Marka Ragnos</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Tomb of Marka Ragnos was the final resting place of the Dark Lord of the Sith Marka Ragnos. Ragnos ordered his tomb built in the Valley of the Dark Lords, which was lost to record for centuries before Sith archaeologists under Darth Malak excavated it.
Ragnos was buried with his gauntlets, which had the dark power of giving the wearer specialization with the lightsaber.

</ns5:abstract>
