  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Officer">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">officers</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An officer is a military class used in many organizations. Mostly, it denoted those placed in command of enlisted soldiers. Some police forces, such as the Coruscant Security Force, also used it as a low level police rank similar to that of constable.</rdfs:comment>
