    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Quesh_war"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Quesh"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Hermaphrodite</ns1:gender>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Portho Kaltemmic is one of the leaders of the Three Families of Quesh. He led the Kaltemmic clan an ruled the Three Families with Broga Masrii and Jeelta Urdosh.
However, Portho allied himself and his clan with the Sith Empire and the Hutt Cartel during the Quesh War, forcing Jeelta and Broga to ally with the Galactic Republic. Ultimately, Portho and Jeelta were killed, leaving Broga to lead the Three Families alone, until Kabbura the Great joined the Three Families.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Portho Kaltemmic</rdfs:label>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Three_Families"/>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Deceased</ns1:status>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Kaltemmic"/>
  </rdf:Description>
