    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The XS Stock light freighter is the Starship available to players of the Smuggler class. The XS Stock light freighter is an advanced successor of past freighter designs, built both for speed and to ensure the security of its occupants and cargo; this vessel's weapons array includes the standard laser and torpedo batteries as well as turrets mounted upon both its upper and lower hemispheres. These turrets can either be controlled manually or from the cockpit. The XS Stock light freighter is designed to accommodate long-distance space travel, and its interior includes dedicated living areas for crew and passengers alike.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageExternalLink rdf:resource="http://starwars.wikia.com/wiki/Return_(cinematic_trailer)"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Smuggler_xs-stock_053.jpg?width=300"/>
