    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">During the reign of the Infinite Empire, a number of space stations were constructed by the Rakata, these included the Star Forge, The Foundry and a mobile space station that could xenoform or terraform entire worlds. The station is said to have been constructed sometime between 35,000 BBY and 25,000 BBY, the station was discovered by the Sith Empire sometime before the Second Great Galactic War.


</rdfs:comment>
