    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Akaavi Spar is a Zabrak who was born into a respected Mandalorian clan and became one of itsfinest warriors.
Akaavi is a Companion for the Smuggler who is found on Balmorra. A male smuggler can have a romantic storyline with her.

</ns5:abstract>
