    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Structures"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Space stations are immense structures built in orbit of a planet or star. Stations built in orbit of a star require special energy shields to protect them from complete meltdown. Space stations serve primarily as docks for large warships and transports, however, some are used as orbital defense platforms, asteroid mining facilities, hospitals, shipyards and in certain cases, full scale factories. Here is a list of space stations used by the various factions since the dawn of space travel.

</rdfs:comment>
