  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tusken_Chieftain">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Tusken Chieftains were the leaders of the Tusken tribes. They often had specially crafted Gaffi Sticks, which were more powerful than average Gaffi Sticks.
Revan had dealings with a Tusken Chieftain during his quest for the Star Forge.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:KotOR"/>
