    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Zakuul Boarding Pod</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Skytrooper"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Zakuul Boarding Pods also known as Zakuulan Boarding Pods or Skytrooper Boarding Pods, are a type of craft used by the Eternal Empire of Zakuul to land troops on enemy starships. The pods carry Skytroopers and have the ability to pierce the hull of a vessel and deploy its passengers inside.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Zakuul Boarding Pod</ns4:altLabel>
