    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/starship"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Zakuul Boarding Pods also known as Zakuulan Boarding Pods or Skytrooper Boarding Pods, are a type of craft used by the Eternal Empire of Zakuul to land troops on enemy starships. The pods carry Skytroopers and have the ability to pierce the hull of a vessel and deploy its passengers inside.

</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
