    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Sith grenadier was a Sith trooper that focused on grenade specialization. They generally carried a variety of grenades ranging from plasma grenades to adhesive grenades. The grenadiers guarding important places, such as the bridge of a ship or the tactical planning room of a base often carried thermal detonators.
All Sith grenadiers also carried vibroblades and Light or Medium Repeating Blasters.

</ns5:abstract>
