    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Master Orgus Din is being held prisoner by Bengel Morr somewhere near the ancient Forge . T7′s scans located a likely holding area inside the Forge entrance along the way to the Forge. Using T7′s scans, you must search the area in the Forge entrance along the path to the ancient Forge and find where Master Orgus is being held.

</ns5:abstract>
