    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Bastila Shan"I'm Bastila Shan, a member of the Jedi Order and a fleet commander for the Republic. Nobody 'owns' me!"―Bastila Shan
[1]
Darth Revan
"I don't think 'killee' is a word..."HK-47
"Exclamation: Damn it, Master! I am an assassination droid, not a dictionary!"Jolee Bindo
"You know the problem with the youth nowadays? They are YOUNG!"</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath///images.wikia.com/starwars/images/9/90/Bastila.jpg"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Bastila Shan"I'm Bastila Shan, a member of the Jedi Order and a fleet commander for the Republic. Nobody 'owns' me!"―Bastila Shan
[1]
Darth Revan
"I don't think 'killee' is a word..."HK-47
"Exclamation: Damn it, Master! I am an assassination droid, not a dictionary!"Jolee Bindo
"You know the problem with the youth nowadays? They are YOUNG!"</ns5:abstract>
