  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darth_Nyriss">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Purebloods"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Nyriss was a female Pureblood Sith Lord serving as one of the most senior members of the Emperor's Dark Council in circa 303 BTC, later she was killed by Revan. 

</ns5:abstract>
