  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Overload">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[[File:.png|16px]] [[|]]
Overload is an ability available to the Sith Inquisitor at level 4. It knocks back all enemies with 8 meters of the Inquisitor. It costs no force, has a range of 8m and is instant cast with a cooldown of 30 seconds.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:range rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">8m</ns1:range>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Overload.png?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Overload (Rank 1)</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns1:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/datatype/second">30.0</ns1:cooldown>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">[[File:.png|16px]] [[|]]
Overload is an ability available to the Sith Inquisitor at level 4. It knocks back all enemies with 8 meters of the Inquisitor. It costs no force, has a range of 8m and is instant cast with a cooldown of 30 seconds.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Overload</rdfs:label>
