    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Rycus Kilran is a Grand Moff of the Sith Empire. He is best known for his role during the Sacking of Coruscant, which earned him the nickname of the "Butcher of Coruscant", and as the pacifier of the Togruta Uprising.

</ns5:abstract>
