    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Planets"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ecumenopolis is a planet, or a moon, whose entire surface is a single city, world wide. Two examples of an ecumenopolis are Coruscant and Nar Shaddaa.
The planet Taris used to be an ecumenopolis as well before Darth Malak destroyed it 300 years ago. For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: ecumenopolis on Wookieepedia
de:Ecumenopolis</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Cityscape</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Nar_Shaddaa"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">An ecumenopolis is a planet, or a moon, whose entire surface is a single city, world wide. Two examples of an ecumenopolis are Coruscant and Nar Shaddaa.
The planet Taris used to be an ecumenopolis as well before Darth Malak destroyed it 300 years ago. For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: ecumenopolis on Wookieepedia
de:Ecumenopolis</ns5:abstract>
