    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Elite Gand Bounty Hunters were Bounty Hunters hired by Rogun the Butcher to kill the Smuggler that had been causing him so much trouble, tracking the Smuggler to Hoth. They attempted to kill the Smuggler with the air they breath in, but they were all defeated. They were armed with Blaster Pistols.

