    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
 Moorint was a Twi'lek male who served as Scout Chief of Kalikori Village on Tython during the Cold War between the Galactic Republic and Sith Empire. He was the lieutenant of the village's Matriarch, Sumari, and later her daughter, Ranna Tao'Ven, as both the village and the Jedi Order fought the Flesh Raiders.

</ns5:abstract>
