    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Korriban"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Republic_Military"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Troopers"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Cold_War"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Great_Galactic_War"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Swtor_2015-01-02_18-06-55-53.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Persons_of_Note"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Republic_Special_Forces"/>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Deceased</ns1:status>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tython"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Rian Darok</ns1:name>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Forge"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Rian Darok was a Human male trooper who served in the Galactic Republic military up until the end of the Cold War. During the outbreak of the Great Galactic War, he secretly defected to the Order of Revan while pretending to still serve in the Republic. Working alongside Darth Arkous, who had also defected, Darok coordinated the attacks on the planets Korriban and Tython at the same time, ensuring that Revanite agent could extract important artifacts from the Jedi Temple and Sith Academy. 
He and Arkous then departed for Manaan to present their findings and have them absolved into new soldiers being created for the Order. Both he and Arkous were present when an individual who had been manipulated into assisting the assaults caught up to them and attempted to stop them, but the two departed in a subnautical vehicle before activating the station's self-destruct sequence. 
The two retreated to the planet Rakata Prime and commanded the final stages of the Star Forge, being recreated with the artifacts recovered from Tython and Korriban. Both were killed when the same individual from Manaan infiltrated and stormed the construction site.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Republic_Special_Forces"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Revanites"/>
