    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">King's Pass is a major area of Alderaan and listed in the in-game Locations sub-section of the Codex. It is one of 6 locations listed for Alderaan.The Code Entry is unlocked by traveling to the area, located southeast of the Juran Mountains.  


