  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dune_Sea">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Tatooine"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Eastern Dune Sea</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Dune Sea</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Tatooine"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sand_People"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Dune Sea or otherwise known as Eastern Dune Sea, was a large section of Tatooine's Dune Sea where deep-desert Sand People lived. The vast expanses ran nearly uninterrupted.
Near the entrance of the Eastern Dune Sea was a cave that at one point contained a massive krayt dragon, who was killed by Revan and another hunter.

</rdfs:comment>
