    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Hammer Station is an early-game Flashpoint for both the Republic and the Empire . It is set on a massive weapon designed to fire asteroids on planets. Your job is to shut it off.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Hammer Station</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageExternalLink rdf:resource="http://swtor.com"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/2R-CH,_%22Torch%22"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Hammer_Station.jpg"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Hammer_Station.jpg?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Hammer Station is an early-game Flashpoint for both the Republic and the Empire . It is set on a massive weapon designed to fire asteroids on planets. Your job is to shut it off.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:caption rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Gather a boarding party to assist you with infiltrating and destroying Hammer Station. A dropship has been disguised as a garbage scow to sneak you aboard.</ns1:caption>
