  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic:_Galactic_Strongholds">
    <ns1:platform rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">PC</ns1:platform>
    <ns1:engine rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">HeroEngine</ns1:engine>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Star Wars: The Old Republic: Galactic Strongholds</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Swtor_2014-09-22_12-29-36-00.png?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en"> Galactic Strongholds is the third expansion to the massively multiplayer online roleplaying game (MMORPG), Star Wars: The Old Republic, set in the Old Republic era. It was developed by BioWare, a division of Electronic Arts and was released on August 19, 2014 to all subscribers and on September 16, 2014 for all preferred status players. It will release for free-to-play players on October 14, 2014. The expansion is free to all and introduced individual bases of operations for players.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Swtor_2014-09-22_12-29-36-00.png"/>
