    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en"> Galactic Strongholds is the third expansion to the massively multiplayer online roleplaying game (MMORPG), Star Wars: The Old Republic, set in the Old Republic era. It was developed by BioWare, a division of Electronic Arts and was released on August 19, 2014 to all subscribers and on September 16, 2014 for all preferred status players. It will release for free-to-play players on October 14, 2014. The expansion is free to all and introduced individual bases of operations for players.

</ns5:abstract>
