    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Imperial Starship 2423T6H3L5 was a starship used by the Sith Empire during the Second Great Galactic War. While the vessel was captained by Lieutenant Commander Ina'irolia'kleoni, its transponder codes were stolen by Combo and used by the Smuggler to board the Imperial Treasury ship King's Ransom.


</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/King%27s_Ransom"/>
