  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Clan_Ordo">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mandalorians"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Knight"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Clan Ordo</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns1:locations rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dxun"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Clan Ordo</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Clan Ordo was a famed Mandalorian clan who have played huge roles in galactic history. Their most famous member, Canderous Ordo who would later become Mandalore the Preserver, who had fought in Great Sith War, Mandalorian Wars, and the Dark Wars.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Corellia"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Treaty_of_Coruscant"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Clan Ordo was a famed Mandalorian clan who have played huge roles in galactic history. Their most famous member, Canderous Ordo who would later become Mandalore the Preserver, who had fought in Great Sith War, Mandalorian Wars, and the Dark Wars.
Canderous Ordo had fought alongside legendary Jedi Knights, Revan and Meetra Surik, being among first of his people to fight alongside Jedi. Canderous would later lead his clan after passing of his wife, Veela Ordo, after claiming Mandalore's Mask. Mandalore would take his clan and several others to Dxun to rebuild the Mandalorians, they would later fight in the Dark Wars against the Sith Triumvirate on Telos IV.
A holostatue of Canderous was erected in the Leisure Garden section of the Axial Park in the Coronet City on Corellia, along with the statues of Revan and his other companions in memory of their deeds. Though group of Mandalorians would be hired to take them down by the Sith Empire.
After the Treaty of Coruscant, Jicoln Cadera and several clans, Clan Ordo included, had attempted to restart what Mandalore the Preserver started by trying aid the Galactic Republic. But they were crushed by Mandalore the Vindicated.
Despite the dishonor brought by Jicoln, the Mandalorian Captain, Corridan Ordo was good friends with Torian Cadera, to whom had spend lot of his time with the clan.

</ns5:abstract>
