  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Komad_Fortuna">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/List_of_KotOR_items#Wraid_Plate"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Twi%27leks"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Komad Fortuna was a male Twi'lek hunter on Tatooine. He lived in Anchorhead and generally hunted Desert Wraids for their skull plates.
Komad, with the help of Revan, killed a bull Krayt dragon.
In Star Wars: Knights of the Old Republic, the player can kill Komad after they kill the dragon, and will gain a krayt dragon pearl out of it if they win. They will also gain dark side points.

</ns5:abstract>
