    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darvannis"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Clan Beroya were clan of Mandalorians who fought alongside Clan Vizla under Shae Vizla during the Galactic War and later in revolt against the Eternal Throne under Mandalore the Avenger. Despite not being members of Clan Vizla, the Mandalorian couple, Jos Beroya and Valk Beroya fought with the clan closely.

</ns5:abstract>
