    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Marka Ragnos</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:title rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Emperor"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Marka Ragnos was a Dark Lord of the Sith during the old Sith Empire and its Golden Age. The Golden Age came to an end with his death.
A young Sith named Tenebrae became the ruler of Medriaas. At age 13, his powers managed to impress Dark Lord Marka Ragnos, ruler of the Sith Empire. Marka Ragnos then recognized him as the ruler of Medriaas and renamed him as Lord Vitiate.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Marka_ragnos_sith_lord.jpg"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Old_Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Deceased</ns1:status>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Pureblood"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Marka_Ragnos.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/180px-Markaragnos.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns1:before rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">None</ns1:before>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/LudoVsSadow.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Marka Ragnos was a Dark Lord of the Sith during the old Sith Empire and its Golden Age. The Golden Age came to an end with his death.
A young Sith named Tenebrae became the ruler of Medriaas. At age 13, his powers managed to impress Dark Lord Marka Ragnos, ruler of the Sith Empire. Marka Ragnos then recognized him as the ruler of Medriaas and renamed him as Lord Vitiate.
After his death, Marka Ragnos's body was put in a tomb. Right in front of the tomb, Ludo Kressh and Naga Sadow fought for control of the Sith Empire. Ragnos's ghost interrupted the duel and told the Sith Lords to choose their decisions carefully.

</ns5:abstract>
