    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Companion_Character"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Blizz is a Jawa companion character of the Bounty Hunter. He joins the player at the end of the Hoth series. He seems to have a quite large and destructive arsenal, which includes rockets, blasters, and perhaps flamethrowers at his disposal.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Persons_of_Note"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Blizz is a Jawa companion character of the Bounty Hunter. He joins the player at the end of the Hoth series. He seems to have a quite large and destructive arsenal, which includes rockets, blasters, and perhaps flamethrowers at his disposal.

</ns5:abstract>
