    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Probe_Medic.png"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Increases the max number of Trauma Probes by 1, increases the healing each charge does by 5% and reduces the rate limits Trauma Probe and Frontline Medic by 0.33 seconds each.

</rdfs:comment>
