    <ns1:health rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Dead</ns1:health>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Masters"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Padawan"/>
    <ns1:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Dar'Nala</ns1:title>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Dar'Nala</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Jedi Master Dar'Nala</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns1:faction rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Galactic Republic</ns1:faction>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Dar%27Nala.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Satele_Shan"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Council"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Fallen_Jedi"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Dar'Nala was a female Togruta Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. She was involved in the peace talks on Alderaan that resulted in the signing of the Treaty of Coruscant. Satele Shan was at one time her Padawan Learner. Consumed by rage over the Sith's treachery, Dar'Nala fell to the Dark side. In an effort to restart the war, she bombed the Senate Tower and attempted to frame the Sith Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Togruta"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Alderaan"/>
    <ns1:race rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Togruta"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Female</ns1:gender>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Fallen_Jedi"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Dar'Nala</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic,_Threat_of_Peace_characters"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Order"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Dar'Nala was a female Togruta Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. She was involved in the peace talks on Alderaan that resulted in the signing of the Treaty of Coruscant. Satele Shan was at one time her Padawan Learner. Consumed by rage over the Sith's treachery, Dar'Nala fell to the Dark side. In an effort to restart the war, she bombed the Senate Tower and attempted to frame the Sith Empire.

</rdfs:comment>
