    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Kassor Quade was a male Kaleesh Mandalorian chieftain of Clan Sharratt. During the Cold War, him and his clan were hired by the Sith Empire (New Established Sith Empire) to test a new Imperial combat adrenal. He then issued a challenge to the Galactic Republic to face him and his clan in combat, or else he will begin ordering his clan to destroy random Republic property on Nar Shaddaa.
When the Republic defenders arrived, they defeated Clan Sharratt and killed Kassor Quade.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Kassor Quade was a male Kaleesh Mandalorian chieftain of Clan Sharratt. During the Cold War, him and his clan were hired by the Sith Empire (New Established Sith Empire) to test a new Imperial combat adrenal. He then issued a challenge to the Galactic Republic to face him and his clan in combat, or else he will begin ordering his clan to destroy random Republic property on Nar Shaddaa.
When the Republic defenders arrived, they defeated Clan Sharratt and killed Kassor Quade.

</rdfs:comment>
