    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The dreadnaught Spirit of Vengeance acts as Mandalore the Vindicated's mobile command center while he is away from his stronghold on Geonosis. Its intimidating silhouette and countless weapon emplacements leave no doubt that the vessel lives up to its name.
Upon emerging victorious in The Great Hunt, the Bounty Hunter was invited aboard.

</ns5:abstract>
