    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Tenbrai</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Tenbrai is a female Human Jedi Master who served the Jedi Order on the Galactic Republic's capital of Coruscant during the Cold War between the Sith Empire and the Republic. A dark-skinned Human, Tenbrai wore armored robes that were brown and tan in color, and she wielded two lightsabers in combat.

</rdfs:comment>
