    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:180px-Traskvsbandon.jpg"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Trask Ulgo was a soldier on the Endar Spire and a bunk mate of  Darth Revan. He worked with Darth Revan  to try to escape the ship, as the Endar Spire was being attacked by a Sith fleet over the atmostphere Taris trying to capture the Jedi, Bastila Shan and the others aboard the spire.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/250px-Trask_ulgo.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Trask Ulgo was a soldier on the Endar Spire and a bunk mate of  Darth Revan. He worked with Darth Revan  to try to escape the ship, as the Endar Spire was being attacked by a Sith fleet over the atmostphere Taris trying to capture the Jedi, Bastila Shan and the others aboard the spire.


</ns5:abstract>
