  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mark_Bazeley">
    <ns5:wikiPageExternalLink rdf:resource="http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0063303/"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Mark-bazeley-bodyfarm.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Mark Bazeley is a British actor who provided the voice and dialogue of the male Sith Warrior.
Bezeley provided the voice of Keenan in BioWare titles Dragon Age: Origins - Awakening and additional voices in Dragon Age II. He also worked on The Bourne Ultimatum and The Damned United.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Voice_Actors"/>
