    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Warrior"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Mark Bazeley is a British actor who provided the voice and dialogue of the male Sith Warrior.
Bezeley provided the voice of Keenan in BioWare titles Dragon Age: Origins - Awakening and additional voices in Dragon Age II. He also worked on The Bourne Ultimatum and The Damned United.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Mark Bazeley</ns4:altLabel>
