  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Karastace_Gonn">
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns1:hp rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5970</ns1:hp>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/character"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Karastace Gonn was a Human male soldier who served the Galactic Republic as a military official near the end of the Cold War against the Sith Empire. Gonn, according to Darth Baras, was the key to the Empire signing the Treaty of Coruscant. This was apparently due to the difficulty the Empire had in tracking him down and killing him. He was responsible for holding together the Fringe Systems during several attempts by Imperial interference to destabilize their governments.

</ns5:abstract>
