  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Immortal_(Discipline)">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Immortal (Discipline)</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Disiplines"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Immortal is one of the three Disciplines avaible for the Juggernaut Advanced Class. It focuses on pure defensive abilities.
As the toughest of the Warriors, the Immortal Juggernaut can withstand even the most brutal assaults. Using the Force to turn nearly invincible for short burts of time and deliver crushing blows to the enemy, this Juggernaut is captable of taking a beating and giving one, too.
</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Immortal is one of the three Disciplines avaible for the Juggernaut Advanced Class. It focuses on pure defensive abilities.
As the toughest of the Warriors, the Immortal Juggernaut can withstand even the most brutal assaults. Using the Force to turn nearly invincible for short burts of time and deliver crushing blows to the enemy, this Juggernaut is captable of taking a beating and giving one, too.
</rdfs:comment>
