    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Meetra Surik is discovered by the Sith on the Peragus Mining Facility.Meetra Surik journeys to Nar Shaddaa, Korriban, Dantooine and Onderon to reunite the Jedi High Council.Telos IV is attacked by Darth Nihilus.The Sith Triumvirate is defeated by Meetra Surik.

