    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Locations"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Ridgeside Sentry post is location in Jundland of Tatooine and is one of Tatooine Outposts.This taxi is used for Imperial players to easily navigate the vast area of Jundland. 
Republic Players cannot enter this area. This location is for Imperial Players only.</rdfs:comment>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Ridgeside Sentry Post</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Ridgeside Sentry post is location in Jundland of Tatooine and is one of Tatooine Outposts.This taxi is used for Imperial players to easily navigate the vast area of Jundland. 
Republic Players cannot enter this area. This location is for Imperial Players only.</ns5:abstract>
