    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/UtharWynn.jpg?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Uthar Wynn was a human male Sith Master and Headmaster of the Sith Academy on Korriban during the Jedi Civil War. He was killed by Revan and Yuthura Ban in the Tomb of Naga Sadow.

