    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Every planet offers a different set of Social Armor. Social armor is adaptable (which means it will count as whatever armor is best for who is wearing it) and requires a certain social level. A few other special armor sets are sold from the Security Key vendor and Starship Upgrade vendor, and Collector's Edition Vendor.
</ns5:abstract>
