    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Senator</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Republic Senators</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Jedi_Council_Great_Galactic_War.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Senators are representatives of their planet, system, and/or sector in the Galactic Senate of the Galactic Republic. They often worked alongside Associate Representatives.
They also acted as sectorial heads of state in the Old Republic. Some senators alternately represented very powerful megacorporations and industries. During the waning days of the Old Republic, many senators had fallen to corruption and decadence, while others strove to uphold the ideals of democracy.
 For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: Galactic Senate on Wookieepedia
de:Senator
</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Senator</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Jedi_Council_Great_Galactic_War.jpg"/>
