  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Stun">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A weapon that could be set to stun was popular with security forces throughout galaxy. The stun setting enabled the character to incapacitate their opponent without seriously injuring them.


</rdfs:comment>
