    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/KaasCityCentralTaxi.png?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Taxi Systems</rdfs:label>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Planets"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Travel"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">taxis</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Taxi</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/%0ATaxiswtor.png?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dromund_Kaas"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The game includes a taxi system which allows the players to travel for a few credits to certain locations they have visited before on the same world. Those taxi terminals they travel to must also be unlocked, with the exception of some planets such as Coruscant. The vehicle (or maybe even mount) used depends on the planet.
In addition, there is a teleportation system on the world of Belsavis that functions in a manner similar to the taxi systems of other worlds (including Belsavis) in the galaxy. In this particular instance, however, the teleportation system acts separately from Belsavis' taxi system and does not connect to any of its stops.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/2010-04-23-DC01-1600x900.jpg"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/2010-04-23-DC01-1600x900.jpg?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The game includes a taxi system which allows the players to travel for a few credits to certain locations they have visited before on the same world. Those taxi terminals they travel to must also be unlocked, with the exception of some planets such as Coruscant. The vehicle (or maybe even mount) used depends on the planet.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/KaasCityCentralTaxi.png"/>
  </rdf:Description>
