    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/darkside"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Twi%27lek"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Tython_Missions"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Tazonthe Ghon, a Twi'lek Pilgrim living in Kalikori Village has told you that one of his people's patrols were attacked by the Flesh Raider. His father was one of the scouts who did not return. Tazonthe wants you to find out what happened to his father. Search the caves near Kalikori for any sign of his fate. If you find any sign of Tazonthe's father, return to Kalikori and inform Tazonthe of what's happened.

</rdfs:comment>
