    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Blue Sphere Transport Enclosure Vehicle is a unique vehicle built by the Gree, these craft are able to travel across the Galaxy at very high speeds. During the Second Great Galactic War, Gree merchants on Ilum supply these vehicles to space travelers ready to buy them from the enigmatic aliens. 

</rdfs:comment>
