    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Increases damage dealt with technological abilities. It affects both offensive and defensive abilities.
Prior to Star Wars: The Old Republic: Knights of the Fallen Empire this was the primary statistic of the Imperial Agent and Smuggler. With the release of KotFE all classes use Mastery as their primary stat.</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Statistics"/>
