    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Species"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/SS_20100521_bh02_full.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Lanar Pirate Captain</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Commander Agan Sort</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Human</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Human-jedi.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Humans are a bipedal sentient race whose primary language is Galactic Basic Standard. They are referred to as the galaxy's most numerous species, due to the fact that they can be born and live on almost all worlds. They have had a hand in the creation of many galactic factions, and are known as one of the oldest species next to the Duros. The Human species is a playable species in-game and is one of the three species automatically available to both Free-To-Play and Preferred Status players.

</ns5:abstract>
