    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The M-7 Razorwire is a bomber produced by the shipyards at Sernpidal for use in the Sith Empire. Primarily a minelayer, the Razorwire is also equipped with denfensive laser cannons. The Razorwire is also similar in appearance to the B-28 Extinction-class bomber.


</ns5:abstract>
