  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/General_Minst%27s_Double">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mission:General_Minst"/>
    <ns1:location rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Reactor Core</ns1:location>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rodian"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
General Minst's Double was used by General Minst to set a trap in the Reactor Core of Transport Station 5. The Empire had sent a Sith Warrior to kill him, so General Minst overloaded the reactor core and left his double, a lowly grunt, to confront the Sith Warrior with the intent to stall the Sith long enough for the reactor to explode. General Minst meanwhile hid in a sealed vault to protect himself against the blast.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Warrior"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">General Minst's Double</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Unknown</ns1:status>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/General_Minst_Double.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns1:faction rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sith Empire</ns1:faction>
    <ns1:location rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Transport Station 5</ns1:location>
    <ns1:race rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rodian"/>
    <ns1:level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">35</ns1:level>
    <ns1:strength rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Normal</ns1:strength>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tularan_Marsh"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
General Minst's Double was used by General Minst to set a trap in the Reactor Core of Transport Station 5. The Empire had sent a Sith Warrior to kill him, so General Minst overloaded the reactor core and left his double, a lowly grunt, to confront the Sith Warrior with the intent to stall the Sith long enough for the reactor to explode. General Minst meanwhile hid in a sealed vault to protect himself against the blast.


</ns5:abstract>
