  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Force_Ghost">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">A Force ghost was the soul and essence of a deceased Force-sensitive who managed to retain their consciousness after death, and yet was able to interact with the living, albeit not physically. Some Sith Lords learned similar techniques, which in some cases allowed them to overcome the restriction from physical actions. 

</ns5:abstract>
