    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Darth Traya, (born Kreia), was a Human female Jedi Master/Jedi Consular, later Sith Lady who was exiled from the Jedi Order for making controversial questions about the Force, to many of her Jedi padawans, including Revan. She traveled the galaxy in search of power. After the Jedi Civil War, She founded the Trayus Academy, a secret academy to train Sith and turn Jedi to the Dark side. She and the other Sith Lords, Darth Sion and Darth Nihilus, created the Sith Triumvirate which caused the Jedi Purge. She took the title Lord of Betrayal; ironically, she was betrayed by her apprentices, stripped of the Force and exiled. She journeyed with Meetra Surik to find the former Jedi Council named Kavar, Lonna Vash, Zez-Kai Ell and Vrook Lamar which exiled her as well.</rdfs:comment>
