    <ns1:type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Damage</ns1:type>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Charged Shot is an ability that is available to Doc, Elara Dorne, Guss Tuno, Mako, Malavai Quinn, Talos Drellik and Tharan Cedrax at level 1. This ability is the primary damage over time ability of a majority of the healing-orientated companions with the exception being Doctor Lokin.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Wounding Blast</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Charged Shot is an ability that is available to Doc, Elara Dorne, Guss Tuno, Mako, Malavai Quinn, Talos Drellik and Tharan Cedrax at level 1. This ability is the primary damage over time ability of a majority of the healing-orientated companions with the exception being Doctor Lokin.


</ns5:abstract>
