    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Knight_(rank)"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Order"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Solania is a male Human who served the Jedi Order and the Galactic Republic as a Jedi Master during the Galactic War with the Sith Empire. A tan-skinned Human with black eyes and a black goatee, Solania wore gray robes and armor or a set of yellow-brown combat armor. Solania wielded a single lightsaber and spent much of his time on the space station Carrick Station, equipping Jedi Knights with gear.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Galactic_Republic"/>
