    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Rimark was a male Mandalorian warlord who fought during the Galactic War. He had stolen the construction plans for the Void Anvil, a top Republic mining station and shipyard. He attempted to sale the construction plans to the Sith Empire (New Established Sith Empire) but Republic Forces had caught up to him and destroyed the shuttle carrying the plans along with him.

</ns5:abstract>
