    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
An unnamed individual was a member of the Jedi Order during the Great Sith War, during which he led a bombing raid against the Mandalorian Crusaders. One of his bombs killed Varda, the Mandalorian lover of Jedi Master Dorjander Kace, who had been living among the Mandalorians since they captured him earlier in the war.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Crusaders"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
An unnamed individual was a member of the Jedi Order during the Great Sith War, during which he led a bombing raid against the Mandalorian Crusaders. One of his bombs killed Varda, the Mandalorian lover of Jedi Master Dorjander Kace, who had been living among the Mandalorians since they captured him earlier in the war.

</ns5:abstract>
