    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Jedi Watchmen were special Jedi whose role was to watch over a planet or sector of space and work with local governments to resolve disputes peacefully. Watchmen also scouted local inhabitants for signs of Force sensitivity and were unusual among the Jedi Order in that they often trained multiple students at once.

