    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Keenor was a male Human Republic soldier who fought during the Cold War. When Clan Varad had taken Allusis, Keenor was dispatched with a striketeam by Grand Master Satele Shan. However him and the team were killed during the fighting. Oddly he wore RD-15B Commando armor, a Mandalorian armor.

</ns5:abstract>
