    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Parjai</ns4:altLabel>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Parjai, named after the Mando'a word for "Victory", was a Kandosii-type dreadnought used by the Mandalorians during the Mandalorian Wars. The Parjai was among the Mandalorian warships that fought at the Siege of Taris.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
