    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Kandosii-type_dreadnought"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Parjai, named after the Mando'a word for "Victory", was a Kandosii-type dreadnought used by the Mandalorians during the Mandalorian Wars. The Parjai was among the Mandalorian warships that fought at the Siege of Taris.

</ns5:abstract>
