    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Speeder Bikes were hovering repulsor-lift vehicles, usually seated for up to two people. Speeder Bikes were more popular than other Speeders, such as Air and Landspeeders, to teenagers and military personnel.
The Speeder Bikes available may vary depending on the Class that has been chosen by the player and whether they are aligned with the Galactic Republic or the Sith Empire.


</ns5:abstract>
