    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Vally of the Dark Lords is the first area you will encounter enemies as a Sith Warrior or Sith Inquisitor. You will also receive your first codex after walking down the ramp. All the enemies are at a low level which makes it a good place to level up your character before heading into the Tomb of Ajunta Pall.

</ns5:abstract>
