    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Mk. VII Advanced interceptor was a single seat starfighter that was used by the Sith Empire during the Great Galactic War and Cold War. Sith apprentice Eldon Ax flew one of these interceptors during the Battle of Sebaddon.


