    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Storm Fire was a large starship used by the Sith Empire during the Great Galactic War. The vessel was shot down by the Republic Navy during the Battle of Hoth in 3,665 BBY, it now forms part of the aeria on Hoth known as the Starship Graveyard.

