    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Chiss_Ascendancy"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Csilla.jpg?width=300"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/wookieepedia-more"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Chiss"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Csilla is an ice-covered world of glaciers and snowy wastes located deep within Chiss Space. It is acknowledged as the homeworld of the Chiss. A part of the Unknown Regions, Csilla also serves as the capital of the Chiss Ascendancy.
  For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: Csilla on Wookieepedia
</ns5:abstract>
