    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Grand Master is the title granted to a Jedi Master who is the elected leader of the Jedi Order and head of the Jedi High Council. After the tragic death of Zym, the current Grand Master is Satele Shan, making her the youngest Jedi ever to rise to the position.

</ns5:abstract>
