    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Oteg</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
 
Oteg is a Jedi Master held in high admiration by the Jedi Order. He is a member of a very rare Force-sensitive species with only one other known member, Master Vandar Tokare, a famed Jedi Master who died in the Jedi Purge.
He is responsible for briefing a team on the rescue of an important Jedi being held prisoner by the Sith Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
