    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">You agreed to help Officer Anstiss apprehend an elusive Houk suspect by the name of Gambo. To reach Gambo, you’ll need to provoke Zooki, his Rodian lookout. Zooki spends his time in the Dealer’s Den cantina.

