    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Operative is one of the two Imperial Agent Advanced Classes. As an Operative the Imperial Agent uses close range tactics such as a "shiv" ability to eliminate their targets. They also use stealth abilities to conceal their presence on the battlefield and position themselves for attack on foes. They are able to heal their allies utilizing advanced medical technologies, making the Agent a vital colleague on the battlefield.
</rdfs:comment>
