    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Characters"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Belth_Allusis_Botha.png?width=300"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/character"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Belth_Allusis_Botha.png"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Jedi Master Belth Allusis was the leader of the Republic troops defending Bothawui during its invasion. He sacrificed his life to keep the shield generators of Bothawui in Republic hands as long as possible. Although Master Allusis died in his mission, he succeeded in forcing the Battle of Bothawui to a draw. His courage was recorded in the Jedi Archives compiled by fellow Master Gnost-Dural to be an example to future generations of Jedi.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Masters"/>
