  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mining_on_Makeb">
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Mining on Makeb</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">[Republic]: You can receive this codex through small blue plaque by a Computer Terminal. Cartel Mining Mesa Archon Quarry. It is in Communications Bunker 31 right behind where the Taxi lands (X: -311 ; Y: 2958 ).
[Empire]: You can receive this codex through small blue plaque by a Computer Terminal. Cartel Mining Mesa The Spillway. It is in Communications Bunker 33 right behind where the Taxi lands(X: -837 ; Y: 2120 ).


</ns5:abstract>
