  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mission:_Lovers_and_Secrets">
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Lovers and Secrets</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Silvarte"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Master Silvarte And Master Yollo believe their padawans Moracen and Spanios, are involved in a romantic relationship. Such passions could lead them to forsake their training and lead to the dark side.Master Silvarte and Master Yollo have asked you to confront Moracen and Spanios and discover the truth of their relationship. Travel to the ruins of Kaleth and speak with Moracen and Spanions.

</rdfs:comment>
