  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Swoop_bike">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Davik_Kang"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Swarmer_Ability_Icon.png"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Swoop bikes were fast, light one-man repulsor vehicles used for racing. They were incredibly quick and agile, and useful for quick getaways and high-speed racing.
There were often swoop races held on official tracks on many planets, such as Tatooine, Manaan, and Taris before it was destroyed. Davik Kang had stowed a swoop bike in the Ebon Hawk before Taris was destroyed, and Revan used it to become Sector Champion of Manaan and the track champion on Tatooine.
Calo Nord used a swoop to traverse the deserts of Tatooine.

</ns5:abstract>
