    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Swoop bikes were fast, light one-man repulsor vehicles used for racing. They were incredibly quick and agile, and useful for quick getaways and high-speed racing.
There were often swoop races held on official tracks on many planets, such as Tatooine, Manaan, and Taris before it was destroyed. Davik Kang had stowed a swoop bike in the Ebon Hawk before Taris was destroyed, and Revan used it to become Sector Champion of Manaan and the track champion on Tatooine.
Calo Nord used a swoop to traverse the deserts of Tatooine.

</rdfs:comment>
