    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Seethe"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Sith Inquisitors, depending on what advanced class you choose, can use their Force Lightning to high effect and their healing abilities as well. Or, they can unlock stealth and high powered melee abilities with double bladed sabers for tanking.

</ns5:abstract>
