    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Angral was a Sith Lord of the reconstituted Empire active during the Great Galactic and Cold Wars. A ruthless and brilliant strategist, Angral commanded the Imperial force that devastated the Republic capital of Coruscant during the Great Galactic War.

