    <ns1:stats rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Critical_Rating"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en"> Isric a male Human Imperial Trooper and is the first boss in The Esseles Flashpoint.He is a lieutenant within the Imperial Navy under the command of Grand Moff Kilran. He was ordered by Kilran to board The Esseles and take Ambassador Asara into custody. Accompanied by two imperial boarding droids and two Imperial Troopers, lieutenant Isric boarded The Esseles through the primary airlock. Seeing ambassador Vyn Asara, whom he was tasked with capturing, he ordered the troopers to capture her at all costs. His boarding action, however, was thwarted by a group of Republic heroes. 

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Critical_Rating"/>
    <ns1:reqprof rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">heavy</ns1:reqprof>
