    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Revanchists, also known as the Jedi Crusaders, were an unsanctioned renegade faction of the Jedi Order who assisted the Galactic Republic during the Mandalorian Wars. The movement was formed by Jedi Knight Revan and Jedi Knight Alek in opposition to what they saw as inaction by the Jedi Council against the invading Mandolarian Neo-Crusaders.

</rdfs:comment>
