    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Baron Remulus Dreypa was a male Human Jedi Admiral who fell to the dark side of the Force and became one of the first Sith Lords of the Sith Empire. After his fall, he became the first admiral of the Dark Jedi naval forces.

</ns5:abstract>
