    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Deron Cadoruso was a male Human Mandalorian individual who lived during the Galactic War. He and his Mandalorians joined with the Order of Revan when Revan returned. During the Battle of Yavin 4, he and his men were killed during the fighting. 

