    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Deals 1795-1923 kinetic damage, knocks the target back several meters and knocks the target down for 2 seconds.  Force Push immediately finishes the cooldown of Force Charge.</ns1:description>
