    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Tomb was a Rakatan prison located on Belsavis that was converted into a Republic prison. It housed many of the galaxy's most dangerous beings. It later served as home to many of the Republic's enemies, including the Sith, their allies, and their creations.

