    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Saul Karath was a human who served in the Sith Navy during the Jedi Civil War. Before that, Karath served as an admiral in the Republic Navy during the Mandalorian Wars. After the newly turned Revan and Malak returned as Sith Lords of the Sith Empire, Karath betrayed the Republic and joined with the Sith Empire.
</rdfs:comment>
