Newar Forrth, or New'arforrth in his native tongue, was a male Twi'lek Jedi Master serving the Jedi Order and the Galactic Republic during the latter decades of the Republic Dark Age. The leader of the Nercathi clan, Newar was a Jedi Lord on Ryloth, ruling his constituents in return for protecting the planet from the New Sith Empire.


</ns5:abstract>
