    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Breyer Chorn was a male Mandalorian warrior who fought against the Eternal Empire. On Darvannis his clan were given the mission to shut the shield generators of the Droid Factory while Torian Cadera and the Outlander would set the blaster cannons on the factory once shields were down.

</rdfs:comment>
