    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Missions"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Ord_Mantell"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Clearing the Air is a mission that can be obtained at Level 1 by either the Smuggler or Trooper on Ord Mantell. The mission involves disabling three Signal Jammers so that Sergeant Blyes can reestablish contact with HQ.

</ns5:abstract>
