  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Powertech">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Rsz_powertech_854x480.jpg"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Advance_the_Line.png"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Powertechs"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Powertechs"/>
    <ns1:armor rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Heavy</ns1:armor>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Powertech is one of the two Advanced Classes of the Bounty Hunter, It is the "tanking" AC for Bounty Hunters, and focuses heavily on the use of Gadgets, Energy Shields, and the Flamethrower. Although Powertech has a lot of ranged abilities, all 3 Powertech specs require Melee range to achieve maximum potential.
A Powertech wears heavy plating body armor  like a second skin and never balks at taking on the newest prototype technology if it means greater protection and upgraded safeguards. The best in armor shielding, smart defensive tactics and high-powered flamethrowers combine to make the Powertech an impenetrable one-man blockade, from which few enemies escape unscathed. In a group, Powertechs are vital, so if you are a healer class, keep your Powertech healthy.
Both Shield Tech and Advanced Prototype become very "heat efficient" as you gain levels/talents, allowing you to deal a lot of damage without a risk of overheating.
Primary Focus:FlamethrowerDefense / Energy ShieldMelee DPS or Tank

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Advanced Class: Powertech</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns1:primeattributes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Aim</ns1:primeattributes>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/advanceclass"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Pyrotech.png?width=300"/>
