    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Infiltration is a skill tree of the Jedi Shadow advanced class. It focuses on inflicting damage from stealth and using positional attacks. In RPG terms this tree is a melee DPS tree.
The following table contains the known skills that can be gained from this tree:

</ns5:abstract>
