    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:PvP"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Titles are rewards that are obtainable by players through most game activities. 
The in-game Codex "Achievement: Titles" entry shows all unlocked titles and how each title was earned.
Your character's title is visible to other players as part of the nameplate. Titles can be selected or hidden via the top left icon on the Character Sheet.

</ns5:abstract>
