    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:French_Servers"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">What is a server?
A server is a game world wherein a set number of people play within it. Each server has its own set of player characters within it. Players within a server can interact with one another, but they cannot interact with players from other servers. 

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Servers"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:English_Servers"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Servers List</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">What is a server?
A server is a game world wherein a set number of people play within it. Each server has its own set of player characters within it. Players within a server can interact with one another, but they cannot interact with players from other servers. 

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:US_East_Servers"/>
  </rdf:Description>
