    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">T7-O1 is a companion character for the Jedi Knight class. This droid is the first companion character that becomes available to the Jedi Knight, joining him or her at some point during the Tython origin story.
T7-O1 is featured in Deceived, with his first known owner, Master Ven Zallow.

</ns5:abstract>
