    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Game_Systems"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A huge part of Star Wars: The Old Republic involves talking with other players; Your guild, party, or other players on the same planet. You'll use the chat to group up for heroics, find and join guilds, get questions answered in-game, and sometimes sell items.

</rdfs:comment>
