    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Darth Silthar is a male human Sith Lord based on Tatooine, charged with the investigation into the secrets of the long abandoned Czerka arms base. At some point he was captured by the Sand People after he slaughtered a number during his search for the secrets he sought. 

</ns5:abstract>
