  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sundering_Assault">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">"Sundering assault" is one of the Sith Juggernaut's main threat building abilities that's obtained at level 10. This skill reduces the armor rating of the targeted enemy NPC or player. It starts with applying one "stack" of the debuff to the target. It can be altered through skill points placed in the Immortal section to apply two stacks with one use.
</rdfs:comment>
