    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">A Mule Out Of Water</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">A Mule out of water is the first companion mission available from the Smuggler companion Corso Riggs. This quest is given by Corso once the player has achieved an affection rating with him of around +3000. After receiving a tip off about the whereabouts of his cousin, Corso Riggs has asked the smuggler to journey to Coruscant with him in order to follow up this lead.

</ns5:abstract>
