    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Arm Yourself is the first mission in the Sith Warrior's story arc. The Warrior will gain this quest automatically after disembarking their ship and talking with Overseer Tremel. Tremel will send the Warrior into Ajunta Pall's tomb to retrieve the Sith Warblade.

