    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Duran Gorr was a male Human Mandalorian raider who lived during the Cold War. On Taris, him and his men stole Galactic Republic warheads from them. However even when Duran was known to kill Jedi Masters, when the Republic Army forces shown up, him and his men were killed during the fighting. 

</ns5:abstract>
