  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Trandoshan">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Trandoshans"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Qyzen_Fess"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Trandoshan.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Trandosha"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Trandoshan</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Wookiee"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Consular"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Screen01_trandoshan_800x450.jpg"/>
    <ns1:homeworld rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Trandosha"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/screen03_trandoshan.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Trandoshans (T'doshok in their language) are large, bipedal reptilian humanoids from the planet Trandosha (or Dosha). They have super-sensitive eyes that could see into the infrared range and the ability to regenerate lost limbs, although very slowly. Trandoshans are anatomically built heavier and stronger than most humanoids, including Humans. They also periodically shed their skin. Unlike some other reptilian humanoids such as the Barabels and the Ssi-ruuk, Trandoshans have no tails.
As a species, they are renowned across the galaxy for great strength. This is evidenced by several members of other species boasting physical prowess and power by having defeated a Trandoshan, either in battle or in a contest of strength. The racial tensions between Trandoshans and Wookiees will be found in SWTOR storylines.Qyzen Fess is a Trandoshan companion for the Jedi Consular

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Trandoshans (T'doshok in their language) are large, bipedal reptilian humanoids from the planet Trandosha (or Dosha). They have super-sensitive eyes that could see into the infrared range and the ability to regenerate lost limbs, although very slowly. Trandoshans are anatomically built heavier and stronger than most humanoids, including Humans. They also periodically shed their skin. Unlike some other reptilian humanoids such as the Barabels and the Ssi-ruuk, Trandoshans have no tails.
</rdfs:comment>
