    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">A Gray Jedi is an informal title for a force-user who walks the line between the Light and Dark sides of the Force without giving into to the temptations of the Dark side. Jolee Bindo was an example of a self-confessed gray Jedi during the Jedi Civil War.

