    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Novin Kelke was a male Mandalorian merchant who lived during the Galactic War. On Corellia, he made armor, as well as armor upgrades to anyone with enough credits. He wore brown and silver Mandalorian armor.

</ns5:abstract>
