  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Saber_Strike">
    <ns1:force rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">none</ns1:force>
    <ns1:range rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">4m</ns1:range>
    <ns1:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Lightsaber"/>
    <ns1:ctime rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Instant</ns1:ctime>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Saber Strike</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Saber Strike</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Saber_Strike.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Consular"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Stubs"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Sage"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Saber Strike</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:class rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Consular"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/ability_tooltip"/>
    <ns1:icon rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Saber_Strike.jpg"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Saber_Strike.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Shadow"/>
    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Deals 100% weapon damage spread across a flurry of three lightsaber strikes.</ns1:description>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Lightsaber"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">[[File:.png|16px]] [[|]]
Saber Strike is a starting ability for the Jedi Consular. It is the first lightsaber attack that the Consular has. It causes the weapon damage that is stated, but it divides it over 3 attacks. This ability costs no force, has a range of 4m and is an instant cast with no cooldown.


</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[[File:.png|16px]] [[|]]
Saber Strike is a starting ability for the Jedi Consular. It is the first lightsaber attack that the Consular has. It causes the weapon damage that is stated, but it divides it over 3 attacks. This ability costs no force, has a range of 4m and is an instant cast with no cooldown.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Stubs"/>
