    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Masters"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Jadus was an enigmatic Sith Master and a member of the Dark Council. Standing out from his fellow council members, he was least prone to rage, keeping his emotions that fuel the dark side to himself. He was able to keep them hidden from everyone, including the Emperor. He believed, as some other Dark Council members do, that he should be worshiped as a god for his position in the Empire.
Darth Zhorrid, his daughter, was also his only known apprentice.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Darth Jadus</ns1:name>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/character"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Jadus was an enigmatic Sith Master and a member of the Dark Council. Standing out from his fellow council members, he was least prone to rage, keeping his emotions that fuel the dark side to himself. He was able to keep them hidden from everyone, including the Emperor. He believed, as some other Dark Council members do, that he should be worshiped as a god for his position in the Empire.
Darth Zhorrid, his daughter, was also his only known apprentice.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">'''Darth Jadus'''</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Dromund_Kaas"/>
  </rdf:Description>
