  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Gizmel_Gam">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Humans"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Gizmel Gam</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/character"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
 Gizmel Gam was a human citizen of Ord Mantell and a spice addict. His addiction to spice got the better of him during the Republic's conflict with the Ord Mantell Separatist Movement, when he ordered a shipment of spice from offworld disguised as a relief shipment. He paid an operative to retrive his payload, claiming that it was a container of supplies to help Oradam Village. The operative discovered the true nature of the shipment, seeing that the delivery ship had been shot down by Separatist forces.

</ns5:abstract>
