    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sith Battle Suit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Sith battle suit was armor created by Aratech. The Sith title was used by the company in an attempt to gain sales by using the infamous Sith reputation as a selling feature. It was much more flexible then rival sets of armor and still offered high protection. The armor followed the standard Sith armor colors of black and silver.

</rdfs:comment>
