  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Scavenging">
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Scavenging</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Gathering_Skills"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Armstech"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Scavenging</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Armstech_Icon1.png"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cybertech_Icon1.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Gathering"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Scavenging is one of the four Gathering Skills. It involves the art of recovering useful materials from parts of old or damaged technology.
This crafting skill has levels from 1 - 400.
When performing a Gathering skill you send one of your five companions out to perform the task. The starting tasks take 3 minutes and get longer as you earn skill points. There are also times you can earn blue/purple scavenging items that require a high level for example 250.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Scavenging</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Armormech_Icon1.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Armormech_Icon1.png"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/quote"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Cybertech_Icon1.png"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Crew_Skills"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Video:SWTOR_Scavenging_Guide"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Armormech_Icon1.png?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Crew_Skills"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Armormech"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Crew_Skills"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cybertech_Icon1.png?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Armstech_Icon1.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Cybertech"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Gathering"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Armstech_Icon1.png?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Scavenging is one of the four Gathering Skills. It involves the art of recovering useful materials from parts of old or damaged technology.
This crafting skill has levels from 1 - 400.
When performing a Gathering skill you send one of your five companions out to perform the task. The starting tasks take 3 minutes and get longer as you earn skill points. There are also times you can earn blue/purple scavenging items that require a high level for example 250.
thumb|300px|right|SWTOR Scavenging GuideYou can have all your companions working on this skill but after awhile less of them at the current level will be available, you can still go back to previous levels and choose those missions until they return. You also can perform scavenging on droid types that you kill in the game. When you perform this if a companion is with you they will take care of it so you can keep doing what you need to.


</ns5:abstract>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Torian_Cadera">
    <ns1:primaryWeapon rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Techstaff"/>
