    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Bounty_Hunter_Companions"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Torian Cadera is a Human Mandalorian male companion for the Bounty Hunter. He joins the player at the end of the Taris series and is the third companion the BH acquires. 
A female Bounty Hunter may have a romantic storyline with him.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Torian Cadera is a Human Mandalorian male companion for the Bounty Hunter. He joins the player at the end of the Taris series and is the third companion the BH acquires. 
A female Bounty Hunter may have a romantic storyline with him.

</rdfs:comment>
