    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/quote"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Codex"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/House_Rist"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Juran Mountains is a major area of Alderaan and listed in the in-game Locations sub-section of the Codex. It is one of 6 locations listed for Alderaan.The Codex entry is unlocked simply by traveling into the area, which is located southeast of Kaamos Territory and northeast of King's Pass.


</rdfs:comment>
