  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Hunter_(Belsavis)">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Belsavis"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Mandalorian Hunters were Mandalorians that were captured by the Galactic Republic for destroying a back water planet and were sent to Belsavis for it. However they escaped when the Sith Empire (New Established Sith Empire) arrived and freed the prisoners. They were armed with Sniper Rifles.

</ns5:abstract>
