    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Jabiim Escort is a Space Battle available to players as soon as they have acquired their own starship. The Jabiim Escort Space Mission Quest can be picked up using the fleet communication device. This space battle is the sole space battle mission required for the Operation Silent Roar player mission.

</ns5:abstract>
