    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Forn Dodonna was an Admiral for the Republic Navy during the Jedi Civil War. Dodonna was signaled by Carth Onasi, a Captain in the Republic Navy who was travelling with the redeemed Revan, when he found the Star Forge, an ancient facility created by the Rakatan Infinite Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
