    <ns1:type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Cruiser</ns1:type>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Farstar was a Valor-class cruiser used by the Galactic Republic during the Second Great Galactic War. The vessel was part of the Republic Navy's First Expeditionary Fleet, and it participated in the Battle of Taral V and the following Battle of the Maelstrom.

</ns5:abstract>
