  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mission:Crushing_the_Jedi_Freedom_Fighters">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This quest is a heroic 4 quest and is repeatable.
Of the Heroics I would consider this the tougher one, tightly packed enemies that hit pretty hard. It is shorter than a Pound of Flesh but more chances to pull an extra pack and die.


</ns5:abstract>
