  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Alif">
    <ns1:race rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Alif is a Male Human being held prisoner by Inquisitor Zyn. Information is extracted though either persuasion or torture by another young apprentice.
Zyn states that he was a failed acolyte who witnessed an "unauthorized murder" within the Sith Academy.

</ns5:abstract>
