  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Kath_hounds">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Alderaan"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Kath hounds</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Bestiary"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Kath Hound</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dantooine"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Corellia"/>
    <ns1:homeworld rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dantooine"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/bestiary"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Creatures"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Kath hounds are dog-like creatures native to the planet Dantooine. Some variants have horns. They were known for striding across the planet mostly in packs, attacking humanoid species on sight. After the Jedi Civil War, groups of kath hounds started roaming the Jedi Temple on Dantooine. Some kath hounds were shipped off-world and tamed, such as Vogga's personal hounds on Nar Shaddaa. Spreading throught the galaxy in worlds such as Alderaan,Balmorra and Corellia, over the years they mutated into becoming bigger and stronger, with thicker horns.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Karu1.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Nar_Shaddaa"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_II:_The_Sith_Lords"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Vogga"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Kath hounds are dog-like creatures native to the planet Dantooine. Some variants have horns. They were known for striding across the planet mostly in packs, attacking humanoid species on sight. After the Jedi Civil War, groups of kath hounds started roaming the Jedi Temple on Dantooine. Some kath hounds were shipped off-world and tamed, such as Vogga's personal hounds on Nar Shaddaa. Spreading throught the galaxy in worlds such as Alderaan,Balmorra and Corellia, over the years they mutated into becoming bigger and stronger, with thicker horns.

</ns5:abstract>
