    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mastery"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Trooper"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Attributes"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Increases ranged damage dealt and increases your critical hit chance with ranged weapons.
Prior to the release of Star Wars: The Old Republic: Knights of the Fallen Empire this was the primary statistic of the Trooper and Bounty Hunter. With the release of KotFE all classes use Mastery as their primary stat.
This stat can be increased through certain datacrons scattered throughout the galaxy.</rdfs:comment>
