    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Kaltemmic</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Kaltemmic was a family or Hutt clan led by Portho Kaltemmic and was one of the three clans in the Three Families. Portho led it up until his death during the Quesh War.
</ns5:abstract>
