    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">There are numerous crime syndicates operating galaxy wide, many of their operations are considered illegal under both the Galactic Republic and the Sith Empire; these include slavery, contract killings, smuggling and spice dealing. The two largest are the Hutt Cartel and the human centric Exchange syndicate.

