    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Grud was a male Houk Mandalorian Mercenary working for the Sith Empire doing the Galactic War. On Corellia, him and his crew were hired by the Sith Empire to kill Green Jedi forces who have been causing them trouble, but him and his men were defeated, forcing him to hire someone from the Sith Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
