    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Shield Specialist is a skill tree of the Trooper's Vanguard advanced class. This tree focuses on using a shield generator to absorb incoming firepower and to protect allies in the battlefield.
The following table contains the known skills that can be gained from this tree:

</rdfs:comment>
