    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Increases the damage dealt by periodic effects by 15% on targets below 30% of max health.  In addition, Force Leech restores 15 force when used on a target affected by your Deathmark.</ns1:description>
