    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Blackstar Squad</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Blackstar Squad was a squad of Republic special forces. It was commanded by sergeant Donbar, although he was later penalized for illicit operations, which was discovered by Larin Moxla. Moxla was drummed from the squad for this act.
</ns5:abstract>
