    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Voidstar was a prototype version of a Harrower-class dreadnought in service to the Sith Empire during the Great Galactic War. It was missing after the war's end and is now subject to constant fighting from both the Empire and the Galactic Republic.

</ns5:abstract>
