    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Gathering Skills are Crew Skills that involve collecting raw materials for use with Crafting Skills. Players can use any or all three of their Crew Skill slots for gathering skills.
The Gathering Skills are: Archaeology Bioanalysis Scavenging Slicing
</rdfs:comment>
