    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Kindin</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Ord_Mantell"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Kindin was a male Mon Calamari Bounty Hunter who worked for Rogun the Butcher during Cold War. He and his partner Xo'ru arrived to Ord Mantell to confront Smuggler to capture him, but he and his partner were killed by him and Corso Riggs.
Kindin wore chest plate of TT-17A Hydra armor and gray armored leg guards.

</rdfs:comment>
