    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Tarro Blood was a male Human Mandalorian warrior and mercenary who competed in two separate Great Hunt events during the Galactic Republic's Cold War against the Sith Empire. During his first appearance in the competition, he abandoned all sense of honor and went to lengths to sabotage competition, but was stopped and almost killed.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns1:died rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3643</ns1:died>
