  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Yanila_Zavros">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Master"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/character"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Females"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Females"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Togruta"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Yanila Zavros was a female Togruta Jedi Knight who served the Jedi Order during the Great Galactic War between the resurgent Sith Empire and the Galactic Republic. In 3660 BBY, she and Rolend Zavros had a daughter named Ashara Zavros and a son, Asher Zavros. However the two Jedi were unable to spend much time with their children. In 3653 BBY, Yanila and her husband were killed while they defended the Jedi Temple on Coruscant during the Sacking of Coruscant, and Rolend's child was adopted full-time by the Jedi Masters Ryen and Ocera.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Togruta"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rolend_Zavros"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Ocera"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Asher_Zavros"/>
    <ns1:cstyle rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Unknown</ns1:cstyle>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Alive</ns1:status>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Yanila Zavros was a female Togruta Jedi Knight who served the Jedi Order during the Great Galactic War between the resurgent Sith Empire and the Galactic Republic. In 3660 BBY, she and Rolend Zavros had a daughter named Ashara Zavros and a son, Asher Zavros. However the two Jedi were unable to spend much time with their children. In 3653 BBY, Yanila and her husband were killed while they defended the Jedi Temple on Coruscant during the Sacking of Coruscant, and Rolend's child was adopted full-time by the Jedi Masters Ryen and Ocera.

</ns5:abstract>
