    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Hyperdrive propulsion systems (occasionally called warp drives) were vital components that allowed Starships to enter hyperspace to traverse the vast distances of space at faster-than-light speeds, and thus were a key technology in the foundation of intergalactic society, trade and war.

</ns5:abstract>
