    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Huttball"/>
    <ns1:caption rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Huttball"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Warzone_Arenas"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Huttball"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en"> The Pit is a Hutt Cartel-owned battle arena housed on Nar Shaddaa. It is mainly used for a planet-wide spectical known as Huttball, a game of deadly ball throwing, gladitorial fighting and arena-wide carnage. 

</rdfs:comment>
