  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Ceta_Farr">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Ceta Farr was a Human female Mandalorian commader and a member of the Revanites living during the Cold War. On Dromund Kaas, she trained fellow Mandalorians in combat, and secret, she helped members of the Revanites, testing new recruits. 

