  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Statistics">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">In Star Wars: The Old Republic, there are 7 primary player statistics; Strength, Endurance, Aim, Cunning, Willpower, Presence, and Expertise.
In addition, there are 11 secondary player statistics; Absorption, Accuracy Rating, Alacrity, Armor , Critical Rating, Defense Rating, Force Power, Power, Shield, Surge Rating, and Tech Power.

</ns5:abstract>
