    <ns1:race rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rodian"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Suvam Tan is a Rodian merchant who operates out of a space station over Yavin 4. He sells some of the best equipment in the game and his inventory changes each time the player finds a piece to the Star Map. Suvam appears in the hit game Knights of the Old Republic.

</ns5:abstract>
