    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sarala</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Humans"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Sarala was a fair-skinned Human female who served the Jedi Order and the Galactic Republic as a Jedi Master during the Cold War and renewed war with the Sith Empire. Garbed in the traditional dark brown robes of a Jedi Master and wielding a lightsaber, Salara was stationed on the Republic Navy's staging area of Carrick Station near the Deep Core alongside Jedi Masters Cassa Hun and Nimi as well as Jedi Knight Briqui.

</ns5:abstract>
