    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Saber Throw is an ability available to the Jedi Knight at level 36. It is the third ranged ability for the knight. It grants 3 focus, has a range between 8m and 30m and has a cooldown of 30s.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Saber Throw is an ability available to the Jedi Knight at level 36. It is the third ranged ability for the knight. It grants 3 focus, has a range between 8m and 30m and has a cooldown of 30s.

</ns5:abstract>
