  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Unidentified_Mandalorian_Leader">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Security_Chief_Barret"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
    <ns1:location rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tatooine"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Unidentified Mandalorian Leader was a male Mandalorian warrior who lived during the Cold War. On Tatooine, this individual was the leader of group of Mandalorians who planned to raid Outpost Thorazan. However he and his men were killed by Galactic Republic spacers hired by Security Chief Barret.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Unidentified Mandalorian Leader was a male Mandalorian warrior who lived during the Cold War. On Tatooine, this individual was the leader of group of Mandalorians who planned to raid Outpost Thorazan. However he and his men were killed by Galactic Republic spacers hired by Security Chief Barret.

</rdfs:comment>
