    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Portho_Kaltemmic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Quesh"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Jeelta</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Dead</ns1:status>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Jeelta Urdosh is a ruling member of the Three Families of Quesh during the Second Great Galactic War. He was a co-ruler of the families with Broga Masrii and Portho Kaltemmic.
During the Quesh War, fellow Three Families member Portho allied himself with the Hutt Cartel and the Sith Empire, forcing Jeelta and Broga to ally with the Galactic Republic. Unfortunately, Jeelta was killed along with Portho, leaving Broga to govern the Three Families by himself. However, the Three Families were joined by Kabbura the Great.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Hutt_Cartel"/>
