    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Energy Damage is one of four Damage Types most commonly found in Star Wars: The Old Republic. Energy Damage refers to any damage that comes from energy weapons such as lightsabers and blaster weapons. Energey Damage, along with Kinetic Damage, is mitigated by Armor Rating.</ns5:abstract>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Human.jpg"/>
