  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Bloodgouge">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Bosses"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dorrick"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Tatooine"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Outpost_Rennar"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Tatooine"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Bloodgouge was a male Tusken Chieftain who lived during the Cold War. On Tatooine, he had killed more Mandalorians then anyone else on the planet, he was becoming a growing threat when he was readying his tribe to destroy Outpost Rennar. Dorrick and Gezda gave a Imperial spacer a mission to defeat his tribe and himself. Bloodgouge was killed by the Imperial spacer once he went his tribe, ending the threat he brought to outposts and villages.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
