    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Gand Bounty Hunters were Bounty hunters hired by Rogun the Butcher to kill the Smuggler who had caused him so much trouble. They attempted to kill with him by spreading the air they breath but were all defeated. They were armed with Blaster Rifles.

