  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dramath">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Dramath was a male Sith Lord who ruled over the world of Medriaas (also known as Nathema) before the Great Hyperspace War. He fathered two children with different women, the first being Dramath the Second and the second being the illegitimate child Tenebrae. Dramath would rule Medriaas until Tenebrae, then only a ten-year-old, would end his father's life and reign.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
