    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A continuation of the original Rakghoul Pandemic  event, the new worldwide Server Recurring Event Rakghoul Resurgence first occurred on the 21st of January 2014 and ended 28th of January 2014. This time around, they added the T.H.O.R.N. association and the below missions and rewards. This new version of the event is expected to return every so often in different locations.


</rdfs:comment>
