  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rakghoul_Plague">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rakghoul"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darth_Malak"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Crimsonrakling.jpg"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Rakghoul Plague</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Rakghoul Plague is a horrid disease that transforms anyone who is infected into a Rakghoul. A serum for the insidious disease was discovered by Republic scientists three hundred years before the events of The Old Republic. The serum might not have survived the bombardment by Darth Malak.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Rakghuls.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Rakghuls.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Taris"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Taris"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Crimsonrakling.jpg"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Rakghoul Plague</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Cold_War"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Species"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Reggie's body wasn't ready</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Refugees.4.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Species"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Crimsonrakling.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Rakghoul Plague is a horrid disease that transforms anyone who is infected into a Rakghoul. A serum for the insidious disease was discovered by Republic scientists three hundred years before the events of The Old Republic. The serum might not have survived the bombardment by Darth Malak.
During the Cold War, the virus spread among several worlds in the Tion Hegemony. After the annihilation of all civilized life on the world of Kaon, both the Galactic Republic and the Sith Empire sent parties to locate the source of the virus, to rescue their stranded people and to forge an alliance with the Tion Hegemony.


</ns5:abstract>
