    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Sleep Dart is an attack usable by the Imperial Agent.
A sleep dart is a type of projectile that caused one to fall asleep. it is a type of crowd control ability that can be used to nuetralize living species other than droids or immune species for 1 minute (60 Seconds).</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Imperial_Agent"/>
