    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Sleep_Dart.png?width=300"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:AbilitiesToRewrite"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Sleep Dart is an attack usable by the Imperial Agent.
A sleep dart is a type of projectile that caused one to fall asleep. it is a type of crowd control ability that can be used to nuetralize living species other than droids or immune species for 1 minute (60 Seconds).</ns5:abstract>
