    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This lore can be found on Coruscant. X:2441, Y:978 This Lore is located in the Old Galactic Market. Like most Lore Objects it takes the form of a plaque. It is located between a pair of crates by the loading docks in the first area after passing the republic security forces' position and encountering Migrant Merchants Guild forces.

</rdfs:comment>
