    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Mortis is a male Human male Dark Lord of the Sith and a current member of the Dark Council. Mortis heads the Sphere of Laws and Justice, thus handling the Sith Empire's internal issues. 

