    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Tatooine is a desert world in the Outer Rim, and the first of three planets that orbit the suns of a binary star system in the Arkanis sector. The world is known as a haven for smugglers, pirates and those seeking to conduct questionable research away from prying eyes. Tatooine's level bracket is 24-28. For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: Tatooine on Wookieepedia

</ns5:abstract>
