  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Persuade">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Star_Wars_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_II:_The_Sith_Lords"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Bastila_Shan"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Star_Wars_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_II:_The_Sith_Lords"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/KotOR_2_Peragus_shot_(9).png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/HK-47"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Persuade</ns4:altLabel>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Star_Wars:_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_II:_The_Sith_Lords"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Attributes"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Attributes"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Persuade</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Persuade was a skill that allows the user to be more successful at convincing the others in the conversation of something.
A Jedi can use this skill alongside Effect Mind and eventually Dominate Mind to convince another to their way of thinking at a far higher level. Often using a Mind Trick will produce better results than a simple Persuade, such as convincing a dock officer to wave the fee rather than just cut it in half, but doing so on a being who is immune to mind trick may loose the chance to use an ordinary persuade.
If the skill is used in order to avoid paying a fee or to increase your own payment, companions such as Bastila Shan will voice her disapproval, especially if used with a mind trick, whilst others such as HK-47 will approve, especially if used as a threat.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Star_Wars:_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Persuade was a skill that allows the user to be more successful at convincing the others in the conversation of something.
A Jedi can use this skill alongside Effect Mind and eventually Dominate Mind to convince another to their way of thinking at a far higher level. Often using a Mind Trick will produce better results than a simple Persuade, such as convincing a dock officer to wave the fee rather than just cut it in half, but doing so on a being who is immune to mind trick may loose the chance to use an ordinary persuade.
</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Persuade</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
