    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Revanite_Cult_on_Dromund_Kaas"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Sandor.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Humans"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Dromund_Kaas"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Sandor.jpg?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Sandor is an NPC found on Dromund Kaas. He and his master are looking after a secret Revanite Cult in order to dissolute them.He starts a series of Side Missions and if the player takes them they are tasked with infiltrating the Revanite Cult, learning the identity of their leader and reporting the information back to Sandor.At the end of the storyline the Player is given the choice to tell the truth to Sandor or to frame Sandor's own Master of being the leader of the cult.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:faction rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sith Empire</ns1:faction>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Sandor is an NPC found on Dromund Kaas. He and his master are looking after a secret Revanite Cult in order to dissolute them.He starts a series of Side Missions and if the player takes them they are tasked with infiltrating the Revanite Cult, learning the identity of their leader and reporting the information back to Sandor.At the end of the storyline the Player is given the choice to tell the truth to Sandor or to frame Sandor's own Master of being the leader of the cult.


</ns5:abstract>
