    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
This Individual was a male Human Bounty Hunter who worked for Fa'athra the Hutt during the Cold War. Him and his men worked for the exile Hutt to kidnap Bas-Ton to get Cipher Nine's attention. However him and most of his men were killed by the Imperial Agent, he used his final breath to save his men from death.

</ns5:abstract>
