  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Vodal_Kressh">
    <ns1:cstyle rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Unknown</ns1:cstyle>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Great_Galactic_War"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/character"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dark_Lord_of_the_Sith"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Kressh_bloodline"/>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Deceased</ns1:status>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Lords"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Pureblood"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Dark_side_Force-users"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Vodal_Kressh.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Vodal Kressh was a male Pureblood Dark Lord of the Sith and alchemist who served the Sith Empire centuries before the Great Galactic War.
Eventually, Vodal turned against the Sith Emperor and fled to the planet Athiss, where he amassed an army of fanatic followers and monstrous Sithspawn beasts to use against the Empire and claim the galaxy as his own.
Unfortunately, Kressh died before he could strike against the Emperor, and the latter declared Athiss forbidden.

</ns5:abstract>
