    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This organization entry can be granted on Alderaan.
X:2307, Y:-782 There is a banner in the Ulgo Fortress. You’ll need to work your way around Ulgo Mount, this path starts around the end of the road at 2060, -1007.
X:625 Y:2022 Can also be granted from a banner in a heroic area for the misson 'Special delivery'.

</ns5:abstract>
