  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Renegin">
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
 Renegin was a male Devaronian Mandalorian bounty hunter, during the cold war. He was hired by Sith Acolytes to tag random citizens, however he was angered to learn that the Sith Acolytes had killed them all, when he confront them, they just laugh at him. However a Imperial civilian spotted Renegin when he was tagged the citizens, the man was able get an Imperial spacer to confront Renegin.
Renegin was able explain his situation with the Sith Acolytes and offer the spacer two options, either silence the civilian, Weng Wrightsyn or stop the Sith's sick game.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
 Renegin was a male Devaronian Mandalorian bounty hunter, during the cold war. He was hired by Sith Acolytes to tag random citizens, however he was angered to learn that the Sith Acolytes had killed them all, when he confront them, they just laugh at him. However a Imperial civilian spotted Renegin when he was tagged the citizens, the man was able get an Imperial spacer to confront Renegin.
Renegin was able explain his situation with the Sith Acolytes and offer the spacer two options, either silence the civilian, Weng Wrightsyn or stop the Sith's sick game.

</rdfs:comment>
