    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Jedi Purge was a galaxy wide event of exterminating the entire Jedi Order from the galaxy, during the times between 298 BTC and 301 BTC. This purge was led by three Sith Lords, Darth Nihilus, Darth Traya, Darth Sion.
The Jedi Order disbanded and was hunted down by the Sith.

</rdfs:comment>
