    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Phantom Lady was a freighter, that during the Cold War, passed through a very powerful ion storm magnetizing its hull. As a result of this incident, the vessel rapidly began accumulating space debris, including a mineral-rich asteroid.


</ns5:abstract>
