    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Xamar was a male Khil Jedi Master and Jedi Consular who - while serving the Jedi Order - was also a member of former Jedi Master Krynda Draay's Jedi Covenant and member of its First WatchCircle.


</ns5:abstract>
