    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Rivan was a Zelosian male Sith Lord who was skilled in both mechanics and Sith alchemy, building a technologically advanced fortress on the world of Almas and developing a breed of Sith soldiers that were bonded to their subordinates through the Force itself. 

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/The_Force"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Rivan was a Zelosian male Sith Lord who was skilled in both mechanics and Sith alchemy, building a technologically advanced fortress on the world of Almas and developing a breed of Sith soldiers that were bonded to their subordinates through the Force itself. 

</ns5:abstract>
