  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Moon">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Montai_Drai2.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Nar_Shaddaa"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/wookieepedia"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">moon</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Moon</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Lore/Planets"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Moon is a celestial body that orbits an object larger than itself (i.e. a planet). Moons are located throughout the known galaxy and have different shapes, sizes, and atmospheric conditions.
One well known moon is Nar Shaddaa located in Hutt Space.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">A Moon is a celestial body that orbits an object larger than itself (i.e. a planet). Moons are located throughout the known galaxy and have different shapes, sizes, and atmospheric conditions.
One well known moon is Nar Shaddaa located in Hutt Space.

</ns5:abstract>
