    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Rakghoul disease is a disease found on Taris in the Undercity. The disease takes over the victim's body and transforms them into a Rakghoul. The only antidote is the Rakghoul serum, which counteracts the disease.

</rdfs:comment>
