  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Ability:Death_Field">
    <ns1:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/datatype/second">15.0</ns1:cooldown>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Ability:Death Field</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns1:activation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Instant</ns1:activation>
    <ns1:role rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Damage</ns1:role>
    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Creates a death field at the target location, dealing 2323-2450 internal damage and stealing life from affected targets to heal you for 10% of the damage dealt.  Strikes up to 8 targets within an 8-meter radius.</ns1:description>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darth_Vowrawn"/>
    <ns1:resource rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Force</ns1:resource>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Death_Field.png?width=300"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/ability"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/The_Entity"/>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Death Field</ns1:name>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Ability:Death Field</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">While attempting to free The Entity though an arcane ritual, the Dark Councillor Darth Vowrawn is viciously assaulted with an exaggerated version of this ability that nearly kills him. The Sith Warrior, by now having been appointed as the Emperor's Wrath, must kill Lord Draahg in order to save the councillor.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">While attempting to free The Entity though an arcane ritual, the Dark Councillor Darth Vowrawn is viciously assaulted with an exaggerated version of this ability that nearly kills him. The Sith Warrior, by now having been appointed as the Emperor's Wrath, must kill Lord Draahg in order to save the councillor.

</rdfs:comment>
