    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Vomba is a pirate that escaped capture while being transported through the Mezenti Spaceport. With the assistance of his gang, he's taken over the plaza section of the spaceport. Captain Heedley with Imperial Corrections has been tasked to deal with the situation.


</ns5:abstract>
