    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic:_Shadow_of_Revan"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Star Wars: The Old Republic: Rise of the Hutt Cartel</rdfs:label>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Duneskimmer_Rill.jpg"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en"> Rise of the Hutt Cartel is the first expansion to the massively multiplayer online roleplaying game (MMORPG), Star Wars: The Old Republic, set in the Old Republic era. It was developed by BioWare, a division of Electronic Arts and was released on April 9, 2014 to all subscribing and preferred players and April 14, 2013 for all other players. The expansion cost $19.99 US dollars and added the maximum level cap of 55. The expansion is now free to all who purchase the Shadow of Revan Expansion.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Patches"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Patches"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Rise of the Hutt Cartel</ns4:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
