    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Freezing (Tech)</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Freezing (Tech) is an affect applied to a target by an ability such as Cryo Gun. A target with this affect will receive periodic Elemental Damage.
