    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Callef</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Callef was a Human male Dark Jedi who lived during the Cold War between the Galactic Republic and the Sith Empire. The apprentice of the Dark Jedi Bengel Morr, Callef and his master rallied the native Flesh Raiders of the planet Tython in an attempt to destroy the Jedi Order. 

</ns5:abstract>
