    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Jedi Consular Starter Guide</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">So you have decided to follow in the footsteps of Satele Shan and play the Jedi Consular, the force-wielding, lightsaber-dueling, Jedi member sworn to protect the Republic. Let's get started!

</ns5:abstract>
