  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Noab_Hulis">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Order"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Force_vision"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Noab Hulis was a male Miraluka Jedi Master, who served the Jedi Order. He was also the father of two unnamed daughters, and Jedi Master Krynda Draay. The father-in-law of Jedi Knight Barrison Draay and the grandfather of Jedi Guardian/Jedi Master Lucien Draay.


</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Lucien_Draay"/>
