    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Dromo was an Imperial Supply superfreighter used by the Sith Empire during the Great Galactic War. The vessel was part of a convoy that traveled from the Kravos system to Coruscant. Smuggler Zeerid Korr followed the Dromo to Coruscant by attaching his XS Stock light freighter, the Fatman to the superfreighter's hull.


</ns5:abstract>
