  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Oren_Ward">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Hutta"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mercenaries"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Humans"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Oren Ward was a Human male Mandalorian who was captured by Fa'athra and imprisoned in carbonite in his palace on Hutta during the Cold War. Ward's friend Burnok recruited help in rescuing Ward from the palace. Thankful of the rescue, he gave the location of a sash in the palace to the recruited help. He wore gold-styled armor.

</ns5:abstract>
