    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">So you have decided to embrace your inner fury by playing a Sith Warrior and turning the Force into a weapon against the Empire's enemies. Along with a trusty lightsaber (or two) you'll be slicing through Jedi in no time. Let's get started!

