    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Seer is a skill tree of the Jedi Sage advanced class. This tree focuses on improving the Jedi Sage's ability to heal to protect their allies and themselves.
The following table contains the known skills that can be gained from this tree:


</ns5:abstract>
