  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Serenity_(Discipline)">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mind_Quell"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Serenity Shadow is Ever Mindful that the force ebbs and flows, and uses this knowledge to great advantage. Able to wield the force against multiple targets while wrestling vitality from the enemy, the serenity shadow can even stand up to opponents in close combat.
Note: The following abilities are put in tiers, each tier is a row of abilities for the Serenity Shadow.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mind_Over_Matter"/>
