    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Senate Tower, sometimes referred to as the Senate Rotunda, Convocation Center, Senate Building, or Senate Dome, stands in the Senate District of Coruscant. It houses the Galactic Senate, which contains Senators from all the systems of the Galactic Republic.

</rdfs:comment>
