    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Galactic Solutions Industries or GSI is an Organization in Star Wars The Old Republic. The organization is a company headquartered in Nar Shaddaa that was established after conflict renewed between the Republic and the Empire and is growing quickly. It specializes in personal weaponry.
