  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Eton_Vok">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Eton Vok is a researcher for the Empire stationed out of the Border Assault Post just inside the Tularan Marsh from The Brell Sediment. He's studying a particularly aggressive strain of Rakghoul he's called Beserkers. They are immune to the local toxicity and more aggressive than normal.


</ns5:abstract>
