    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Knights_of_the_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Force drain was a dark side power that took the life energy of the target and transferred it to the user, restoring lost health. There were several different mastery levels of the power. For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: Force drain on Wookieepedia

</ns5:abstract>
