    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Underworld Medicine is an ability available to the Smuggler advanced class Scoundrel at level 10. It is the standard heal for the Scoundrel. It costs 25 energy, has a range of 30m, a casting time of 2.5 seconds and no cooldown.

</ns5:abstract>
