    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Order"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Outer_Rim_Jedi_Forces.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Goril_Sevintran"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Unidentified_hooded_Jedi"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Corellia"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Corellia"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Outer Rim Jedi Forces is a group of Jedi who served in the battle for the planet Corellia during the Second Great Galactic War. Summoned to Corellia by Grand Master Satele Shan, the group were placed under the command of the legendary Jedi Knight known as the Hero of Tython in order to stop the fallen Jedi Master Tol Braga from massacring hundreds of civilians in Coronet City.  The Jedi were gathered from across the galaxy, though they were primarily taken from the Outer Rim Territories and from the Jedi Order's homeworld of Tython. Kinyen, Orto, Rodia, and Duro were among the worlds that reinforcements were taken from. Some were Padawans, such as the former Sith Lord Praven, and some were more experienced Knights and Masters such as Kira Carsen and Bela Kiwiiks.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Outer_Rim_Jedi_Forces.png?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Bela_Kiwiiks"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Outer Rim Jedi Forces is a group of Jedi who served in the battle for the planet Corellia during the Second Great Galactic War. Summoned to Corellia by Grand Master Satele Shan, the group were placed under the command of the legendary Jedi Knight known as the Hero of Tython in order to stop the fallen Jedi Master Tol Braga from massacring hundreds of civilians in Coronet City.  The Jedi were gathered from across the galaxy, though they were primarily taken from the Outer Rim Territories and from the Jedi Order's homeworld of Tython. Kinyen, Orto, Rodia, and Duro were among the worlds that reinforcements were taken from. Some were Padawans, such as the former Sith Lord Praven, and some were more experienced Knights and Masters such as Kira Carsen and Bela Kiwiiks.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Bengel_Morr"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Master"/>
  </rdf:Description>
