  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Cale_Berkona">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Shaela_Nuur"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Great_Hunt_(Great_Sith_War)"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Cale Berkona was a male Human Jedi Knight who served during the Jedi Order during the Great Sith War and was a participant in the Great Hunt, assisting the likes of Guun Han Saresh, Shaela Nuur and Duron Qel-Droma in their efforts to hunt down and kill terentateks and other dark side beasts that existed throughout the galaxy.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
