  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Madness_(Discipline)">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Commander_Madine.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sorcerer_Disiplines"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sorcerer_Disiplines"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Madness is one of the three Disciplines avaible for the Sorcerer Advanced Class. It focuses on damage-over-time effects.Delving even deeper into the Dark Side of the Force can lead to madness, but it can also lead to immense power. Attacking multiple enemies simotaniously and instilling terror in their hearts, all while sapping their very life essense from afar, the Madness Sorcerer is a dark threat unlike any other.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Madness is one of the three Disciplines avaible for the Sorcerer Advanced Class. It focuses on damage-over-time effects.Delving even deeper into the Dark Side of the Force can lead to madness, but it can also lead to immense power. Attacking multiple enemies simotaniously and instilling terror in their hearts, all while sapping their very life essense from afar, the Madness Sorcerer is a dark threat unlike any other.
</ns5:abstract>
