    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Clan_Varad"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Braxx the Bloodhound was a male Human Mandalorian who lived during the Cold War. However during the battle for Allusis, he was killed during the battle. He is the first boss in the Mandalorian Raiders Flashpoint.
He comes with 2 elite mobs.

</rdfs:comment>
