  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Clan_Sharratt">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Clan_Sharatt.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns1:races rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Zabrak"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Zabrak"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Clan_Sharatt.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Nar_Shaddaa"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Clan Sharratt</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Cold_War"/>
    <ns1:races rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Kaleesh"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Nar_Shaddaa"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Kaleesh"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Clan Sharratt was a clan of Mandalorians who fought during Cold War. On Nar Shaddaa, they were hired by Sith Empire (New Established Sith Empire) to test a new Imperial combat adrenal. Kassor Quade issued a challenge to the Galactic Republic to face him and his clan in combat, or else he will begin ordering his clan to destroy random Republic property on Nar Shaddaa.
When the Republic defenders arrived, they defeated Clan Sharratt and killed Kassor Quade.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Republic_Army"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Clan Sharratt was a clan of Mandalorians who fought during Cold War. On Nar Shaddaa, they were hired by Sith Empire (New Established Sith Empire) to test a new Imperial combat adrenal. Kassor Quade issued a challenge to the Galactic Republic to face him and his clan in combat, or else he will begin ordering his clan to destroy random Republic property on Nar Shaddaa.
When the Republic defenders arrived, they defeated Clan Sharratt and killed Kassor Quade.

</ns5:abstract>
