    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Nok Drayen was a legendary crime lord and a member of the Star Cabal, an organisation of influential conspirators dedicated to destroying the Jedi and Sith. He was famous for liquidating the Rath Cartel and the Vandelhelm Combine. 

</rdfs:comment>
