    <ns1:faction rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Jindo Krey was a male Mandalorian Bounty Hunter and the leader of a group of Mandalorians during the Galactic War. He and his men fought for Darth Malgus when he created his New Empire, Jindo being among the first join his cause. During the Battle of llum, he and his men were killed during the fighting by a strike team that boarded Emperor's Fortress.

</ns5:abstract>
