    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">''currently''</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Ord Mantell Civil War is one of many of the Galactic Republic's theatre of operations during the Cold War. The corrupt government is propped up by the Republic as together they battle the Separatists who plagued the planet.
The Republic Special Forces have one of their elite ground combat squads, Havoc Squad, lead by Commander Tavus taking some of the most dangerous missions of the war while the front-line troops handle the enemy in the front lines.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Ss3-trooper.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/SS_20100319_Trooper04_full.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Ord Mantell Civil War is one of many of the Galactic Republic's theatre of operations during the Cold War. The corrupt government is propped up by the Republic as together they battle the Separatists who plagued the planet.
The Republic Special Forces have one of their elite ground combat squads, Havoc Squad, lead by Commander Tavus taking some of the most dangerous missions of the war while the front-line troops handle the enemy in the front lines.
</ns5:abstract>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/SS_20100319_Trooper04_full.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">civil conflict</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Trooper_Commando.jpg?width=300"/>
