  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Enemy_Force">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Flesh Raiders are making incursions into an ancient Jedi shrine within the ruins of Kaleth. Master Orgus Din has left you to deal with this while he consults the Jedi Council about the contents of T7's holorecording.
You must travel to the ruins of Kaleth and explore the ancient shrine to learn why the Flesh Raiders have suddenly become interested in it.

</ns5:abstract>
