    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Turbodyne 1220</ns1:name>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Turbodyne 1220 dropship was used by the Sith Empire during the Cold War. During Independent Operation Sebaddon, a Turbodyne 1220 crashed into a Republic NR-2 light transport while assaulting the Hex Droid forces.


