    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Darth Bandon was a former Jedi Padawan turned Sith apprentice of the Dark Lord of the Sith Darth Malak. He was sent by Malak to kill his former master Revan. Bandon was killed by Revan along with two Dark Jedi with Bandon at the time.

