    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
The X2-C3 Imperial Astromech is the most advanced astromech droid in use by the Sith Empire. They are commonly outfitted with blaster attachments and are commonly seen on Imperial ships and inside installations affiliated with the Sith Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
