    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Bureau Chief is a rank used by the Republic Strategic Information Service to signify the commanding officer of SIS operations on a given planet or bureau. The Bureau Chief ranked above Special Agents and Agent.


</rdfs:comment>
