    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Hutts"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Motta</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Star_Wars:_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_characters"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tatooine"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Racing_bond"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Hutt"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Motta is a Hutt who lived in Anchorhead on Tatooine. He ran the swoop track there and hoped to promote the status of his track after the destruction of Taris by bringing professional racers to race at his track.
Motta paid his racers in racing bonds as opposed to cash, which only added to his incredulity.

</ns5:abstract>
