    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Gunrunner's Pistol is a reward from the mission Clearing the Air. It is only equipable and usable if the player has the Blaster Pistol skill. It is the first major weapon upgrade for the Smuggler.
</rdfs:comment>
