Jos Beroya was a male Mandalorian warrior and the husband of Valk Beroya. During the Galactic War, the two were undefeated champions of their clan on Rishi. Their clan's enclave was infiltrated byindividuals searching for information on local Revanite whereabouts, forcing the clan's leader, Shae Vizla, to send the pair on the intruders. Both were defeated and tended to after the fight ended.

