  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Corruption_(Discipline)">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Corruption is one of the three Disciplines available for the Sorcerer Advanced Class. It focuses on the healing of allies.
The Dark Side of the Force provides many benefits, including the ability to ward off death itself. By conjuring a series of arcane Force abilities from out of harm's way, the Corruption Sorcerer can sustain injured allies allowing them to fight on with the power of the dark side's twisted gift.
</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Corruption (Discipline)</rdfs:label>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cormun.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sorcerer_Disiplines"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Corruption is one of the three Disciplines available for the Sorcerer Advanced Class. It focuses on the healing of allies.
The Dark Side of the Force provides many benefits, including the ability to ward off death itself. By conjuring a series of arcane Force abilities from out of harm's way, the Corruption Sorcerer can sustain injured allies allowing them to fight on with the power of the dark side's twisted gift.
</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Disiplines"/>
