    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Mynock was a male Mandalorian warrior who lived during the fighting against the Eternal Empire. When Mandalore the Avenger had called the clans to Darvannis to raid the Zakuul droid factory, Mynock was among those to answer her call.

</rdfs:comment>
