    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Captain Zora also known as Wraith, was the second-in-command and the infiltration and assassination specialist of Havoc Squad. She was stationed on Ord Mantell until she defected to the Sith Empire together with the rest of the squad (excluding the Trooper).
According to General Garza, Wraith's locaiton was supposedly confirmed aboard a ship commanded by Harron Tavus, where she had stowed a captive senator as bait in order to trap the Trooper. She left the ship shortly before the Trooper's arrival.
</rdfs:comment>
