  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rodian_skip-trawler">
    <ns1:type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Freighter</ns1:type>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">A Rodian skip-trawler was a class of high-maintenance freighters used by independent starship captains during the Cold War. These vessels were considered the most temperamental freighters in the Outer Rim, with numerous breakdowns and repairs these ships could almost be considered unspace worthy.


</ns5:abstract>
