    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Upper Sewers were the upper level of Undercity sewers of Taris, a part of sewage systems of the planet located in the Undercity. A secret back entrance to the base of Black Vulkar swoop gang was located at the end of one of the drains.

</ns5:abstract>
