  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Life_debt">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A life debt was a solemn oath of protection sworn by Wookiees to beings that saved their lives. The life debt was unbreakable and required the Wookiee to devote his/her life to the protection of the recipient of the life debt.

</rdfs:comment>
