    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Tatooine"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tatooine"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Pit Rauhut was a young male Human Mandalorian warrior who lived during the Cold War. Along with fellow Mandalorian Warusman Ordo, the two came to Tatooine to test themselves in a challenging trial. The pair injected themselves with deadly poison and had only 30 minutes to fight through a tribe of Sand People to get the cure. However, Ordo was weakened enough by the poison for the Sand People to overcome him, leaving Pit to explain the matter to Rogger Den.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Pit Rauhut</ns1:name>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Pit Rauhut was a young male Human Mandalorian warrior who lived during the Cold War. Along with fellow Mandalorian Warusman Ordo, the two came to Tatooine to test themselves in a challenging trial. The pair injected themselves with deadly poison and had only 30 minutes to fight through a tribe of Sand People to get the cure. However, Ordo was weakened enough by the poison for the Sand People to overcome him, leaving Pit to explain the matter to Rogger Den.

</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
