    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">new Mandalore</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mandalore"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Identified as Mandalore the Lesser, this Mandalore was manipulated by Imperial Diplomats to rally Mandalorians and mercenaries to the cause of the Empire. He was killed by a Mandalorian warrior by the name of Artus who became known as Mandalore the Vindicated.

</ns5:abstract>
