    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Astromechalla is an entertainment group performing at SiltShift Cantina on Tatooine.  The group is made up of an Arconan strummer, a Mirialan dancer, a Jawa droid mechanic, two entertainment droids, as well as two specialized ploong droids.

