    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Vich was a male Sith Lord. 
Vich attained the position of Sith Lord and Darth at a considerably young age; not long beofre the opening of the Great Galactic War he discovered the planet of Rattatak and cast aside the anti-alien culture of the Sith Empire by uniting and recruiting Rattataki from over a hundred tribes to form his own personal army; the dozens of Force sensitive amongst them became his personal acolytes. 
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Lords"/>
    <ns1:faction rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darth"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageExternalLink rdf:resource="http://swtor.com/info/holonet"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Darth Vich</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Vich was a male Sith Lord. 
Vich attained the position of Sith Lord and Darth at a considerably young age; not long beofre the opening of the Great Galactic War he discovered the planet of Rattatak and cast aside the anti-alien culture of the Sith Empire by uniting and recruiting Rattataki from over a hundred tribes to form his own personal army; the dozens of Force sensitive amongst them became his personal acolytes. 
With this private army he made a significant attempt to seize more power within the Empire, which ultimately failed resulting in the execution and enslavement of those who followed him on the orders of the Dark Council.
It is rumoured that a group Vich's acolytes helped the failure of his insurrection by betraying him and subsequently receiving full Sith training is unverified, and unsubstantiated. 


</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Darth Vich</ns4:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Smuggler_Story_Missions">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Smuggler Story Missions are missions that are only available to the Smuggler Class.
The smuggler starts his/her story on Ord Mantell after evading the Separatists blockade and land on the embattled planet. The first mission the smuggler must complete involves destroying remote controlling stations that are keeping the Smuggler from taking-off again.
The list of known missions for the Smuggler storyline are below. Please be aware that these articles will contain spoilers.

</rdfs:comment>
