  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sand_Demon">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tatooine"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Sand Demons are one of the most feared creatures on Tatooine. It is said that they can sort of swim or glide through the sands and that Jedi could use the Force and their abbilities of serenity to tame the beasts. In the Sith Warrior Storyline the Sith at one point must cover himself in the blood of the Sand Demon in order to uncover secrets held by the Sand People.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Warrior"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sand Demon</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Sand Demons are one of the most feared creatures on Tatooine. It is said that they can sort of swim or glide through the sands and that Jedi could use the Force and their abbilities of serenity to tame the beasts. In the Sith Warrior Storyline the Sith at one point must cover himself in the blood of the Sand Demon in order to uncover secrets held by the Sand People.


</ns5:abstract>
