  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Battle_of_Alderaan">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Great_Galactic_War"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/quote"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Battle of Alderaan was an important battle fought during the Great Galactic War that heavily influenced Alderaan's stance in the Senate. The Sith forces invaded Alderaan, burning cities to the ground. A small group of Republic Special Forces led by Captain Jace Malcolm ambushed Sith forces along with jedi Satele Shan, Grand Master. She had a battle with the Sith leading the forces, Darth Malgus. She was almost taken down before Captain Jace ran in with a heavy shotgun. He used a grenade to weaken him and was knocked out. Darth Malgus barely made it out. Before Jace lead the ambush, he met a group of children with Republic veteran Grimes O'donnah. These kids would later be hunted by Malgus.</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Battles"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Hope_(cinematic)"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darth_Malgus"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Battle of Alderaan</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Codex/Lore"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Senate"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jace_Malcom"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">devastating attack</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Great_Galactic_War"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Alderaan"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Alderaan"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Battle of Alderaan</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">''historically''</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Battles"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Battle of Alderaan was an important battle fought during the Great Galactic War that heavily influenced Alderaan's stance in the Senate. The Sith forces invaded Alderaan, burning cities to the ground. A small group of Republic Special Forces led by Captain Jace Malcolm ambushed Sith forces along with jedi Satele Shan, Grand Master. She had a battle with the Sith leading the forces, Darth Malgus. She was almost taken down before Captain Jace ran in with a heavy shotgun. He used a grenade to weaken him and was knocked out. Darth Malgus barely made it out. Before Jace lead the ambush, he met a group of children with Republic veteran Grimes O'donnah. These kids would later be hunted by Malgus. They were carrying a Crusader type lightsaber as a package for a jedi in a reconnaissance team on Axxila, that was left there after the battle of Axxila. Grimes would take part in a fight against a Sith Alchemist on Alderaan, later dying against a full on fight with Malgus on another planet, to hold him off as the children escape from said planet.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Battle of Alderaan</ns4:altLabel>
