  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Unidentified_Mandalorian_Captain">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This Individual was a male Trandoshan Mandalorian mercenary who was the leader of a group of Mandalorians during the battle of Corellia. Him and his Mandalorians were hired by the Sith Empire (New Established Sith Empire) to kill four Jedi Masters and Bengel Morr, who was under their care.
However him and his men were killed by a Republic spacer at the Rusty Freighter cantina.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:faction rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns1:race rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Trandoshan"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Trandoshans"/>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Deceased</ns1:status>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This Individual was a male Trandoshan Mandalorian mercenary who was the leader of a group of Mandalorians during the battle of Corellia. Him and his Mandalorians were hired by the Sith Empire (New Established Sith Empire) to kill four Jedi Masters and Bengel Morr, who was under their care.
However him and his men were killed by a Republic spacer at the Rusty Freighter cantina.

</ns5:abstract>
