    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Knights"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Do Zonn is a male Zabrak and a former Jedi Knight who served the Jedi Order during the Cold War with the resurgent Sith Empire. After achieving the rank of Knight, he fall to the dark side while meditating on Tython. Embarrassed with his actions, he resigned from the Order and station himself at an outpost near Kaleth, continuing to help the Order's Padawans work through the trials.

</ns5:abstract>
