    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Deborah Kara Unger was the first Canadian accepted into the prestigious Australian National Institute of Dramatic Art. She made her feature film debut in Prisoners of the Sun. She voiced SCORPIO for the Imperial Agent Storyline in Star Wars: The Old Republic.</rdfs:comment>
