    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Lieutenant Bex Kolos, also known as Gearbox, was Havoc Squad's technician. Gearbox and his team, with the exception of the starting player's trooper class, defected. Gearbox is the first person and the first member of Havoc Squad that the Trooper meets when he arrives on Ord Mantell.
Upon Havoc Squad's defection, Gearbox was sent to Alderaan to take part in an unknown Imperial subversion operation known as Project B. He is eventually tracked down by the Trooper and killed in action, despite unleashing an experimental prototype war droid on Havoc Squad before jumping into action himself.

</ns5:abstract>
