    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Batu Rem was an officer for the Telos Security Force on the Citadel Station over Telos. Batu Rem served after the Jedi Civil War under the command of Dol Grenn. He was replaced by an impostor who tried to trap and kill the Jedi Exile. 

