    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Anyara was a female Cathar Jedi Knight who served the Jedi Order during the Jedi Civil War. She was a member of Bastila Shan's strike team that was dispatched to capture Darth Revan. During the mission, Anyara was killed.

</ns5:abstract>
