  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Synthweaving_schematics">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Synthweaving Schematics are used to learn to craft synthweaving items. They are either learned from Synthweaving trainers, found as loot, rewarded for Crew Skill Missions or discovered by reverse engineering force user armor.

</ns5:abstract>
