    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Lower Shadowlands was a section of the Kashyyyk Shadowlands. It was a very dangerous area that offworlders rarely visited, although a few were known to live there.
Around the time of the Jedi Civil War, a group of Mandalorian warriors lived and hunted in the Lower Shadowlands. They only attacked unarmed opponents, and used advanced stealth generators to remain undetected.
