    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dromund_Kaas"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Lek was a male Human Mandalorian who served as the assistant Huntmaster in the Great Hunt during the Cold War. He and the Wookiee Huntmaster oversaw the organization of the competition from the Mandalorian Enclave on the planet Dromund Kaas, and Lek organized the preliminary competition amongst the dozen bounty hunters who sought to secure the final spot in the Great Hunt.

</rdfs:comment>
