  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Clan_Varad">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Clan Varad</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Allusis"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Geonosis"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Artus_Lok"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Organizations"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/organisation"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mavrix_Varad"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mandalorians"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Organizations"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Braxx_the_Bloodhound"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Republic_Army"/>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Galactic_Republic_Icon.png"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Clan Varad</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Gil"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Clan Varad were an violent Mandalorian clan for fought during Great Galactic War and Cold War. It's leader Mavrix Varad was often consider by Mandalore the Vindicated as "a rancor foaming at the mouth". Mavrix Varad forced his clan kinsmen to face harsh combat trials, and those who did not live up to his high standards were left for sparring or hunting practice for the clan's younger members. This lead Artus to ban members of this violent clan from the Mandalorian stronghold on Geonosis. 
During the Cold War, Clan Varad would break off from the Mandalorian leadership and began raiding both Galactic Republic and Sith Empire worlds with their new flagship, Allusis. Thus both the Republic and the Sith Empire send their forces to stop the rogue clan. 

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Clan Varad</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mandalorians"/>
    <ns1:members rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Braxx_the_Bloodhound"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Clan Varad were an violent Mandalorian clan for fought during Great Galactic War and Cold War. It's leader Mavrix Varad was often consider by Mandalore the Vindicated as "a rancor foaming at the mouth". Mavrix Varad forced his clan kinsmen to face harsh combat trials, and those who did not live up to his high standards were left for sparring or hunting practice for the clan's younger members. This lead Artus to ban members of this violent clan from the Mandalorian stronghold on Geonosis. 
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:leader rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mavrix_Varad"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Organizations"/>
