    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Q'Anilia was a female Miraluka Jedi Master who - while serving the Jedi Order - was also a member of former Jedi Master Krynda Draay's Jedi Covenant and member of its First WatchCircle.


</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Krynda_Draay"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Shatterpoint"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Q'Anilia was a female Miraluka Jedi Master who - while serving the Jedi Order - was also a member of former Jedi Master Krynda Draay's Jedi Covenant and member of its First WatchCircle.


</rdfs:comment>
