    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Mandalorian Trophy Hunter were a unit of Mandalorians that chose to follow Deth Kregg, hoping to become stronger warriors after seeing his impressive strength. They were armed with a Blaster Pistol.

</ns5:abstract>
