  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Drop_Ship">
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Dropship</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">A Drop Ship is the starting location in the Alderaan Warzone. It is also an objective of the PvP battle between the Sith Empire and Galactic Republic. The PvP battle is won by the first team to destroy the other players Drop Ship.
</ns5:abstract>
