    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Koth Vortena was a Human male who served in the Zakuul military during the Cold War and Great Galactic War. Koth deserted the military around the time of the Eternal Empire's subjugation of both the Galactic Republic and Sith Empire and became a starship captain and smuggler.

</ns5:abstract>
