  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Unidentified_Mandalorian_prosthetic_leg">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
This individual was a male Mandalorian warrior who fought on Darvannis with rest of the Mandalorian clans. During the fighting he lost his leg, thus he was given a prosthetic leg, to which he was still getting use to. He was seen talking with another Mandalorian about how it was treating him thus far.

</ns5:abstract>
