    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Vall Kumauri was a military conqueror who established the Kumauri Empire around about 10,000 BBY, in the remote frontier areas of the Galactic Republic. The young Kumauri was initially successful, due to the strength of his fleet, and especially the planetary bombardment capabilities of the Kumauri Battleships. 

</ns5:abstract>
