  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Innovative_Ordnance_(Discipline)">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mercenary_Disiplines"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Disiplines"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Innovative Ordnance (Discipline)</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Innovative Ordnance is one of the three Disciplines avaible to the Mercenary Advanced Class and is shared with the Powertech Advanced Class. It is formally known as Pyrotech.
Taking advantage of the chaos they've created is what the Innovative Ordnance Mercenary is all about. With an arsenal of explosive and piercing munitions, the I.O. Merc's barrage of missiles, grenades and weapon blasts cause lasting, destructive damage to all their targets.
</ns5:abstract>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Inner_Rim.jpg"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mercenary_Disiplines"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Innovative Ordnance is one of the three Disciplines avaible to the Mercenary Advanced Class and is shared with the Powertech Advanced Class. It is formally known as Pyrotech.
Taking advantage of the chaos they've created is what the Innovative Ordnance Mercenary is all about. With an arsenal of explosive and piercing munitions, the I.O. Merc's barrage of missiles, grenades and weapon blasts cause lasting, destructive damage to all their targets.
</rdfs:comment>
