    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Code of the Sith</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Order"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Sith Code forms the core beliefs of the Sith Order. It is derived strongly from the Jedi Code and was created by the first Dark Jedi to separate from the Jedi Order. It is the near opposite of the Jedi Code.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Sith Code forms the core beliefs of the Sith Order. It is derived strongly from the Jedi Code and was created by the first Dark Jedi to separate from the Jedi Order. It is the near opposite of the Jedi Code.

</rdfs:comment>
