    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This lore can be found on Nar Shaddaa.
Republic: X:3232, Y:-3369 This lore is in the Red Light Sector, on top of a table inside one of the spice factories.
Empire: X:1319 Y:2635 Found in the Network Access Secured Systems (Secured Systems is the most western district of the Network Access sector). It is on the terminal in the back of the room with an Imperial medical droid vendor.

