  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Overseer">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Overseer is the title given to Sith Lords or Sith Masters who instructed multiple Sith Acolytes. When Sith acolytes are accepted into the Academy they are assigned to an overseer; the overseer they get is dependent on their caste.

</rdfs:comment>
