    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Civil_War"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Nomi Sunrider (born Nomi Da-Boda), was a Human female Jedi Master and eventual Grand Master who fought during the Great Sith War. Strong and valient, Nomi helped the Jedi to many victories and her memory would be honored by the Order long after her passing into the Mandalorian Wars and the Jedi Civil War where people still talked of her achievements and lineage.

</ns5:abstract>
