    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">[Republic]: You can acquire this codex at Makeb: Republic Orbital Station. This Orbital Station stands between your ship and planet Makeb (X:2623 ; Y:861).
[Empire]: Plaque on stand in shuttle bay, west wall near Agent Tomms, Basic Gear Vendor (X: -3281 ; Y: -135).

</ns5:abstract>
