  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Freyyr">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:KotOR"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Freyyr was a Wookiee chieftain and the father of Chuundar (the firstborn) and Zaalbar. He was exiled to the Shadowlands by his eldest son when he discovered the dealings that Chuundar had with Czerka Corporation, where he lived for years until Revan came. After being defeated by Revan, he returned to the surface, where he awaited Revan.
When Revan arrived at the village, a fight broke out between Zaalbar, Freyyr, and Revan and Chuundar and his attendants. The fight resulted in Freyyr's reinstatement as chieftain and the eradication of Czerka on Kashyyyk.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Czerka_Corporation"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Chuundar"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Kashyyyk"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Freyyr</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Wookiees"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Freyyr was a Wookiee chieftain and the father of Chuundar (the firstborn) and Zaalbar. He was exiled to the Shadowlands by his eldest son when he discovered the dealings that Chuundar had with Czerka Corporation, where he lived for years until Revan came. After being defeated by Revan, he returned to the surface, where he awaited Revan.
When Revan arrived at the village, a fight broke out between Zaalbar, Freyyr, and Revan and Chuundar and his attendants. The fight resulted in Freyyr's reinstatement as chieftain and the eradication of Czerka on Kashyyyk.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Revan"/>
