  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Horuset_system">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Korriban"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Horuset system contained the lone planet of Korriban and its seven moons as well as two surrounding asteroid belts. It was located in the Sith Space region of the Outer Rim Territories.

</ns5:abstract>
