    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">T3-H8</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">T3-H8 is a T3 series utility droid sold by Janice Nall on Taris. T3-H8 is a droid that Janice sells for only 50 Credits. If the character chooses to buy T3-H8 it explodes before you get out the door. Janice will offer to give you your credits back.

</rdfs:comment>
