    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Mandalorian Elite</ns1:name>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Mandalorian Elites were a Mandalorian unit who were active during Cold War and Galactic War. They were often hired to be bodyguards in Strongholds. Members of them were seen in the Outlander's army.

</ns5:abstract>
