  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Stolen_Secrets">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The data files for the Planet Prison, a top secret Republic military weapon, have been stolen, along with valuable military hardware. A Rodian smuggler named Vistis Garn was behind the theft; he’s known to work for the Migrant Merchants’ Guild. Take a speeder to the old Galactic Market and infiltrate the Migrant Merchants’ Guild warehouse to recover the stolen goods.

</rdfs:comment>
