    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Telekinetic Throw is an ability available to the Jedi Consular at level 2. It is the second telekinetic attack the Consular receives. It is a channeled attack the causes damage over time. It costs 30 force, has a range of 15m, a channeling time of 3 seconds and a cooldown of 6 seconds.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Telekinetic Throw is an ability available to the Jedi Consular at level 2. It is the second telekinetic attack the Consular receives. It is a channeled attack the causes damage over time. It costs 30 force, has a range of 15m, a channeling time of 3 seconds and a cooldown of 6 seconds.


</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Telekinetic Throw</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
