    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Salus Bralor was a male Human Mandalorian and the father of Jogo during the Cold War. He was briefly seen on the Taris Imperial Orbital Station, overlooking the exchange between The Grand Champion and Jicoln Cadera with his son, Jogo.

</rdfs:comment>
