    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Zeerid Korr was a former Republic trooper in Havoc Squad. He later left the Republic and became a Smuggler for the illegal government Black Sun. He was good friends with Aryn Leneer.

</rdfs:comment>
