    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Gand Mercenary were mercenaries hired by Rogun the Butcher to kill the Smuggler that had caused him so much trouble, tracking the Smuggler down on Hoth. They attempted to use the air they breath in to kill him but were all defeated. They were armed with Blaster Rifles.

