    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Sedni_Maruk.png"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Sedyn Kyne was a Human male Mandalorian living doing the Cold War. On Hutta, he helped Tarro Blood with the Hunter's team, killing Braden and Jory. However his actions end up catching up to him as on Nar Shaddaa, he was challenged by the Hunter to a duel to the death, accepting it, Rellu fought as his second. But he was killed duing the duel with Rellu.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns1:class rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Commando"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sedyn Kyne</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mandalorians"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Sedyn Kyne was a Human male Mandalorian living doing the Cold War. On Hutta, he helped Tarro Blood with the Hunter's team, killing Braden and Jory. However his actions end up catching up to him as on Nar Shaddaa, he was challenged by the Hunter to a duel to the death, accepting it, Rellu fought as his second. But he was killed duing the duel with Rellu.

</rdfs:comment>
