    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Corporate Sector or "CorpSec" is an independent sector created in order to resolve differences between Galactic Republic lawmakers and the heads of many of the galaxy's largest corporations. It was located in the Outer Rim Territories, at the front end of the Tingel Arm region.</rdfs:comment>
