  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Unidentified_Mandalorian_(Nar_Shaddaa)">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
This man was a male Mandalorian Mercenary and the clan leader of a group of Mandalorians on Nar Shaddaa. When Meetra Surik had came to Nar Shaddaa, she encounter this Mandalorian and his clan with Mandalore the Preserver, though he had doubts whatever or not he was Mandalore, he was later in the end, agreed to take his clan to Dxun and helped rebuild the clans.

</ns5:abstract>
