    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Nal Hutta (Glorious Jewel in Huttese), often referred to as Hutta, is the capital of Hutt Space and is located in the Y'Toub system. Hutta is the starting planet for Bounty Hunter and Imperial Agent characters. For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: Nal Hutta on Wookieepedia


</rdfs:comment>
