    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Sergeant Cormun is the commander of a small group of Imperial Troopers that were tasked with dealing with the K'lor'slug Infestation in the Tomb of Ajunta Pall on Korriban. His squad was able to infiltrate the K'lor'slug egg chambers and place and set charges, but were attacked and killed by the K'lor'slugs defending the chamber. Cormun escaped and took shelter close to two Sith trainers near the entrance of the tomb, and hopes to find an acolyte bold enough to blow the charges and complete the mission he and his squad failed to accomplish. 

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Sergeant Cormun is the commander of a small group of Imperial Troopers that were tasked with dealing with the K'lor'slug Infestation in the Tomb of Ajunta Pall on Korriban. His squad was able to infiltrate the K'lor'slug egg chambers and place and set charges, but were attacked and killed by the K'lor'slugs defending the chamber. Cormun escaped and took shelter close to two Sith trainers near the entrance of the tomb, and hopes to find an acolyte bold enough to blow the charges and complete the mission he and his squad failed to accomplish. 

</rdfs:comment>
