    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Credit.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Credits</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Galactic Credit</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Credit</ns4:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Galactic Credit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Galactic Credit is the universal currency used in and by both the Galactic Republic and the Sith Empire. Used to buy goods from vendors, purchase things from the Galactic Trade Network, and gained by doing any of swtor's activities such as questing and PVP.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">credits</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Galactic Credit is the universal currency used in and by both the Galactic Republic and the Sith Empire. Used to buy goods from vendors, purchase things from the Galactic Trade Network, and gained by doing any of swtor's activities such as questing and PVP.

</ns5:abstract>
