    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Pernicar was a male Human Jedi Master who fought in the New Sith Wars. The son of a scribe, Pernicar's father sent him to the Jedi Order once he proved himself to be Force-sensitive. Pernicar went on to become a Jedi Lord in Lord Hoth's Army of Light and was a close friend to the gruff leader of the Jedi-led army.


</rdfs:comment>
