    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Republic Senate</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">government</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Galactic Senate serves as the legislative branch in the Galactic Republic; governing from the Senate Building located on Coruscant. Every member world in the Galactic Republic is entitled to a seat in the Galactic Senate and the right to vote on legislation.

</rdfs:comment>
