    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Serroco was a Valor-class cruiser used by the Galactic Republic during the Second Great Galactic War. The cruiser was under the command of Jedi Master Oteg at the Battle of Taral V. Like the Dantooine and the Telos, the Serroco was named after a planet devastated during the Mandalorian Wars.

</rdfs:comment>
