    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Akshae Shanka was a male Mandalorian bounty hunter who lived during the Great Galactic War. Akshae was greatly feared on planet Nal Hutta, having came second in three different Great Hunts, however this lead to him having a very bad mood. He was known wear blue and silver Mandalorian armor.

</rdfs:comment>
