    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Throws the main-hand lightsaber at a target, dealing 4241-4601 energy damage.  Only usable on targets at or below 30% max health.</ns1:description>
