  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Eryn_Talosa">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Eryn Talosa is a kingpin contract for the Bounty Contract Week. She is an Exchange leader based on Voss, causing a lot of robberies and killings to the Voss people, always calling her reckless actions "art". Someone needs to put her in her place, either in prison or to death.

</ns5:abstract>
