    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Schematics are the plans needed to learn how to craft new equipment. 
Crafting skills receive Schematics from the following:
Armstech: InvestigationCybertech: Investigation, Slicing has schematics for Starship Parts and Speeder vehiclesArmormech: Investigation, Underworld Trading provides orange fully moddable schematicsSynthweaving: Investigation, Underworld Trading provides orange fully moddable schematicsArtifice: InvestigationBiochem: Investigation</rdfs:comment>
