  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Yavin_Station">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Swkotor_2016-02-12_10-30-53-17.jpg"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Yavin Station was an orbital space station above Yavin IV. It was built by the Galactic Republic around the time of the Great Sith War and abandoned shortly after. A Rodian inventor took up residence there after the facility was abandoned and modified existing designs with equipment he found in the station or smugglers and mercenaries brought in.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Swkotor_2016-02-12_10-43-39-56.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Swkotor_2016-02-12_10-31-15-31.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Swkotor_2016-02-12_10-31-15-31.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Great_Sith_War"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Yavin Station was an orbital space station above Yavin IV. It was built by the Galactic Republic around the time of the Great Sith War and abandoned shortly after. A Rodian inventor took up residence there after the facility was abandoned and modified existing designs with equipment he found in the station or smugglers and mercenaries brought in.

</rdfs:comment>
