  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Undercity_Sewers">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Undercity sewers were part of the waste management system of planet Taris, locating in Undercity, the ground level of the planetwide city. The maze of large drains and reservoirs was divided in two levels, Lower Sewers that had entries next to outcast village in Undercity, and Upper Sewers that had access to the base of Black Vulkar swoop gang.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Taris"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Undercity sewers</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
