    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">"From Coruscant to the farthest reaches of the Outer Rim, you will be known as the saviors of the Republic."-Forn Dodonna to Revan and his companions
The Cross of Glory was the highest medal in the Republic military. It was awarded to Revan by Admiral Forn Dodonna.

</rdfs:comment>
