    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Darth Decimus</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Darth Decimus was a Human male who served as a member of the Emperor's Dark Council during the Cold War and was stationed at Imperial Central Command in the Government District on the planet Corellia.
He must be defeated as part of the mission: "Right to Arms."

</ns5:abstract>
  </rdf:Description>
