    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Na'daz was a male Twi'lek Sith Lord and the master of Kas'im, a Twi'lek slave who he purchased. Na'daz would teach Kas'im on the Outer Rim world of Ryloth for several years before he would be challenged by his apprentice, a duel that resulted in the Na'daz's death.

</rdfs:comment>
