    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Kyrenic</ns1:name>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/KDY_flashpoint.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Darth_Malgus"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Warrior"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Inquisitor"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Kyrenic was a male Mandalorian Bounty Hunter who lived during the Cold War. When Clan Varad went rouge and took the Republic warship Allusis, he was hired by Darth Malgus to be part of the Imperial Boarding Party with Sith Inquisitor Vincine, Sith Warrior Rotham, and Imperial Agent Andan. However he and the boarding party were killed during the fighting for the Allusis.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
