    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Champion_Gear_Bag"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Centurion commendations are found in Champion Gear Bags, which can be bought from the PVP Items Vendor for 200 Warzone and 200 Mercenary Commendations.
Centurion Commendations can be redeemed for gear at the Centurion vendor for your class, found in the Combat Training area of the fleet.
The quality of PVP gear is: Centurion &lt; Champion &lt; Battlemaster
See also: PVP Gear for an explantion of the PVP currency system
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:PvP"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/PVP_ForceMaster_Centurion.png?width=300"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Armor"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Centurion commendations are found in Champion Gear Bags, which can be bought from the PVP Items Vendor for 200 Warzone and 200 Mercenary Commendations.
Centurion Commendations can be redeemed for gear at the Centurion vendor for your class, found in the Combat Training area of the fleet.
The quality of PVP gear is: Centurion &lt; Champion &lt; Battlemaster
See also: PVP Gear for an explantion of the PVP currency system
</ns5:abstract>
