    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Rockets are a weapon that can be used by the Bounty Hunter . They are normally fired from wrist mounted launchers and can be used in conjuncture with the Bounty Hunter ability Death from Above. The corresponding weapon for Republic characters are the Trooper missiles.
</ns5:abstract>
