    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Clan Lok was a Mandalorian clan who in existence prior to the start of the Great Galactic War between the Galactic Republic and the Sith Empire. After one of their clan members had won the Great Hunt, Artus Lok would take the title of Mandalore after killing Mandalore the Lesser, becoming Mandalore the Vindicated. During the Cold War, Mandalore would offer the Grand Champion offer a place in his clan.

</ns5:abstract>
