    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The S3-F5 Inclement Condition Probe is a rugged droid model capable of functioning in even the most demanding environments, from tropical jungle to frozen wastelands. It is often equipped with identification routines used for scanning organic matter and collecting ecological data.


</rdfs:comment>
