    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Upper Industrial Sector is comprised largely of Republic corporations taking advantage of the business and economic climate of Nar Shaddaa. From Nar Shaddaa, they can conduct their research that otherwise would be restricted or forbidden at their normal headquarters and facilities inside Republic territory.


</ns5:abstract>
