    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mercenary_(Soldier_For_Hire)"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Soldiers are individuals trained in a variety of martial skills. These individuals fought for a variety of reasons (conscripts or mercenaries) and used a wide range of weaponry and combat tactics. A soldier was the lowest of infantry ranks. Spacefaring soldiers were known as star-warriors.</ns5:abstract>
