  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Lower_City_Cantina">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Hidden_Bek_Base"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Lower City Cantina, also known as Javyar's Cantina was a section of the Lower City on Taris. It was frequented by members of the Black Vulkar and Hidden Bek gangs, as well as bounty hunters and other lowlifes. The Cantina was also the home of Zax the Hutt, who ran the bounty office on Taris.
The Cantina was located near the Hidden Bek Base, down the corridor and to the left of the entrance from the Upper City.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Lower City Cantina, also known as Javyar's Cantina was a section of the Lower City on Taris. It was frequented by members of the Black Vulkar and Hidden Bek gangs, as well as bounty hunters and other lowlifes. The Cantina was also the home of Zax the Hutt, who ran the bounty office on Taris.
The Cantina was located near the Hidden Bek Base, down the corridor and to the left of the entrance from the Upper City.

</ns5:abstract>
