    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Meeb Wix is a male Gran Jedi Master serving the Jedi Order and the Galactic Republic during the Cold War with the resurgent Sith Empire. He is currently stationed on Tython, investigating the resurgence on the Flesh Raiders to Jedi territory.
Also the quest giver of Flesh Raider Fact-Finding

</rdfs:comment>
