    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Performs a series of lightsaber attacks that deal 7469 weapon damage over 3 seconds.  Standard and weak enemies are additionally stunned for the duration of the effect.  Strikes with both weapons if dual wielding.  Cannot be interrupted.</ns1:description>
