  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Bounty_Brokers_Association_Week">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">In order to participate in the bounty the player must be level 15+. All classes and subclasses are allowed to participate. Only one character can complete the chosen mission. However, this allows players to log onto other alternate characters to complete more missions. Also, each character can do only one contract per day.

</ns5:abstract>
