    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Arren Kae was a female Human Jedi Master who joined Revan to fight the Mandalorians. She was also the mother of Brianna, and died in the final battle of the Mandalorian Wars.

</ns5:abstract>
