  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Makem_Te_Assault">
    <ns1:available rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">20</ns1:available>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Makem Te Assault is a Republic Space Battle mission, along with Archenar Interception comprise the two missions of the Operation Glory Cyclone player mission. Bonus points are awarded for destroying interceptors and/or turrets on the Imperial frigates and destroyers. Grade 1 Ship Upgrades are recommended.

</ns5:abstract>
