    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Makem Te Assault is a Republic Space Battle mission, along with Archenar Interception comprise the two missions of the Operation Glory Cyclone player mission. Bonus points are awarded for destroying interceptors and/or turrets on the Imperial frigates and destroyers. Grade 1 Ship Upgrades are recommended.

</rdfs:comment>
