  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Senate_Bureau_of_Intelligence">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Senate Bureau of Intelligence, or SBI, is the primary civilian intelligence service for the Galactic Republic and is tasked with providing the Galactic Senate with domestic and foreign intelligence and to investigate possible security threats, both external and internal, to the Senate and its members. For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: Senate Bureau of Intelligence on Wookieepedia
</ns5:abstract>
