  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Xelian">
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Xelian</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/character"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Lords"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Xelian</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Vilia_Calimondra"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Female</ns1:gender>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Stubs"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Xelian, also known as Xelian the Destroyer, was a female Human Sith Lady and one of Sith Lady Vilia Calimondra's seven children. Tasked - along with her fellow siblings - to compete in the Charge Matrica for the right to inherit her mother's holdings upon her death, Xelian managed to expand her territiory, but was unable to win the Charge Matrica as she died by unknown means before the contest ended.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Lord_(rank)"/>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Xelian</ns1:name>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Humans"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Xelian, also known as Xelian the Destroyer, was a female Human Sith Lady and one of Sith Lady Vilia Calimondra's seven children. Tasked - along with her fellow siblings - to compete in the Charge Matrica for the right to inherit her mother's holdings upon her death, Xelian managed to expand her territiory, but was unable to win the Charge Matrica as she died by unknown means before the contest ended.

</ns5:abstract>
