    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">All items in Star Wars: The Old Republic have a quality rating associated with them which is defined by the item's text and icon border color.
The item quality guide you to the item's worth. But one should also inspect the item's level as higher level item with an lower quality might be better than a lower level one.
There are currently the following item qualities:

</rdfs:comment>
