    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Inexpugnable-class tactical command ship is a dreadnought that has been used by the Galactic Republic during the Mandalorian Wars. Due to its many weaknesses, only six of the command ships were made and soon they were phased out of the Republic Navy completely and replaced with the Centurion-class battlecruiser.

</ns5:abstract>
