    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">South Sector Boppers plays on the far south side of the Slippery Slopes Cantina on Nar Shaddaa. The band is comprised of 4 Kloo Players (Arconan and Duros), 1 Strummer and 1 Singer (both Twi'lek), and a Nalargonist (Drall).</ns5:abstract>
