    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Jedi Diplomacy (Consular)</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This lore can be found by a consular on Alderaan.
It will be unlocked during the mission “Hostile Negotiations” while having a conversation with Lord Teral.

</ns5:abstract>
