    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Nayama was a female Human Force-sensitive who joined the Jedi Order along with her husband and fellow Padawan Jolee Bindo. Nayama eventually left the Order and joined the Sith Lord Exar Kun's forces as a Sith apprentice during the conflict known as the Great Sith War.


</ns5:abstract>
