    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Berardesco was a male Humanoid Mandalorian Mercenary who worked for the Sith Empire during the Cold War. On Balmorra, he was station at the Imperial spaceport on the world. However someone from the Galactic Republic sneaked into the base, he was killed by the said someone. Berardesco before his death, was known to wear yellow Mandalorian armor, using two blaster pistols.

</rdfs:comment>
