    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Lost Twenty</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Lost Twenty, earlier known as The Lost, was the name given to the Jedi Masters who had voluntarily resigned their commission and left the Jedi Order over ideological differences.
</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Lost Twenty, earlier known as The Lost, was the name given to the Jedi Masters who had voluntarily resigned their commission and left the Jedi Order over ideological differences.
</rdfs:comment>
