    <ns1:race rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Humans"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Ahlan Matale was the leader of the Matale clan during the time of Revan and his estate survived the Sith bombardment of Dantooine, though as for he and his family they were not on Dantooine by the time Meetra Surik visited the world, so his whereabouts after Revan's visit remain unknown.

</ns5:abstract>
