  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Warzone_Arenas">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Orbital_station_854x480.jpg"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Arenas are small 4 Vs. 4 maps, in which players meet as a team to take down the opponents
Released originally in Patch Update 2.4 : Dread War, arenas can be available in Unranked Solo, Ranked Solo and Ranked Team for players. However ranked arenas are only available for players level 50 +.  Arenas are hosted for the enjoyment of Giradda the hutt the prime sponsorer of Huttball.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Orbital_station_854x480.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Giradda"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Warzone Arenas</rdfs:label>
