    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Gale was a male Jedi Knight and Jedi Lord of a series of constituent planets who served the Jedi Order and the Galactic Republic during the final decades of the wars with the new Sith Empire. Gale was a member of the Army of Light and was killed on the world of Ruusan during the Fourth Battle of Ruusan.

</ns5:abstract>
