    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Plan Zero is listed in the in-game Codex under the  Lore entries for the Sith Warrior.  It is obtained upon completion of the dialogue with Darth Baras following the killing of General Karastace Gonn, the key task of the Set the Table mission.

</rdfs:comment>
