  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Womp_Rat_Fever">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Attributes"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex/Lore"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Czerka_VX-736_Injector.jpg"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Czerka_VX-736_Injector.jpg?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This lore is found on Tatooine.
It is abtainable all over tatooine from fighting a group of womp rats and one of which is ill. The lore is obtained by getting the Womp Rat fever. There is a level 50 neutral womp rat roaming in the PvP area if your level is to high to get the fever from the low level womp rats. You can cure the Womp Rat Fever by buying 'Czerka VX-736 Injector'. Republic: Empire: There is a Jawa vendor in Mos Ila that sells the cure.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Czerka_VX-736_Injector_Icon_Selector.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Czerka_VX-736_Injector_Icon_Selector.jpg"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex/Lore"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Womp Rat Fever</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Czerka_VX-736_Injector.jpg"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This lore is found on Tatooine.
It is abtainable all over tatooine from fighting a group of womp rats and one of which is ill. The lore is obtained by getting the Womp Rat fever. There is a level 50 neutral womp rat roaming in the PvP area if your level is to high to get the fever from the low level womp rats. You can cure the Womp Rat Fever by buying 'Czerka VX-736 Injector'. Republic: Empire: There is a Jawa vendor in Mos Ila that sells the cure.


</ns5:abstract>
