    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Nalju family is one of the six Great Houses of Serenno, headed by Count Nalju. It was on his estate that the Anti-Republic Liberation Front attempted to kidnap former Supreme Chancellor Tarsus Valorum.</rdfs:comment>
