  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sniper">
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sniper</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Advanced_Classes"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sniper</rdfs:label>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Swtor_2014-10-17_13-15-45-99.png"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Sniper is one of the of two Imperial Agent Advanced Classes. They typically use long range laser rifles and recon to eliminate their targets.
Focused on covert tactics and eliminating sensitive targets, Imperial Snipers are the most elite and professional sharpshooters in the galaxy. After extensive training, the Sniper’s long range blaster rifle becomes a weapon of exacting precision, allowing him to target enemies’ vulnerabilities and strike at the perfect moment to turn the tide of battle in his favor.
In addition to the skills listed on the following pages, Snipers have upgrades for setting up an entrenched position, providing a counter against attacks that might knock him out of cover, as well as a knock-back upgrade called Cover Pulse---a player-triggered pulse mine that can knock an unsuspecting attacker away from the Sniper.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Tremel1.png"/>
