    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Game_terms"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Binds on Use (BoU), in game as Binds on Use, refers to an item that becomes bound to the player when the item is:Used by the player.
These items include cosmetic items such as Holostatues and toys, like Ball Toss.

</ns5:abstract>
