    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Corridan Ordo was a male Human Mandalorian soldier who lived during the Great Galactic War up to the Cold War. A member of Clan Ordo, Corridan was a respected captain among the Mandalorians and was close friends with Torian Cadera even after his father's actions brought disgrace to his clan. During the Cold War, Corridan took up mercenary work for the Sith Empire and was hired to take out a Republic senator under Jedi protection. With the help with his fellow Mandalorians, the mission succeeded despite an injury to Corridan when the Jedi clipped him with a lightsaber during the fighting, the Beskar-Gam helmet saved his life.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Corridan Ordo was a male Human Mandalorian soldier who lived during the Great Galactic War up to the Cold War. A member of Clan Ordo, Corridan was a respected captain among the Mandalorians and was close friends with Torian Cadera even after his father's actions brought disgrace to his clan. During the Cold War, Corridan took up mercenary work for the Sith Empire and was hired to take out a Republic senator under Jedi protection. With the help with his fellow Mandalorians, the mission succeeded despite an injury to Corridan when the Jedi clipped him with a lightsaber during the fighting, the Beskar-Gam helmet saved his life.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Humans"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Corridan Ordo</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/BioWare"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Soldier"/>
