  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Thoma">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Order"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Thoma</ns4:altLabel>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Thoma was a Human male Padawan who served the Jedi Order during the Cold War between the Galactic Republic and the resurgent Sith Empire. Stationed on Nar Shaddaa, he went on a mission to investigate alien mercenaries that have trained themselves to join the Empire. While investigating inside the Mercenary Training Facility Barracks, his mission was a failure until he was killed by the Imperial mercenaries.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
