    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/wookieepedia"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Thoma was a Human male Padawan who served the Jedi Order during the Cold War between the Galactic Republic and the resurgent Sith Empire. Stationed on Nar Shaddaa, he went on a mission to investigate alien mercenaries that have trained themselves to join the Empire. While investigating inside the Mercenary Training Facility Barracks, his mission was a failure until he was killed by the Imperial mercenaries.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
