  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Server:The_Bastion">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Bastion is a US West Coast PvP Server. The Bastion is one of the Free-To-Play servers. Players from Wound in the Force were moved to this server after the deletion of most of their servers, forcing Early Access players to loose their character and legacy names to newer players. 

