    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Increases the damage dealt and healing strength of Force abilities. It also increases the critical hit rate of force attacks.
Prior to Star Wars: The Old Republic: Knights of the Fallen Empire this was the primary stat of the Sith Inquisitor and Jedi Consular. With the release of KotFE all classes use Mastery as their primary stat.</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Consular"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Willpower</ns4:altLabel>
