    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Vanquishes the target using mighty force dealing X kinetic damage initially, Plus an additional X kinetic damage over 6 seconds. The target also becomes vulnerable for 45 Seconds increasing the damage dealt by force attacks by 5%.
