    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Cartel_Market"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Vehicle_Czerka_Cruiser.png?width=300"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Czerka Cruiser is a speeder mount available for purchase for 8,000 credits. The player can purchase and use the speeder once they unlock Speeder Piloting I, II or III. The level at which this skill unlocks varies depending upon if any Legacy Skills are learned, which will reduce the level requirement to unlock this skill. Speeder Piloting can also be purchased from the Cartel Market.
Attributes:Increases speed by 90%Cost: 8,000 Credits
Vendors:Londrod, Tatooine
</ns5:abstract>
