    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Characters/armies that are labeled independent do not have an allegiance to the Sith Empire or the Galactic Republic. They are their own bosses, and are many times hired by the Sith or the Jedi as mercenaries.
</ns5:abstract>
