    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Hidden Bek swoop gang, also known as the Hidden Beks, or simply the Beks were the rival swoop gang of the Black Vulkars. The Beks were led by Gadon Thek, who lost his sight in an accident, but received mechanical replacements that allowed him to see well enough to lead the gang.
The second-in-command of the Beks, Brejik, wanted control, and when the accident happened, he thought that Gandon would step down and let him lead. When the older man did not, Brejik left the Beks and took control of the Vulkars, declaring a gang war against them in the process.
</rdfs:comment>
