    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Valen Korik was a male Human Mandalorian, he was wanted for killing two Sith Lords in violation of the Mandalorian-Imperial alliance. He attempted to hide in the The Dark Temple, but was possessed by the dark spirits there along with his men. He was finally killed by someone from the Sith Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
