    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Mirial is a dry, cold world in the Outer Rim and the homeworld of the Mirialan species. They were formerly aligned with the Sith in the Jedi Civil War, but returned to the Republic after the fall of Darth Malak. For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: Mirial on Wookieepedia
