    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Mandellian Gambit was a starship affiliated with crime lord Nok Drayen and was used during the Great Galactic War. In the year 3,664 BBY, Risha Drayen, Nok' daughter, was born in hyperspace on board the Gambit.


</ns5:abstract>
