    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Mandalorian Vindicators were a unit of elite Mandalorian raiders that were under the command of Duran Gorr, assisting him in stealing the Galactic Republic warheads. They were armed with blaster cannons.

</ns5:abstract>
