  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Lightsaber_Crystal">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Order"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Weapons"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Color-crystals.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Crystal1.png"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Lightsaber crystal was a catch-all term for any object that could be used as the focus in lightsaber construction. While crystals were most commonly used, certain types of jewels, gems, stones and ingots could work. The type of crystal used in its construction could imbue lightsabers with special properties and abilities.
The type of crystal from which a lightsaber draws focus influences the color of the blade. Naturally-found crystals are used in Jedi lightsabers, while the Sith use synthetically created crystals.
Lightsaber crystals were traditionally found and/or mined by the Jedi Order, which results in the canon earthy blue, green, and yellow lightsaber colors.
During the centuries the Sith spent quietly building an army to challenge the Republic, lightsabers needed to be constructed without attracting the attention of the Jedi Order, which heavily controlled the acquisition of lightsaber crystals. As a result, the Sith were forced to develop their own, artificial lightsaber crystals through careful application of the Force. These crystals, all synthesized in the same method, all produced the same characteristic red blade. The Sith would come to view this as additional mastery over the Force, and would from then on opt to use the characteristically red-bladed lightsabers that contained artificial crystals.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Lightsaber crystal</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sith_Order"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Lightsaber Crystal</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Order"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Crystal1.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">lightsaber crystal</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Lightsaber crystal</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
