    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Kennet Parn was a female Miraluka Jedi who served the Jedi Order on board the Carrick Station during the Cold War between the Galactic Republic and the resurgent Sith Empire.

</ns5:abstract>
