    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">NL0-A's starship was a starship crewed by droid historians and led by the droid NL0-A, this group of droids were devoted to recording galactic events and history. During the Cold War, the vessel returned to known space.


</rdfs:comment>
