    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/wookieepedia"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Kashyyyk is the lush and heavily forested homeworld of the Wookiees. It is located in the same star system as the Trandoshan homeworld of Trandosha, a fact that has led to bitter bloodfeuds and other conflicts between the two neighbouring species.

</rdfs:comment>
