  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Esok">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Esok</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Neo-Crusders"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mandalorians"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:NPCs/Deceased_NPCs"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mandalorians"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Esok.jpg"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Dantooine"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Esok.jpg?width=300"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Neo-Crusaders"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Esok was a male Mandalorian clan chieftain who lived during the dark times of the Galactic Republic. Esok after the Mandalorian Wars and the Jedi Civil War, lead his clan to Dantooine, hanging out with other mercenaries of the planet. When Mandalore the Preserver guided by Meetra Surik, Esok refused to summon his clan to Dxun and actually try kill Canderous Ordo in a attempt to become Mandalore, but he was killed in the fight against Mandalore the Preserver.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Meetra_Surik"/>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_II:_The_Sith_Lords"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dxun"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Males"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Esok</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalore_the_Preserver"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Wars"/>
    <ns1:faction rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Neo-Crusders"/>
    <ns1:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Deceased</ns1:status>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Esok</ns1:name>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian_Neo-Crusaders"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Dantooine"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Esok was a male Mandalorian clan chieftain who lived during the dark times of the Galactic Republic. Esok after the Mandalorian Wars and the Jedi Civil War, lead his clan to Dantooine, hanging out with other mercenaries of the planet. When Mandalore the Preserver guided by Meetra Surik, Esok refused to summon his clan to Dxun and actually try kill Canderous Ordo in a attempt to become Mandalore, but he was killed in the fight against Mandalore the Preserver.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Civil_War"/>
    <ns1:gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Male</ns1:gender>
