    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This article contains the general Community Guidelines adhered on TOR Wiki.
The specific and individual policies and guidelines are listed directly below:Manual of StyleScope of the ProjectGuild PolicyImage PolicyUser Blogs Blocking GuidelinesVandalismUnacceptable Content PolicyDeletion
For a more general overview, it is recommended that you read the Community Guidelines, as the provide essential information for any new (or old) editor that can give a contributor a good idea of how the community works; and to give an instant answer to a question that you might have.

</rdfs:comment>
