  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Engineering_(Skill_Tree)">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Engineering is a skill tree of the Imperial Agent's Sniper advanced class. This tree focuses on long-ranged damage using probes and droids.
The following table contains the known skills that can be gained from this tree:


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Imperial_Agent"/>
