    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Padawan"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Oojoh was a male Ho'Din Padawan and contemporary of Zayne Carrick, who was the only apprentice of his class to escape the Padawan Massacre, an event which saw four Taris Jedi Masters slay their own padawans, Oojoh included.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Jedi_Padawans"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Oojoh was a male Ho'Din Padawan and contemporary of Zayne Carrick, who was the only apprentice of his class to escape the Padawan Massacre, an event which saw four Taris Jedi Masters slay their own padawans, Oojoh included.


</ns5:abstract>
