    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Tomb of Naga Sadow was the final resting place of the Dark Lord of the Sith Naga Sadow. It was located in the Valley of the Dark Lords on Korriban, and was excavated when the Sith Academy was established there during the Jedi Civil War.
