  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Euan_Morton">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Euan Douglas George Morton is a Scottish actor and singer who provided the voice work for the male Sith Inquisitor. 
He is known for his role as Boy George in the musical Taboo, receiving nominations for the Laurence Olivier Award and Tony Award for his performance. He has also done work for Sword of Honor and Captain Jack.</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/EuanMorton.jpg?width=300"/>
