    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Kherus was a Pureblood Sith Lord of the resurgent Empire, serving under Darth Ikoral during his expedition to locate Purebloods he believed had escaped the Jedi's attempted genocide of the species, but had not joined the great exodus to Dromund Kaas.

</ns5:abstract>
