  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Hatred_(Discipline)">
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Hatred (Discipline)</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Harbinger_(cruiser).jpg"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Hatred (Discipline)</rdfs:label>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Assassin_Disiplines"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Hatred is one of the three Disciplines avaible for the Assassin Advanced Class. It focuses on close range damage-over-time effects.
Hate fuels the Dark Side of the Force, and no one knows this better than the Hatred Assassin. Able to command dark Force powers that assault many targets at once or sap an enemy's very essance from a distance, the Hatred Assassin can also stand face-to-face with any foe.
</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Hatred is one of the three Disciplines avaible for the Assassin Advanced Class. It focuses on close range damage-over-time effects.
Hate fuels the Dark Side of the Force, and no one knows this better than the Hatred Assassin. Able to command dark Force powers that assault many targets at once or sap an enemy's very essance from a distance, the Hatred Assassin can also stand face-to-face with any foe.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Disiplines"/>
