    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Gunslinger is one of the of two Smuggler Advanced Classes.
Primary Focus:Dual PistolsQuickdraw / Fast AttacksRanged DPSCover
Another specific upgrade is that the Sweeping Gunfire can be used while the player moves the cone of fire, although this requires a certain amount of care.

</rdfs:comment>
