  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/The_Entity">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Entity is a powerful dark side spirit that has lived for many a millenia. She was once the lover of Tenebrae, the Sith Emperor, before her imprisonment by Darth Baras. She was later freed by Darth Vowrawn and the current Emperor's Wrath.

</rdfs:comment>
