    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Gratua</ns1:name>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Gratua, named after the Mando'a word for "Vengeance", was a Kandosii-type dreadnought used by the Mandalorians during the Mandalorian Wars. The Gratua was among the numerous Mandalorian warship that fought at the Siege of Taris.

</rdfs:comment>
