    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Gratua, named after the Mando'a word for "Vengeance", was a Kandosii-type dreadnought used by the Mandalorians during the Mandalorian Wars. The Gratua was among the numerous Mandalorian warship that fought at the Siege of Taris.

</ns5:abstract>
