    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Triumph-class fighter was starfighter used by the Galactic Republic during the Cold War and Second Great Galactic War. The Triumph-class is used primarily by the Republic Special Forces Division as a close support fighter, the Triumph-class is also very similar in its design to the G-X1 Firehauler, which is currently in service with the Republic Navy.

</ns5:abstract>
