  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Vilia_Calimondra">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Females"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Vilia Calimondra's</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Vilia Calimondra was a female Human Sith Lady and the matriarch of the Calimondra family, a Sith state that stretched across most of the Grumani sector during the final days of the Old Republic.

</ns5:abstract>
