  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Clan_Farr">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Revanites"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Clan Farr was a Mandalorian clan who were active during Cold War. During Mandalorian Wars, Clan Farr were among the clans that clashed with Galactic Republic, however when Revan enter the war. He earned the respect of Clan Farr when he defeated members from this clan. During the Cold War, Clan allied itself with the Revanites, seeking keep the memory of Revan alive.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Revanites"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Organizations"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Valk_Beroya"/>
    <ns1:allegiance rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Revanites"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Clan Farr was a Mandalorian clan who were active during Cold War. During Mandalorian Wars, Clan Farr were among the clans that clashed with Galactic Republic, however when Revan enter the war. He earned the respect of Clan Farr when he defeated members from this clan. During the Cold War, Clan allied itself with the Revanites, seeking keep the memory of Revan alive.
Clan Farr would be one of the clans to answer Mandalore the Avenger's call to Darvannis. But one of their clan members, Venko Farr and his sisters would be killed during the fighting in the Zakuul droid factory under Valk Beroya's command.

</ns5:abstract>
