    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Wookieepedia is a Star Wars encyclopaedia, written collaboratively by its readers, who are known as Wookieepedians. The site is part of the Wikia network and focuses only of the in-universe aspect of Star Wars rather than the game mechanics.

</ns5:abstract>
