    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Wounding_Shots.png?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Exploits Upper Hand to fire a wave of bolts at the target, dealing 1997 - 2130 weapon damage. For each of your bleed effects present on the target, the target hemorrhages for an additional 854 internal damage. Requires and consumes Upper Hand.</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:icon rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Wounding_Shots.PNG"/>
