    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Exploits Upper Hand to fire a wave of bolts at the target, dealing 1997 - 2130 weapon damage. For each of your bleed effects present on the target, the target hemorrhages for an additional 854 internal damage. Requires and consumes Upper Hand.</ns1:description>
    <ns1:energy rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">25</ns1:energy>
    <ns1:range rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">10m</ns1:range>
    <ns1:name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Wounding Shots</ns1:name>
