  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Bothawui">
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Bothawui</ns4:altLabel>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Bothawui is the homeworld of the Bothans. The Planet is located in Bothan Space which is in the Mid Rim. During the Great Galactic War it has seen two of the major battles. For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: Bothawui on Wookieepedia
de:Bothawui</rdfs:comment>
