  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Shield_Tech_(Discipline)">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Disiplines"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Powertech_Disiplines"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Shield Tech (Discipline)</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Shield Tech is one of the three Disciplies avaible to the Powertech Advanced Class. It focuses on Defensive and Distraction Abilities.
Launching into the frey with a jetpack-propelled attack and able to withstand powerful offenses, the Powertech is trained in Shield Tech specification takes the brunt of the assault while employing a wide range of tech-based attacks to scorch and trip up even the most formidable advasaries.
</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Shield Tech is one of the three Disciplies avaible to the Powertech Advanced Class. It focuses on Defensive and Distraction Abilities.
Launching into the frey with a jetpack-propelled attack and able to withstand powerful offenses, the Powertech is trained in Shield Tech specification takes the brunt of the assault while employing a wide range of tech-based attacks to scorch and trip up even the most formidable advasaries.
</rdfs:comment>
