    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">House Thul is one of the Alderaanian Noble Dynasties. Originally, it had been exiled from the Alderaanian Parliament. However, with Imperial support, House Thul returned to power and brought Imperial personnel to Alderaan to help "reestablish its estates". 

