    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Landing Party</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Landing Party is the first mission in the Smuggler's story arc. The Smuggler will gain this mission automatically after disembarking their ship and talking with Skavak and later, Corso Riggs. The Smuggler must disable the Separatists' remote control stations for the defense gun so that the Smuggler can take-off again.

</ns5:abstract>
