  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Hrakert_Rift">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rift_station"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Hrakert Rift was a deep valley under the oceans of Manaan. It was the source of the kolto that the planet was famous for manufacturing, and home of many Firaxan sharks, including a massive firaxan believed to be the Progneitor.
The Republic built a secret facilty on the edge of the rift to harvest the kolto at the source, but the station was later destroyed after it woke the Progenitor.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/House_Thul_Plaza.jpg"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Hrakert Rift was a deep valley under the oceans of Manaan. It was the source of the kolto that the planet was famous for manufacturing, and home of many Firaxan sharks, including a massive firaxan believed to be the Progneitor.
The Republic built a secret facilty on the edge of the rift to harvest the kolto at the source, but the station was later destroyed after it woke the Progenitor.

</ns5:abstract>
