    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Dreams of Soil was a colossal exploration ship that contained an entire artificially created ecosystem. The vessel was crewed by Human explorers during the Cold War. The Dreams of Soil contained forests, lakes, and a pelenthora of plants and animals.

</rdfs:comment>
