    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Shiv is a melee attack usable by the Imperial Agent that does moderate damage.
Shiv (Rank 1) 
Level: 1-3
Credits: UNKNOWN
Energy: 40
Cast Time: Instant
Range: 4m
Details: Stab the target with your energy blade for moderate damage, and light damage over 3 seconds.
</ns5:abstract>
