    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Vort Norman was a male Twi'lek Mandalorian Bounty Hunter doing work on Dromund Kaas during the Cold War. When the Mandalorian warrior Deth Kregg began issuing challenges, it was Vort Norman who spread the word out.

</rdfs:comment>
