  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Ruins_of_Kaleth">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/File:Kaleth.png"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Kaleth.png"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Ruins of Kaleth</rdfs:label>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Ruins of Kaleth</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex"/>
    <ns5:thumbnail rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Kaleth.png?width=300"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Ruins are located southwest of  the Jedi Temple on Tython. Inhabited by various Tythonian War Droids, Greater Guids, Uxibeasts and Wingmaws, there are plenty of enemies to watch out for when navigating the area. Both Jedi Knights and Consulars have various class quests here and this is also the location that leads to Tython's one heroic quest, The Chamber of Speech.</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Ruins are located southwest of  the Jedi Temple on Tython. Inhabited by various Tythonian War Droids, Greater Guids, Uxibeasts and Wingmaws, there are plenty of enemies to watch out for when navigating the area. Both Jedi Knights and Consulars have various class quests here and this is also the location that leads to Tython's one heroic quest, The Chamber of Speech.</ns5:abstract>
