  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Arsenal_(Discipline)">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Mercenary_Disiplines"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Kaerobe.jpg"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Arsenal is one of the three Disciplines avaible to the Mercenary Advanced Class. It focuses on long-range sustained damage.
The Arsenal Mercenary specializes in distance attacks, employing long-range weapons to demolish anyone unlucky enough to be in their sights. Devestating missile-fire combinations and relentless blaster volleys generate a spectacle of explosive brilliance and transform the Bounty Hunter into a virtural artillery platform.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Disiplines"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Arsenal is one of the three Disciplines avaible to the Mercenary Advanced Class. It focuses on long-range sustained damage.
The Arsenal Mercenary specializes in distance attacks, employing long-range weapons to demolish anyone unlucky enough to be in their sights. Devestating missile-fire combinations and relentless blaster volleys generate a spectacle of explosive brilliance and transform the Bounty Hunter into a virtural artillery platform.
</ns5:abstract>
