  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Charm">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Charm is an ability available to the Smuggler before level 32. It is a buff that increases all group members presence for 30 minutes. It costs 25 energy and is instant cast with no cooldown.
</ns5:abstract>
