    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Ieldis was a male Sith Lord of the Sith Empire and a noted inventor, responsible for creating at least two powerful Force-imbued objects, the Sword of Ieldis and the Helm of Ieldis.

</ns5:abstract>
