    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Shad Jelavan was a Human male Padawan and contemporary of Zayne Carrick, who was the only apprentice of his class to escape the Padawan Massacre, an event which saw four Taris Jedi Masters slay their own Padawans, Shad included.


</rdfs:comment>
