  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Master">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Titles"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Master is a rank in the Old Republic time period for Jedi to achieve.
The title of Master is a story-based reward (as are Darth, Lord, etc.). Not everyone who completes a Sith or Jedi story will achieve these titles. The choices that a character makes matter in many ways, such as notoriety rewards and reputation.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageExternalLink rdf:resource="http://www.swtor.com/community/showthread.php?p=6089500#edit6089500"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Master</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/class/expand"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Titles"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Lord"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Master</ns4:altLabel>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Master is a rank in the Old Republic time period for Jedi to achieve.
The title of Master is a story-based reward (as are Darth, Lord, etc.). Not everyone who completes a Sith or Jedi story will achieve these titles. The choices that a character makes matter in many ways, such as notoriety rewards and reputation.

</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Master</rdfs:label>
