  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/The_Invasion_of_Balmorra">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This lore can be found on Balmorra.
Republic: X:1263, Y:673 It’s in the Balmorran Arms Factory, northern part of Sundari Flatlands. There is a computer terminal next to the door into the entry hallway.
Empire: X:1263, Y:678 You need to have an Imperial Agent in your group or be one. You’ll need to go through Balmorran Arms Factory to the Power Center area and then into Administrative Complex.The class quest to gain access is “Destroy the Enemy”. 

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">The Invasion of Balmorra</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This lore can be found on Balmorra.
Republic: X:1263, Y:673 It’s in the Balmorran Arms Factory, northern part of Sundari Flatlands. There is a computer terminal next to the door into the entry hallway.
Empire: X:1263, Y:678 You need to have an Imperial Agent in your group or be one. You’ll need to go through Balmorran Arms Factory to the Power Center area and then into Administrative Complex.The class quest to gain access is “Destroy the Enemy”. 

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">The Invasion of Balmorra</ns4:altLabel>
