  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Renegade_Interceptor">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Renegade Interceptor is a quest reward for the Imperial Agent it is also seen with many other Imperial Characters such as an Imperial Soldier. It appears to be an Combat Blaster with just it being pure black.
</ns5:abstract>
