  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Quesh_Venom">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/WP_20110121_Quesh_1024x691.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Quesh Venom</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This lore can be found on Quesh. 
 This lore will be granted in the Three Family War Camp, when you accept the quest by 'Goonawaro'. 
Empire: This entry is obtained by talking to the Imperial Vaccination Officer on the Quesh Orbital Station. He will give you the first quest in the Quesh planetary quest line. 

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This lore can be found on Quesh. 
