    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
This Individual was a male Mandalorian who was stationed at Outpost Rennar. While at the wastes, he was ambushed by a Tusken Raider, however he was able kill him and took a peak at his mask. He would later explain this story to another Mandalorian.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Ithorian_Revanchist.jpg"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Tatooine"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
This Individual was a male Mandalorian who was stationed at Outpost Rennar. While at the wastes, he was ambushed by a Tusken Raider, however he was able kill him and took a peak at his mask. He would later explain this story to another Mandalorian.

</ns5:abstract>
