  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/First_Great_Schism">
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Fight_or_Flight.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">First Great Schism</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Hundred-Year_Darkness"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">First Great Schism</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Order"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">First Great Schism</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Events"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Events"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The First Great Schism was one of the first splits between followers of the Jedi Order and those who refused to follow the Jedi hierarchy's dictates. To its contemporaries it was a conflict without name, and known as the Great Schism by historians that followed. Eventually, the Second Great Schism necessitated referring to the initial conflict as the First.</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The First Great Schism was one of the first splits between followers of the Jedi Order and those who refused to follow the Jedi hierarchy's dictates. To its contemporaries it was a conflict without name, and known as the Great Schism by historians that followed. Eventually, the Second Great Schism necessitated referring to the initial conflict as the First.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
