    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Daily_Missions"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[DAILY AREA] Wreck of the Stardream was a daily area mission, part of the Rakghoul Pandemic world event. It was acquired by entering the Wreck of the Stardream area in the north eastern parts of the Dune Sea on Tatooine. The level of the mission varied depending on the player's level.

</rdfs:comment>
