    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Lema Xandret was a droid maker of the Sith Empire and the mother of Cinzia Xandret, a Sith Apprentice. She was declared a fugitive when she refused to give her daughter to the Sith and fled to Sebaddon.


</rdfs:comment>
