    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Outpost Thorazan</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Locations"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Outpost Thorazan is a Galactic Republic aligned outpost in The Dune Sea area of Tatooine.
This outpost is extremely esssential for players to travel to the Dune Sea. It is one of the final locations of Tatooine for players of all classes.


