    <ns1:race rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
    <ns1:level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">11</ns1:level>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Deth Kregg</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Star_Wars:_The_Old_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Mandalorian"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Deth Kregg was a male Human Mandalorian warrior who lived during the Cold War. On Dromund Kaas, he was skilled warrior, being able rip arms off a Gundark with his bare hands. Looking for challenge, he issue a challenge to anyone who can defeat him. Finally someone was able defeat him and his men.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Derriphan_battleship.gif"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Human"/>
