    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">{{ #if: |
Deth Kregg was a male Human Mandalorian warrior who lived during the Cold War. On Dromund Kaas, he was skilled warrior, being able rip arms off a Gundark with his bare hands. Looking for challenge, he issue a challenge to anyone who can defeat him. Finally someone was able defeat him and his men.

</ns5:abstract>
