  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Hyperspace">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Hyperspace is an alternate state of existence first utilized by the Rakata of the Infinite Empire. Starships can enter hyperspace in order to attain velocities faster than the speed of light. This provides a means to travel between stars, and has become the predominant form of interstellar travel used in the galaxy.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Rakata"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Hyperspace is an alternate state of existence first utilized by the Rakata of the Infinite Empire. Starships can enter hyperspace in order to attain velocities faster than the speed of light. This provides a means to travel between stars, and has become the predominant form of interstellar travel used in the galaxy.

</ns5:abstract>
