    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Ship Upgrades</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Ship Upgrades</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Starship Upgrades are upgrades for the player starship that can be bought or crafted. Grades 1, 3 and 5 are purchasable while Grades 2, 4 and 6 are obtained through crafting and as rewards. Specials are bought for Fleet Commendations. 

</ns5:abstract>
