  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sluis_Van">
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Sluis Van is a planet in the Outer Rim and homeworld of the Sluissi. The space docking facility and shipyard was destroyed during the onslaught of the Sith Empire. For information on this subject beyond The Old Republic, see: Sluis Van on Wookieepedia
de:Sluis Van</ns5:abstract>
