  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Medals">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Valor"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Warzone_Commendation"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Medals</rdfs:label>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Medical_Droid.png"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:PvP"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:PvP"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Medals, or Warzone Medals, are awarded to players during Warzones for completing certain goals. Each of your first 4 medals will earn the player 500 Valor and 10 Warzone Commendations and multiple medals can be earned during the Warzone.
The medals are categorized for each of the roles in the game, healers will easily get the healing medals, tanks the protection medals and damage dealers the damage medals although it is possible for a tank to get damage medals and vice versa. There are also non-specific role medals that any role can obtain.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">medals</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Medals, or Warzone Medals, are awarded to players during Warzones for completing certain goals. Each of your first 4 medals will earn the player 500 Valor and 10 Warzone Commendations and multiple medals can be earned during the Warzone.
The medals are categorized for each of the roles in the game, healers will easily get the healing medals, tanks the protection medals and damage dealers the damage medals although it is possible for a tank to get damage medals and vice versa. There are also non-specific role medals that any role can obtain.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Warzones"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Medals</ns4:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
