  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Hologram">
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Galactic_Republic"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Hologram is a projected three-dimensional image of an object or a person. It is normally used in visual communication or as entertainment by a recording. Holograms are projected by a holographic emitter.
Organizations such as the Republic, Sith Empire and the Jedi Order rely heavily on holographic communication to function.


</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/NarShadaaCityscape.png"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Technology"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Jedi_Order"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Equipment"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Hologram</rdfs:label>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">A Hologram is a projected three-dimensional image of an object or a person. It is normally used in visual communication or as entertainment by a recording. Holograms are projected by a holographic emitter.
Organizations such as the Republic, Sith Empire and the Jedi Order rely heavily on holographic communication to function.


</ns5:abstract>
