  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Daily_Missions">
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Daily_Area_Missions"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Daily_Missions"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Daily missions (more commonly known as "dailies") are missions that can be run and handed in once a 24-hour period. Daily missions are usually single-objective missions that players must complete as part of weekly objectives and are most often rewarded with a combination of commendations and credits, though depending on the type of daily being completed players can also be rewarded with reputation trophies.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Daily missions (more commonly known as "dailies") are missions that can be run and handed in once a 24-hour period. Daily missions are usually single-objective missions that players must complete as part of weekly objectives and are most often rewarded with a combination of commendations and credits, though depending on the type of daily being completed players can also be rewarded with reputation trophies.
Daily missions can range in difficulty from being single-player missions to being Heroic 2+ missions, up to the highest difficulty of being a Heroic 4 mission. Also, depending on whether players are using an Imperial or Republic character the daily missions are unique to that player character's faction, though the rewards offered for faction-specific daily missions are the same.

</ns5:abstract>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Missions"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
