    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Sphere of Ancient Knowledge, also known as the Pyramid of Ancient Knowledge was one of twelve Spheres of Influence of the Sith Empire. Headed by a Dark Councilor, the Sphere was responsible for the protection and expansion of Sith knowledge.
</rdfs:comment>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Sphere of Ancient Knowledge, also known as the Pyramid of Ancient Knowledge was one of twelve Spheres of Influence of the Sith Empire. Headed by a Dark Councilor, the Sphere was responsible for the protection and expansion of Sith knowledge.
