    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Operation: Blackout (Agent)</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This lore can be found by an agent on Balmorra.
The codex is found on a console, located in the instanced agent area in the arms factory during “Destroy the Enemy” mission. It’s possible other class’s can get this codex if they are in the same group.

</rdfs:comment>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Ood_Bnar.jpg"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This lore can be found by an agent on Balmorra.
The codex is found on a console, located in the instanced agent area in the arms factory during “Destroy the Enemy” mission. It’s possible other class’s can get this codex if they are in the same group.

</ns5:abstract>
