    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Sith_Empire"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">The Seizure of the Seswenna Sector was seized by the Sith Empire from the Galactic Republic in a series of battles. The military operation was one of the final ones during the Empire's campaign of seizing the Outer RIm.

</ns5:abstract>
