    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Republic Government</rdfs:label>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Codex/Lore"/>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Republic Government</ns5:wikiPageWikiLinkText>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">This lore can be found on Coruscant.X:-1333, Y:-4806 This lore object is a clickable holocron that is found in the Senate Tower (First Floor) on Coruscant. After entering the Senate Tower, take the second corridor on the left. Then make your second right, and proceed to the furthest most room. The holocron will be sitting on a shelf.

</ns5:abstract>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This lore can be found on Coruscant.X:-1333, Y:-4806 This lore object is a clickable holocron that is found in the Senate Tower (First Floor) on Coruscant. After entering the Senate Tower, take the second corridor on the left. Then make your second right, and proceed to the furthest most room. The holocron will be sitting on a shelf.

</rdfs:comment>
