  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Engineering_(Discipline)">
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Engineering (Discipline)</rdfs:label>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Disiplines"/>
    <ns5:abstract xml:lang="en">Engineering is one of the three disciplines avaible for the Sniper Advanced Class. It focuses on Long-Range Tech-Based attacks.
Technology -- and its application for deploying advanced weaponry -- is what sets the Engineering Sniper apart from the rest. A variety of probes at their disposal allows the Engineering Sniper to attack from a distance with explosions, electrical jolts, and waves of destructive plasma designed to eliminate any target.
</ns5:abstract>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Disiplines"/>
    <ns4:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Engineering (Discipline)</ns4:altLabel>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sniper_Disiplines"/>
    <ns6:subject rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Category:Sniper_Disiplines"/>
    <ns3:depiction rdf:resource="http://swtor.wikia.com/wiki/Special:FilePath/Human.jpg"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Engineering is one of the three disciplines avaible for the Sniper Advanced Class. It focuses on Long-Range Tech-Based attacks.
Technology -- and its application for deploying advanced weaponry -- is what sets the Engineering Sniper apart from the rest. A variety of probes at their disposal allows the Engineering Sniper to attack from a distance with explosions, electrical jolts, and waves of destructive plasma designed to eliminate any target.
</rdfs:comment>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
  </rdf:Description>
