    <ns1:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Armor rating redcued by 8% per stack.</ns1:description>
    <ns5:wikiPageWikiLink rdf:resource="http://dbkwik.webdatacommons.org/swtor.wikia.com/resource/Burrower_(Ability)"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Bore is an ability that can be triggered by the Burrower ability.
</rdfs:comment>
